<section id="sec-00" class="mui-paper hero-card section-block"><div class="status-strip"><span class="mui-chip mui-chip-primary" data-i18n-zh="单品定评：全美消费品史上现金流转化率最高的单一快消品母体，以一己之力锁定美国高端卷烟 60.0% 份额" data-i18n-en="Verdict: Highest-margin single CPG cash-flow engine in America, commanding 60.0% of the US premium cigarette segment">单品定评：全美消费品史上现金流转化率最高的单一快消品母体，以一己之力锁定美国高端卷烟 60.0% 份额</span><span class="mui-chip" data-i18n-zh="运营主体：Philip Morris USA (里士满超级工厂) · AGDC 覆盖 &gt;30万零售门头" data-i18n-en="Operating Co.: Philip Morris USA (Richmond Manufacturing Center) · &gt;300K Retail Doors">运营主体：Philip Morris USA (里士满超级工厂) · AGDC 覆盖 &gt;30万零售门头</span><span class="mui-chip mui-chip-success mono" data-i18n-zh="数据基准：2026Q3 季报核验 (2026-10-29)" data-i18n-en="Baseline: Q3 2026 Release (Oct 29, 2026)">数据基准：2026Q3 季报核验 (2026-10-29)</span></div><div class="hero-overline mono"><span data-i18n-zh="FLAGSHIP PRODUCT 01 · 39.5% 全美总份额 × 60.0% 高端烟份额 × 11亿次便利店年客流 × 64.8% 部门调整后 OCI 利润率" data-i18n-en="FLAGSHIP PRODUCT 01 · 39.5% Total Share × 60.0% Premium Share × 1.1B Annual C-Store Trips × 64.8% Smokeable Adj. OCI Margin">FLAGSHIP PRODUCT 01 · 39.5% 全美总份额 × 60.0% 高端烟份额 × 11亿次便利店年客流 × 64.8% 部门调整后 OCI 利润率</span></div><h1 class="hero-h1" data-i18n-rich="hero_h1">Marlboro 万宝路旗舰系列深度剖析：<span class="gradient-accent">销量年降 6%–7% 时代，如何凭四级价格阶梯实现利润率逆势创出 64.8% 新高？</span></h1><p class="lead-prose" data-i18n-rich="lead_prose">在美国成人卷烟行业总销量每年结构性萎缩约 5%–8%、折扣烟全行业占比于 2026 年三季度攀升至 <strong>34.1%</strong> 的严苛逆风中，由 <strong>Philip Morris USA (PM USA)</strong> 制造运营的 <strong>Marlboro（万宝路美国本土系列）</strong> 依然展现出惊人的商业韧性。2026 年三季度，Marlboro 单季国内出货达 <strong>133.24 亿支</strong>（前9月累计 <strong>386.73 亿支</strong>），不仅稳守全美卷烟总零售市场 <strong>39.5%</strong>（超过第2至第8名竞品之和），更凭借价值型高端子线 <strong>Marlboro Cowboy Cut</strong> 铺货约 <strong>100,000 家门店</strong>，将全美高端卷烟（Premium Segment）内部份额逆势推升至 <strong>60.0%</strong>（同比 +0.3pp、环比 +0.4pp）<a class="cite-link" href="https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/Altria-Reports-2026-Third-Quarter-and-Nine-Months-Results-Announces-Expanded-Share-Repurchase-Program-Raises-2026-Full-Year-Earnings-Guidance/default.aspx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Altria Q3'26 Release ↗</a>，叠加进出口退税（Duty Drawback）与门店级 RGM 算法提价，驱动可燃烟草分部前9月调整后 OCI 逆势增长 <strong>4.1%</strong> 至 <strong>$87.66 亿</strong>（利润率高达 <strong>64.8%</strong>）。</p><div class="grid-3" style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><div class="feature-card"><div class="mui-avatar-icon" ><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z"/><path d="M2 17l10 5 10-5"/><path d="M2 12l10 5 10-5"/></svg></div><h3 data-i18n-zh="品牌内四级价格缓冲带（Internal Price Ladder）" data-i18n-en="4-Tier Internal Brand Price Architecture">品牌内四级价格缓冲带（Internal Price Ladder）</h3><p data-i18n-zh="以核心 Red/Gold（~$9.50/包）锚定高净利，用 Special Select、Marlboro Black 与 2025–2026 扩张至 10 万店的 Cowboy Cut 在品牌内部拦截消费降级。" data-i18n-en="Anchors top margins with Red/Gold (~$9.50/pk) while Special Select, Marlboro Black, and 100,000-store Cowboy Cut intercept internal down-trading.">以核心 Red/Gold（~$9.50/包）锚定高净利，用 Special Select、Marlboro Black 与 2025–2026 扩张至 10 万店的 Cowboy Cut 在品牌内部拦截消费降级。</p></div><div class="feature-card"><div class="mui-avatar-icon" style="color: var(--mui-success-text); background: var(--mui-success-bg); border-color: var(--mui-success-border);"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/></svg></div><h3 data-i18n-zh="11 亿次便利店刚性引流与黄金背柜统治权" data-i18n-en="1.1B Annual C-Store Trips &amp; Backbar Dominance">11 亿次便利店刚性引流与黄金背柜统治权</h3><p data-i18n-zh="PM USA 每年直接关联全美便利店 11 亿次到店购物行程，通过 AGDC 商业返利契约锁定收银台正后方最显眼排面，构筑终端物理壁垒。" data-i18n-en="PM USA drives 1.1B annual convenience-store shopper trips, locking down prime eye-level backbar fixtures across &gt;300K retail doors via AGDC contracts.">PM USA 每年直接关联全美便利店 11 亿次到店购物行程，通过 AGDC 商业返利契约锁定收银台正后方最显眼排面，构筑终端物理壁垒。</p></div><div class="feature-card"><div class="mui-avatar-icon" style="color: var(--mui-warning-text); background: var(--mui-warning-bg); border-color: var(--mui-warning-border);"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg></div><h3 data-i18n-zh="代工出口激增与关税退税（Duty Drawback）新杠杆" data-i18n-en="Export Contract Mfg &amp; Duty Drawback Engine">代工出口激增与关税退税（Duty Drawback）新杠杆</h3><p data-i18n-zh="里士满工厂闲置产能转化为合同代工出口（2026Q3 达 15.95亿支，同比翻超5倍），合法激活进口退税红利并于 2026.08 与 PMI 签署互惠代工长约。" data-i18n-en="Converts idle Richmond capacity into contract export sticks (1,595M in Q3&#x27;26, &gt;5x YoY), unlocking federal duty drawback refunds plus an Aug 2026 PMI deal.">里士满工厂闲置产能转化为合同代工出口（2026Q3 达 15.95亿支，同比翻超5倍），合法激活进口退税红利并于 2026.08 与 PMI 签署互惠代工长约。</p></div></div><div class="grid-4"><div class="mui-paper mui-card-interactive kpi-card"><div class="kpi-top"><span class="kpi-label" data-i18n-zh="全美高端卷烟内部份额" data-i18n-en="US Premium Segment Share">全美高端卷烟内部份额</span><span class="mui-chip mui-chip-primary mono" data-i18n-zh="Q3&#x27;26 创近年新高" data-i18n-en="Q3&#x27;26 Record High">Q3&#x27;26 创近年新高</span></div><div class="kpi-value mono" data-i18n-zh="60.0%" data-i18n-en="60.0%">60.0%</div><p class="kpi-desc" data-i18n-rich="kpi_desc_0">同比提升 +0.3pp、环比提升 +0.4pp；全美每卖出 5 包高端烟就有 3 包是 Marlboro <a class="cite-link" href="https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/Altria-Reports-2026-Third-Quarter-and-Nine-Months-Results-Announces-Expanded-Share-Repurchase-Program-Raises-2026-Full-Year-Earnings-Guidance/default.aspx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Q3'26 Table 4 ↗</a></p></div><div class="mui-paper mui-card-interactive kpi-card"><div class="kpi-top"><span class="kpi-label" data-i18n-zh="全美卷烟总零售市场份额" data-i18n-en="Total US Cigarette Share">全美卷烟总零售市场份额</span><span class="mui-chip mui-chip-success mono" data-i18n-zh="环比企稳持平" data-i18n-en="Sequentially Flat">环比企稳持平</span></div><div class="kpi-value mono" data-i18n-zh="39.5%" data-i18n-en="39.5%">39.5%</div><p class="kpi-desc" data-i18n-rich="kpi_desc_1">2026Q2 与 Q3 连续两季稳守 39.5%（2025 全年为 40.5%），支撑 PM USA 总份额升至 45.7% <a class="cite-link" href="https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/Altria-Reports-2026-Third-Quarter-and-Nine-Months-Results-Announces-Expanded-Share-Repurchase-Program-Raises-2026-Full-Year-Earnings-Guidance/default.aspx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Circana Scan ↗</a></p></div><div class="mui-paper mui-card-interactive kpi-card"><div class="kpi-top"><span class="kpi-label" data-i18n-zh="2025全年 / 2026前9月出货量" data-i18n-en="FY25 / 9M26 Shipments">2025全年 / 2026前9月出货量</span><span class="mui-chip mui-chip-warning mono" data-i18n-zh="PM USA 国内销量" data-i18n-en="PM USA Domestic">PM USA 国内销量</span></div><div class="kpi-value mono" data-i18n-zh="54.9B / 38.7B" data-i18n-en="54.9B / 38.7B">54.9B / 38.7B</div><p class="kpi-desc" data-i18n-rich="kpi_desc_2">FY2025 出货 54,933M 支；2026 前9月出货 38,673M 支（Q3 单季 13,324M 支，降幅收窄至 -6.4%）<a class="cite-link" href="https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000007/exhibit991erq42025.htm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">FY25 EX-99.1 ↗</a></p></div><div class="mui-paper mui-card-interactive kpi-card"><div class="kpi-top"><span class="kpi-label" data-i18n-zh="可燃烟草分部调整后 OCI 率" data-i18n-en="Smokeable Adj. OCI Margin">可燃烟草分部调整后 OCI 率</span><span class="mui-chip mui-chip-violet mono" data-i18n-zh="9M&#x27;26 +0.4pp" data-i18n-en="9M&#x27;26 +0.4pp">9M&#x27;26 +0.4pp</span></div><div class="kpi-value mono" data-i18n-zh="64.8%" data-i18n-en="64.8%">64.8%</div><p class="kpi-desc" data-i18n-rich="kpi_desc_3">2026前9月实现不含税营收 $13,532M、调整后 OCI $8,766M（FY2025 全年为 $11,064M / 63.4%）<a class="cite-link" href="https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/Altria-Reports-2026-Third-Quarter-and-Nine-Months-Results-Announces-Expanded-Share-Repurchase-Program-Raises-2026-Full-Year-Earnings-Guidance/default.aspx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Q3'26 Table 2 ↗</a></p></div></div></section><section id="sec-01" class="mui-paper section-block"><div class="sec-header"><div><div class="sec-eyebrow mono">CHAPTER 01 · SUB-BRAND ARCHITECTURE, AMERICAN BLEND CRAFT &amp; RGM</div><h2 class="sec-h2" data-i18n-zh="一、产品子线矩阵与工艺架构：一包美式混合烟如何拆解出四层价格防御纵深？" data-i18n-en="1. Sub-Line Architecture &amp; Craft: Engineering a 4-Tier Price Ladder Inside One Iconic Brand">一、产品子线矩阵与工艺架构：一包美式混合烟如何拆解出四层价格防御纵深？</h2><p class="sec-sub" data-i18n-zh="弗吉尼亚烤烟+白肋烟+东方香料烟经典美式混调 × 四大风味家族 × Marlboro Rewards 数字化私域直连" data-i18n-en="Classic Virginia/Burley/Oriental American blend × 4 flavor families × Marlboro.com 1-to-1 digital promo engine">弗吉尼亚烤烟+白肋烟+东方香料烟经典美式混调 × 四大风味家族 × Marlboro Rewards 数字化私域直连</p></div><span class="mui-chip mui-chip-primary mono" data-i18n-zh="里士满制造中心 · 约 100,000 店 Cowboy Cut 覆盖" data-i18n-en="Richmond Mfg · ~100K Cowboy Cut Doors">里士满制造中心 · 约 100,000 店 Cowboy Cut 覆盖</span></div><div class="arch-blueprint"><div class="arch-hub"><div class="arch-hub-title" data-i18n-zh="Marlboro 母品牌伞状矩阵（锚定高端溢价 ↔ 内部梯度截留价格敏感型老烟民）" data-i18n-en="Marlboro Umbrella Architecture (Full-Margin Core ↔ Value-Tier Retention Shield)">Marlboro 母品牌伞状矩阵（锚定高端溢价 ↔ 内部梯度截留价格敏感型老烟民）</div><div class="arch-hub-sub" data-i18n-zh="弗吉尼亚州里士满（Richmond, VA）全球标杆卷包基地 · 单店级数字优惠券精准投放（避免全盘降价稀释）" data-i18n-en="Richmond, VA manufacturing complex · Store-level digital couponing via Marlboro Rewards without list-price dilution">弗吉尼亚州里士满（Richmond, VA）全球标杆卷包基地 · 单店级数字优惠券精准投放（避免全盘降价稀释）</div></div><div class="arch-nodes"><div class="arch-node"><div class="arch-node-tag mono" data-i18n-zh="CORE FULL FLAVOR · 红万核心" data-i18n-en="CORE FULL FLAVOR · RED">CORE FULL FLAVOR · 红万核心</div><div class="arch-node-name" data-i18n-zh="Marlboro Red &amp; Red Label" data-i18n-en="Marlboro Red &amp; Red Label">Marlboro Red &amp; Red Label</div><div class="arch-node-desc" data-i18n-zh="经典硬盒 85s/100s 醇厚美式混合配方，零促销折让或极低折让，承担全产品线最高单包毛利贡献。" data-i18n-en="Signature King Size 85s/100s American blend with minimal promo discounting, generating PM USA&#x27;s highest unit gross profit.">经典硬盒 85s/100s 醇厚美式混合配方，零促销折让或极低折让，承担全产品线最高单包毛利贡献。</div></div><div class="arch-node"><div class="arch-node-tag mono" data-i18n-zh="SMOOTH &amp; ULTRA · 金银顺滑线" data-i18n-en="SMOOTH &amp; ULTRA · GOLD/SILVER">SMOOTH &amp; ULTRA · 金银顺滑线</div><div class="arch-node-name" data-i18n-zh="Marlboro Gold · Silver Pack" data-i18n-en="Marlboro Gold · Silver Pack">Marlboro Gold · Silver Pack</div><div class="arch-node-desc" data-i18n-zh="激光微孔通风滤嘴调节焦油与烟气柔和度，覆盖都市白领与成熟高粘性客群，复购周期极度稳定。" data-i18n-en="Laser-perforated filter ventilation delivers smoother draw for high-retention urban and suburban adult smokers.">激光微孔通风滤嘴调节焦油与烟气柔和度，覆盖都市白领与成熟高粘性客群，复购周期极度稳定。</div></div><div class="arch-node"><div class="arch-node-tag mono" data-i18n-zh="COOLING FLAVOR · 薄荷醇矩阵" data-i18n-en="COOLING FLAVOR · MENTHOL">COOLING FLAVOR · 薄荷醇矩阵</div><div class="arch-node-name" data-i18n-zh="Menthol · Smooth · Ice · Bold Ice" data-i18n-en="Menthol · Smooth · Ice · Bold">Menthol · Smooth · Ice · Bold Ice</div><div class="arch-node-desc" data-i18n-zh="涵盖传统薄荷与重度冰感细分规格，在部分州风味禁令（如加州）外持续贡献高溢价份额。" data-i18n-en="Spans classic menthol to high-cooling Bold Ice SKUs, capturing high-margin demand outside state flavor-ban jurisdictions.">涵盖传统薄荷与重度冰感细分规格，在部分州风味禁令（如加州）外持续贡献高溢价份额。</div></div><div class="arch-node"><div class="arch-node-tag mono" data-i18n-zh="MID-PREMIUM · 黑万年轻化线" data-i18n-en="MID-PREMIUM · BLACK LINE">MID-PREMIUM · 黑万年轻化线</div><div class="arch-node-name" data-i18n-zh="Marlboro Black &amp; Black Menthol" data-i18n-en="Marlboro Black Special Blend">Marlboro Black &amp; Black Menthol</div><div class="arch-node-desc" data-i18n-zh="浓郁风味+黑色摩登包装+促销折让带（加州合规目录在册 Special Blend 100s），充当首道价格缓冲垫。" data-i18n-en="Bold flavor profile in modern black packaging with targeted promotional buydowns (CA DOJ compliant Special Blend 100s).">浓郁风味+黑色摩登包装+促销折让带（加州合规目录在册 Special Blend 100s），充当首道价格缓冲垫。</div></div><div class="arch-node"><div class="arch-node-tag mono" data-i18n-zh="VALUE PREMIUM · 战略防守新品" data-i18n-en="VALUE PREMIUM · COWBOY CUT">VALUE PREMIUM · 战略防守新品</div><div class="arch-node-name" data-i18n-zh="Marlboro Cowboy Cut (Red/Gold)" data-i18n-en="Marlboro Cowboy Cut">Marlboro Cowboy Cut (Red/Gold)</div><div class="arch-node-desc" data-i18n-zh="2025–2026 重点扩铺至约 100,000 家门店的高性价比子线，助推 Marlboro 高端烟份额重返 60.0% 大关。" data-i18n-en="Expanded across ~100,000 retail stores in 2025–2026 to retain value-conscious Marlboro loyalists and lift premium share to 60.0%.">2025–2026 重点扩铺至约 100,000 家门店的高性价比子线，助推 Marlboro 高端烟份额重返 60.0% 大关。</div></div><div class="arch-node"><div class="arch-node-tag mono" data-i18n-zh="EXPORT &amp; DRAWBACK · 产能变现" data-i18n-en="EXPORT &amp; DRAWBACK · PMI DEAL">EXPORT &amp; DRAWBACK · 产能变现</div><div class="arch-node-name" data-i18n-zh="合同代工出口卷烟 (Contract Export)" data-i18n-en="Contract Mfg Export Sticks">合同代工出口卷烟 (Contract Export)</div><div class="arch-node-desc" data-i18n-zh="2026前9月代工出口飙升至 29.41亿支（同比 &gt;+274%），2026.08 与 PMI 签署自 2027 年起的双向代工协议。" data-i18n-en="Surged &gt;274% YoY to 2,941M sticks in 9M 2026, reinforced by an Aug 2026 mutual contract-manufacturing agreement with PMI.">2026前9月代工出口飙升至 29.41亿支（同比 &gt;+274%），2026.08 与 PMI 签署自 2027 年起的双向代工协议。</div></div></div><div class="arch-platform-bar"><div class="arch-platform"><strong data-i18n-zh="AGDC 零售货架协议（&gt;30万门店黄金背柜主权）" data-i18n-en="AGDC Retail Merchandising Contracts (&gt;300K Stores)">AGDC 零售货架协议（&gt;30万门店黄金背柜主权）</strong><span data-i18n-zh="通过分级陈列返利确保核心子线与 Cowboy Cut 分层陈列，单户便利店年均关联 11 亿次 PM USA 进店行程。" data-i18n-en="Tiered AGDC retail merchandising incentives secure eye-level shelving across &gt;300K stores tied to 1.1B annual PM USA shopper trips.">通过分级陈列返利确保核心子线与 Cowboy Cut 分层陈列，单户便利店年均关联 11 亿次 PM USA 进店行程。</span></div><div class="arch-platform"><strong data-i18n-zh="RGM 营收增长管理与 Marlboro.com 私域补贴引擎" data-i18n-en="Data-Driven RGM &amp; Marlboro.com Digital Couponing">RGM 营收增长管理与 Marlboro.com 私域补贴引擎</strong><span data-i18n-zh="基于各邮编区宏观通胀压力动态调节单包数字立减券，向高净值地区每年提价 2–3 次，向价格敏感区定向滴灌补贴。" data-i18n-en="Zip-code-level RGM elasticity models dynamically calibrate Marlboro.com digital mobile coupons and 2–3 annual list-price hikes.">基于各邮编区宏观通胀压力动态调节单包数字立减券，向高净值地区每年提价 2–3 次，向价格敏感区定向滴灌补贴。</span></div></div></div><div class="grid-3" style="margin-bottom: 16px;"><div class="feature-card"><h3 data-i18n-zh="1. 年度双次至三次目录提价纪律（List Price Cadence）" data-i18n-en="1. Multi-Wave Annual List Price Increases">1. 年度双次至三次目录提价纪律（List Price Cadence）</h3><p data-i18n-rich="pr_desc_0">2026 年 4 月 13 日 PM USA 执行年内第二次卷烟目录提价，Marlboro 全美终端均价已站稳约 <strong>$9.50/包</strong>，以 +7%–9% 净价涨幅轻松跑赢 -6.4% 的销量回落 <a class="cite-link" href="https://www.cspdailynews.com/tobacco/altria-raises-cigarette-prices-second-time-year" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CSP Price Hike ↗</a>。</p></div><div class="feature-card"><h3 data-i18n-zh="2. Cowboy Cut 精准卡位“体面降级”心理" data-i18n-en="2. Cowboy Cut Captures &#x27;Prestige Down-Trading&#x27;">2. Cowboy Cut 精准卡位“体面降级”心理</h3><p data-i18n-rich="pr_desc_1">通胀承压烟民不愿在社交场合掏出廉价杂牌烟盒；Cowboy Cut 保留正统屋顶徽标与美式烟叶基底而下探价格带，铺货约 10 万店即带动高端内份额突破 <strong>60.0%</strong> <a class="cite-link" href="https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/Altria-Reports-2026-Third-Quarter-and-Nine-Months-Results-Announces-Expanded-Share-Repurchase-Program-Raises-2026-Full-Year-Earnings-Guidance/default.aspx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Q3'26 Earnings ↗</a>。</p></div><div class="feature-card"><h3 data-i18n-zh="3. 联邦关税退税（Duty Drawback）增厚单支净利" data-i18n-en="3. Federal Duty Drawback Manufacturing Arbitrage">3. 联邦关税退税（Duty Drawback）增厚单支净利</h3><p data-i18n-rich="pr_desc_2">通过为海外第三方合同代工出口卷烟（Q3'26 达 <strong>1,595M 支</strong> vs 去年同期 311M 支），合法申领进口卷烟税费退还，仅 Q3 单季即贡献约 <strong>$124M</strong> 增量收益 <a class="cite-link" href="https://www.investing.com/news/stock-market-news/altria-philip-morris-international-sign-contract-manufacturing-deals-4873428" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">PMI Mfg Deal ↗</a>。</p></div></div><div class="mui-alert" style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><span class="mui-chip mui-chip-primary mono" data-i18n-zh="实绩核验" data-i18n-en="VERIFIED">实绩核验</span><div data-i18n-rich="ch1_alert"><strong>核心反直觉事实核验：</strong>尽管 Marlboro 国内报告出货量从 2024 年的 625.84 亿支回落至 2025 年的 549.33 亿支（-12.2%），再到 2026 前9月的 386.73 亿支（-7.2%，Q3 收窄至 -6.4%），但奥驰亚可燃烟草分部调整后 OCI 反而从 2024 年的 <strong>$109.22 亿（61.6% 利润率）</strong> 连创新高至 2025 年的 <strong>$110.64 亿（63.4%）</strong>，并在 2026 前9月再涨 4.1% 达 <strong>$87.66 亿（64.8% 利润率）</strong> <a class="cite-link" href="https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/Altria-Reports-2026-Third-Quarter-and-Nine-Months-Results-Announces-Expanded-Share-Repurchase-Program-Raises-2026-Full-Year-Earnings-Guidance/default.aspx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Altria Q3'26 Table 2 ↗</a>。</div></div><div class="chart-card" style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><div class="chart-toolbar"><div><div id="ch1ChartTitle" class="chart-title">Marlboro 年度/阶段国内出货量（十亿支）vs 全美高端卷烟内部份额（%）</div><div id="ch1ChartSub" class="chart-caption">销量随行业温和下行，但凭 Cowboy Cut 与 RGM 定价策略，高端烟内部统治份额在 2026Q3 升至 60.0%</div></div><div class="mui-segmented" role="tablist"><button type="button" id="ch1TabA" class="mui-seg-btn active" data-ch1-view="viewA" data-i18n-zh="视图A: 出货量与高端份额剪刀差" data-i18n-en="View A: Volume vs. Premium Share">视图A: 出货量与高端份额剪刀差</button><button type="button" id="ch1TabB" class="mui-seg-btn" data-ch1-view="viewB" data-i18n-zh="视图B: 季度国内与代工出口对比" data-i18n-en="View B: Quarterly Volume &amp; Export">视图B: 季度国内与代工出口对比</button></div></div><div id="ch1AxisMeta" class="chart-axis-meta mono"></div><div class="canvas-stage"><canvas id="chartCh1"></canvas></div><div class="chart-legend" id="ch1Legend"><button type="button" class="legend-pill" data-ch1-series="s1"><span id="ch1Dot1" class="legend-dot" style="background:var(--chart-c1);"></span><span id="ch1Leg1"></span></button><button type="button" class="legend-pill" data-ch1-series="s2"><span id="ch1Dot2" class="legend-dot" style="background:var(--chart-c2);"></span><span id="ch1Leg2"></span></button></div></div><div class="grid-2"><div class="matrix-card"><div class="matrix-card-head"><div class="matrix-card-title" data-i18n-zh="MSA 大和解协议与 FDA 监管构筑“无广告垄断锁”" data-i18n-en="MSA Ad Ban &amp; FDA Pre-Market Freeze Lock In #1 Share">MSA 大和解协议与 FDA 监管构筑“无广告垄断锁”</div><span class="mui-chip mui-chip-primary mono" data-i18n-zh="零新品牌挑战可能" data-i18n-en="Frozen Brand Share">零新品牌挑战可能</span></div><p class="matrix-card-body" data-i18n-rich="mc_body_0">1998 年州政府大和解协议（MSA，2025 全年可燃分部计提和解金 <strong>$3,028M</strong>）与 2009 年《家庭吸烟预防与烟草控制法》禁止了几乎所有大众媒介卷烟广告，客观上彻底锁死了挑战者通过广告颠覆 Marlboro 心智的通道 <a class="cite-link" href="https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000007/exhibit991erq42025.htm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">FY25 Schedule 5 ↗</a>。</p><button type="button" class="collapse-toggle" data-collapse-target="matrixDetail1"><span>展开微观机制拆解</span> <span>⌄</span></button><div id="matrixDetail1" class="collapse-panel" data-i18n-zh="在户外、电视与社交媒体烟草广告全面禁绝的制度环境下，零售收银台背柜（Backbar）与存量烟民包装视觉惯性成为唯一品牌触点，使 Marlboro 的 39.5% 市场份额具备极高的准入排他性。" data-i18n-en="With TV, billboard, and social ads prohibited, physical retail backbar visibility and adult smoker habit become the sole brand touchpoints, turning regulatory restrictions into an insurmountable incumbent moat.">在户外、电视与社交媒体烟草广告全面禁绝的制度环境下，零售收银台背柜（Backbar）与存量烟民包装视觉惯性成为唯一品牌触点，使 Marlboro 的 39.5% 市场份额具备极高的准入排他性。</div></div><div class="matrix-card"><div class="matrix-card-head"><div class="matrix-card-title" data-i18n-zh="PMI 双向代工长约激活里士满超级制造底座" data-i18n-en="August 2026 PMI Mutual Contract-Manufacturing Pact">PMI 双向代工长约激活里士满超级制造底座</div><span class="mui-chip mui-chip-success mono" data-i18n-zh="2027 正式履约" data-i18n-en="Starts FY2027">2027 正式履约</span></div><p class="matrix-card-body" data-i18n-rich="mc_body_1">2026 年 8 月 24 日，奥驰亚与菲莫国际（PMI）正式签署双向合同制造协议：自 2027 年起 PM USA 将为 PMI 部分海外市场代工传统卷烟，同时强化进口退税闭环并摊薄里士满工厂单支固定折旧 <a class="cite-link" href="https://www.investing.com/news/stock-market-news/altria-philip-morris-international-sign-contract-manufacturing-deals-4873428" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Investing.com ↗</a>。</p><button type="button" class="collapse-toggle" data-collapse-target="matrixDetail2"><span>展开微观机制拆解</span> <span>⌄</span></button><div id="matrixDetail2" class="collapse-panel" data-i18n-zh="随着美国本土销量自然递减，引入 PMI 海外出口订单不仅直接拉升产能稼动率，还能与联邦关税退税（Duty Drawback）条款协同，在零国内份额稀释前提下创造高确定性美元现金流。" data-i18n-en="Export contract volume offsets domestic secular unit contraction, keeping per-stick conversion costs low while unlocking substantial federal tax/duty refunds.">随着美国本土销量自然递减，引入 PMI 海外出口订单不仅直接拉升产能稼动率，还能与联邦关税退税（Duty Drawback）条款协同，在零国内份额稀释前提下创造高确定性美元现金流。</div></div></div></section><section id="sec-02" class="mui-paper section-block"><div class="sec-header"><div><div class="sec-eyebrow mono">CHAPTER 02 · FOUR PRICING-POWER PILLARS &amp; 5-AXIS PRODUCT RADAR</div><h2 class="sec-h2" data-i18n-zh="二、四大护城河支柱：为什么 Marlboro 能长期维持 64%+ 营业利润率？" data-i18n-en="2. Four Moat Pillars: How Marlboro Sustains 64%+ Operating Margin Power">二、四大护城河支柱：为什么 Marlboro 能长期维持 64%+ 营业利润率？</h2><p class="sec-sub" data-i18n-zh="点击左侧任一核心产品支柱卡片，联动高亮右侧五维单品护城河雷达图与配方/渠道机制拆解" data-i18n-en="Click any product pillar card on the left to highlight the corresponding axis on the 5-Axis Product Moat Radar">点击左侧任一核心产品支柱卡片，联动高亮右侧五维单品护城河雷达图与配方/渠道机制拆解</p></div><span class="mui-chip mui-chip-success" data-i18n-zh="护城河评级：极宽 (60.0% 高端垄断 · 极低价格弹性)" data-i18n-en="Moat Rating: Wide (60.0% Premium Share · Inelastic Pricing)">护城河评级：极宽 (60.0% 高端垄断 · 极低价格弹性)</span></div><div class="grid-radar"><div class="pillar-stack" id="pillarStack"><button type="button" class="pillar-card active" data-pillar="0"><div class="pillar-head"><span class="pillar-title" data-i18n-zh="01 · 极低需求价格弹性与每年 2–3 次提价权" data-i18n-en="01 · Inelastic Adult Loyalty &amp; Multi-Wave Price Hikes">01 · 极低需求价格弹性与每年 2–3 次提价权</span><span class="mui-chip mui-chip-primary mono" data-i18n-zh="~$9.50 / 包均价" data-i18n-en="~$9.50 / Pack Avg">~$9.50 / 包均价</span></div><p class="pillar-desc" data-i18n-zh="尼古丁生理依赖叠加百年红白屋顶视觉符号，使每 10% 终端净提价仅伴随约 3%–5% 品牌销量流失，净收入持续为正。" data-i18n-en="Physiological nicotine inelasticity plus century-old Red Roof brand equity keep volume attrition around -3% to -5% per +10% net price hike.">尼古丁生理依赖叠加百年红白屋顶视觉符号，使每 10% 终端净提价仅伴随约 3%–5% 品牌销量流失，净收入持续为正。</p></button><button type="button" class="pillar-card" data-pillar="1"><div class="pillar-head"><span class="pillar-title" data-i18n-zh="02 · 门店级 RGM 算法与 Cowboy Cut 内部截留" data-i18n-en="02 · Store-Level RGM &amp; Cowboy Cut Retention">02 · 门店级 RGM 算法与 Cowboy Cut 内部截留</span><span class="mui-chip mui-chip-success mono" data-i18n-zh="10万门店精准防守" data-i18n-en="100K-Store Shield">10万门店精准防守</span></div><p class="pillar-desc" data-i18n-zh="放弃一刀切全美促销，改用邮政编码级消费者弹性模型动态调配 Marlboro Black 与 Cowboy Cut 货架价差。" data-i18n-en="Replaces blunt nationwide promos with zip-code RGM algorithms dynamically tuning price gaps across Red, Black, and Cowboy Cut.">放弃一刀切全美促销，改用邮政编码级消费者弹性模型动态调配 Marlboro Black 与 Cowboy Cut 货架价差。</p></button><button type="button" class="pillar-card" data-pillar="2"><div class="pillar-head"><span class="pillar-title" data-i18n-zh="03 · AGDC 三十万零售终端与 11 亿次便利店流量杠杆" data-i18n-en="03 · AGDC 300K-Door Reach &amp; 1.1B C-Store Trips">03 · AGDC 三十万零售终端与 11 亿次便利店流量杠杆</span><span class="mui-chip mui-chip-warning mono" data-i18n-zh="55% 忠诚篮子渗透" data-i18n-en="55% Loyalty Basket">55% 忠诚篮子渗透</span></div><p class="pillar-desc" data-i18n-zh="70% 的成年尼古丁消费者每日光顾便利店；Marlboro 是全美便利店老板不可替代的第一引流刚需品。" data-i18n-en="7 in 10 adult nicotine buyers visit c-stores daily, making Marlboro the #1 non-negotiable foot-traffic anchor for US retailers.">70% 的成年尼古丁消费者每日光顾便利店；Marlboro 是全美便利店老板不可替代的第一引流刚需品。</p></button><button type="button" class="pillar-card" data-pillar="3"><div class="pillar-head"><span class="pillar-title" data-i18n-zh="04 · 极低资本开支与出口退税制造协同" data-i18n-en="04 · Ultra-Light CapEx &amp; Export Duty Drawback">04 · 极低资本开支与出口退税制造协同</span><span class="mui-chip mui-chip-violet mono" data-i18n-zh="FCF 印钞机底座" data-i18n-en="Cash Cow Core">FCF 印钞机底座</span></div><p class="pillar-desc" data-i18n-zh="高速卷接包产线高度成熟，全集团年 CapEx 仅 $375M–$450M，绝大部分 OCI 直接转化为分红与回购自由现金流。" data-i18n-en="Mature high-speed making/packing lines keep total company CapEx at just $375M–$450M/yr, converting OCI directly into dividends and buybacks.">高速卷接包产线高度成熟，全集团年 CapEx 仅 $375M–$450M，绝大部分 OCI 直接转化为分红与回购自由现金流。</p></button><div id="pillarFocusNote" class="mui-alert" style="margin-top: 4px;"><div><strong>当前选中支柱解读（01 极低价格弹性）：</strong>2026 年 4 月 PM USA 完成年内第二次提价，依靠单包净实现收入提升与促销精细化，推动 2026Q3 不含税可燃烟营收逆势增长 <strong>+3.7%</strong> 至 $4,762M <a class="cite-link" href="https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/Altria-Reports-2026-Third-Quarter-and-Nine-Months-Results-Announces-Expanded-Share-Repurchase-Program-Raises-2026-Full-Year-Earnings-Guidance/default.aspx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Q3'26 Release ↗</a>。</div></div></div><div class="chart-card" style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:space-between;"><div><div class="chart-title" data-i18n-zh="美国卷烟核心旗舰品牌五维竞争力雷达图（10分制）" data-i18n-en="5-Axis US Cigarette Brand Moat Radar (10-Point Scale)">美国卷烟核心旗舰品牌五维竞争力雷达图（10分制）</div><div class="chart-caption" data-i18n-zh="点击下方图例胶囊可单独开关对比曲线，悬停顶点查看 10 分制精确评分明细" data-i18n-en="Click legend pills below to toggle benchmark curves; hover vertices for exact 10-pt scores">点击下方图例胶囊可单独开关对比曲线，悬停顶点查看 10 分制精确评分明细</div></div><div class="canvas-stage-tall"><canvas id="chartRadar"></canvas></div><div class="chart-legend" id="radarLegend"><button type="button" class="legend-pill" data-radar-key="s0"><span class="legend-dot" style="background:#0073E6;"></span><span data-i18n-zh="Marlboro 万宝路 (39.5%总份额 · 60%高端)" data-i18n-en="Marlboro (39.5% Share · 60% Premium)">Marlboro 万宝路 (39.5%总份额 · 60%高端)</span></button><button type="button" class="legend-pill" data-radar-key="s1"><span class="legend-dot" style="background:#16A34A;"></span><span data-i18n-zh="Newport 新港 (BAT/雷诺薄荷醇旗舰)" data-i18n-en="Newport (BAT/Reynolds Menthol)">Newport 新港 (BAT/雷诺薄荷醇旗舰)</span></button><button type="button" class="legend-pill" data-radar-key="s2"><span class="legend-dot" style="background:#D97706;"></span><span data-i18n-zh="Natural American Spirit (雷诺超高端有机线)" data-i18n-en="Natural American Spirit (Super-Premium)">Natural American Spirit (雷诺超高端有机线)</span></button></div></div></div></section><section id="sec-03" class="mui-paper section-block"><div class="sec-header"><div><div class="sec-eyebrow mono">CHAPTER 03 · U.S. CIGARETTE BRAND PEER BENCHMARKING</div><h2 class="sec-h2" data-i18n-zh="三、全美卷烟核心品牌横向对比：高端霸主、薄荷醇劲敌与深折黑马" data-i18n-en="3. US Cigarette Brand Matrix: Flagship Leader vs. Premium &amp; Discount Rivals">三、全美卷烟核心品牌横向对比：高端霸主、薄荷醇劲敌与深折黑马</h2><p class="sec-sub" data-i18n-zh="支持按单品名、所属烟草巨头、尼古丁递送形态、出货规模或 FDA 授权状态实时检索高亮与分类过滤" data-i18n-en="Search and highlight in real time by brand, parent company, nicotine delivery format, shipments, or FDA status">支持按单品名、所属烟草巨头、尼古丁递送形态、出货规模或 FDA 授权状态实时检索高亮与分类过滤</p></div><span id="peerCountBadge" class="mui-chip mui-chip-primary mono"></span></div><div class="datagrid-toolbar"><input type="search" id="peerSearchInput" class="mui-input-outlined" placeholder="搜索单品、所属厂商、配方工艺、出货量或零售份额…" data-ph-zh="搜索单品、所属厂商、配方工艺、出货量或零售份额…" data-ph-en="Search brand, manufacturer, formulation, volume, or retail share…" /><div class="mui-segmented" role="group"><button type="button" id="peerFilterAll" class="mui-seg-btn active" data-peer-filter="all" data-i18n-zh="全部品类标杆" data-i18n-en="All Category Peers">全部品类标杆</button><button type="button" id="peerFilterInternal" class="mui-seg-btn" data-peer-filter="altria" data-i18n-zh="奥驰亚产品矩阵" data-i18n-en="Altria Portfolio">奥驰亚产品矩阵</button><button type="button" id="peerFilterExternal" class="mui-seg-btn" data-peer-filter="external" data-i18n-zh="外部巨头竞品参照" data-i18n-en="External Rivals">外部巨头竞品参照</button></div></div><div class="table-wrap" style="margin-bottom: 20px;"><table class="mui-table"><thead><tr><th data-i18n-zh="单品与所属厂商" data-i18n-en="Product &amp; Manufacturer">单品与所属厂商</th><th data-i18n-zh="零售价位与渠道定位" data-i18n-en="Price Tier &amp; Channel Role">零售价位与渠道定位</th><th data-i18n-zh="配方工艺与包装规格" data-i18n-en="Formulation &amp; Pack Architecture">配方工艺与包装规格</th><th data-i18n-zh="出货体量与全美零售份额" data-i18n-en="Shipments &amp; US Retail Share">出货体量与全美零售份额</th><th data-i18n-zh="FDA 合规与渠道壁垒" data-i18n-en="FDA Status &amp; Shelf Moat">FDA 合规与渠道壁垒</th><th data-i18n-zh="相对本单品的竞争启示" data-i18n-en="Competitive Takeaway">相对本单品的竞争启示</th></tr></thead><tbody id="peerTableBody"></tbody></table></div><div class="chart-card"><div class="chart-toolbar"><div><div class="chart-title" data-i18n-zh="2026Q3 全美卷烟零售市场份额结构拆解：Marlboro 单一品牌 vs 行业格局（%）" data-i18n-en="Q3 2026 US Cigarette Retail Share Breakdown: Marlboro vs. Segment &amp; Rival Shares (%)">2026Q3 全美卷烟零售市场份额结构拆解：Marlboro 单一品牌 vs 行业格局（%）</div><div class="chart-caption" data-i18n-zh="数据核验自奥驰亚 2026Q3 财报（Circana / MSAi STARS 零售扫描）及 JT/Vector 披露基准" data-i18n-en="Verified via Altria Q3 2026 Earnings Release (Circana / MSAi STARS) and JT/Vector acquisition disclosures">数据核验自奥驰亚 2026Q3 财报（Circana / MSAi STARS 零售扫描）及 JT/Vector 披露基准</div></div><span class="mui-chip mui-chip-success mono" data-i18n-zh="PM USA 合计揽下 45.7% 市场" data-i18n-en="PM USA Commands 45.7% Total Share">PM USA 合计揽下 45.7% 市场</span></div><div class="canvas-stage-bars"><canvas id="chartBars"></canvas></div><div class="chart-legend"><span class="mui-chip mui-chip-success mono" data-i18n-zh="蓝色/绿色：Marlboro 与 PM USA 内部品牌矩阵零售份额 (%)" data-i18n-en="Blue / Green: Marlboro &amp; PM USA Internal Portfolio Retail Share (%)">蓝色/绿色：Marlboro 与 PM USA 内部品牌矩阵零售份额 (%)</span><span class="mui-chip mui-chip-violet mono" data-i18n-zh="紫色/琥珀：全美行业折扣大盘及外部竞品份额参照 (虚线 = 30% 统治线)" data-i18n-en="Purple / Amber: Industry Discount &amp; Rival Benchmarks (Dashed = 30% Line)">紫色/琥珀：全美行业折扣大盘及外部竞品份额参照 (虚线 = 30% 统治线)</span></div></div></section><section id="sec-04" class="mui-paper section-block"><div class="sec-header"><div><div class="sec-eyebrow mono">CHAPTER 04 · PACK UNIT ECONOMICS &amp; MULTI-YEAR OCI SIMULATOR</div><h2 class="sec-h2" data-i18n-zh="四、单包经济学与现金流推演：拆解 $9.50 终端零售价背后的 64.8% 营业利润率" data-i18n-en="4. Pack Economics &amp; OCI Simulator: Inside a $9.50 Pack and 64.8% Operating Margin">四、单包经济学与现金流推演：拆解 $9.50 终端零售价背后的 64.8% 营业利润率</h2><p class="sec-sub" data-i18n-zh="扣除联邦/州消费税、零售渠道返利与 MSA 大和解费用后，PM USA 单包净利仍冠绝全球快消品" data-i18n-en="Even after federal/state excise taxes, trade promos, and MSA settlement charges, per-pack OCI leads global CPG">扣除联邦/州消费税、零售渠道返利与 MSA 大和解费用后，PM USA 单包净利仍冠绝全球快消品</p></div><span class="mui-chip mui-chip-warning mono" data-i18n-zh="9M&#x27;26 可燃调整后 OCI $8,766M (+4.1%)" data-i18n-en="9M&#x27;26 Smokeable Adj. OCI $8,766M (+4.1%)">9M&#x27;26 可燃调整后 OCI $8,766M (+4.1%)</span></div><div class="grid-4" style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><div class="mui-paper kpi-card"><span class="kpi-label mono" data-i18n-zh="TERMINAL PACK PRICE" data-i18n-en="TERMINAL PACK PRICE">TERMINAL PACK PRICE</span><div class="kpi-value mono" style="color:var(--mui-primary-lighter);" data-i18n-zh="~$9.50 / 包" data-i18n-en="~$9.50 / Pack">~$9.50 / 包</div><p class="kpi-desc" data-i18n-zh="全美主流州加权终端零售均价（纽约/加州等高税州可达 $13–$16+，南部低税州约 $7.50–$8.50）。" data-i18n-en="Weighted US retail pack average ($13–$16+ in high-tax NY/CA corridors; ~$7.50–$8.50 in lower-tax Southern states).">全美主流州加权终端零售均价（纽约/加州等高税州可达 $13–$16+，南部低税州约 $7.50–$8.50）。</p></div><div class="mui-paper kpi-card"><span class="kpi-label mono" data-i18n-zh="MSA &amp; FDA STATUTORY" data-i18n-en="MSA &amp; FDA STATUTORY">MSA &amp; FDA STATUTORY</span><div class="kpi-value mono" style="color:var(--mui-success-text);" data-i18n-zh="$3.27B / 年" data-i18n-en="$3.27B / Yr">$3.27B / 年</div><p class="kpi-desc" data-i18n-zh="FY2025 可燃烟分部计提州政府和解金 $3,028M + FDA 监管费 $245M（随销量下降按比例自然减少）。" data-i18n-en="FY2025 Smokeable accrued $3,028M in state MSA settlement payments plus $245M in FDA user fees (scaling down proportionally with volume).">FY2025 可燃烟分部计提州政府和解金 $3,028M + FDA 监管费 $245M（随销量下降按比例自然减少）。</p></div><div class="mui-paper kpi-card"><span class="kpi-label mono" data-i18n-zh="DUTY DRAWBACK LIFT" data-i18n-en="DUTY DRAWBACK LIFT">DUTY DRAWBACK LIFT</span><div class="kpi-value mono" style="color:var(--mui-warning-text);" data-i18n-zh="$124M / 季" data-i18n-en="$124M in Q3&#x27;26">$124M / 季</div><p class="kpi-desc" data-i18n-zh="2026Q3 凭借代工出口卷烟放量（15.95亿支）兑现 $124M 关税退税，直接增厚分部毛利与 OCI。" data-i18n-en="Export volume surge (1,595M sticks in Q3&#x27;26) unlocked ~$124M in federal excise duty drawback benefits directly accretive to OCI.">2026Q3 凭借代工出口卷烟放量（15.95亿支）兑现 $124M 关税退税，直接增厚分部毛利与 OCI。</p></div><div class="mui-paper kpi-card"><span class="kpi-label mono" data-i18n-zh="ADJUSTED OCI MARGIN" data-i18n-en="ADJUSTED OCI MARGIN">ADJUSTED OCI MARGIN</span><div class="kpi-value mono" style="color:var(--mui-violet-text);" data-i18n-zh="64.8% (9M&#x27;26)" data-i18n-en="64.8% (9M&#x27;26)">64.8% (9M&#x27;26)</div><p class="kpi-desc" data-i18n-zh="从 FY2024 的 61.6% → FY2025 的 63.4% → 2026前9月的 64.8%，连续三年实现利润率跃升。" data-i18n-en="Expanded for three straight years: 61.6% (FY24) → 63.4% (FY25) → 64.8% (9M 2026) via RGM discipline and cost control.">从 FY2024 的 61.6% → FY2025 的 63.4% → 2026前9月的 64.8%，连续三年实现利润率跃升。</p></div></div><div class="chart-card"><div class="chart-toolbar"><div><div class="chart-title" data-i18n-zh="奥驰亚可燃烟草分部（Marlboro 领衔）不含税净营收 vs 调整后 OCI 利润率演进" data-i18n-en="Smokeable Segment (Anchored by Marlboro) Revenue Net of Excise ($B) vs. Adj. OCI Margin (%)">奥驰亚可燃烟草分部（Marlboro 领衔）不含税净营收 vs 调整后 OCI 利润率演进</div><div class="chart-caption" data-i18n-zh="2024 全年至 2026 前9月年化实绩：净提价与退税红利驱动营业利润率稳步突破 64.8%" data-i18n-en="FY2024 through 9M 2026 annualized: RGM pricing and duty drawback lifted Adjusted OCI margin to 64.8%">2024 全年至 2026 前9月年化实绩：净提价与退税红利驱动营业利润率稳步突破 64.8%</div></div><span class="mui-chip mui-chip-primary mono" data-i18n-zh="连续跨周期站稳 &gt;60% 目标线" data-i18n-en="Consistently Above 60% Enterprise Floor">连续跨周期站稳 &gt;60% 目标线</span></div><div class="chart-axis-meta mono"><span style="color:var(--chart-c1);" data-i18n-zh="■ 左轴：不含消费税净营收 ($ 十亿美元)" data-i18n-en="■ Left Axis: Revenue Net of Excise ($B)">■ 左轴：不含消费税净营收 ($ 十亿美元)</span><span style="color:var(--chart-c2);" data-i18n-zh="● 右轴：调整后 OCI 营业利润率 (%)" data-i18n-en="● Right Axis: Adjusted OCI Margin (%)">● 右轴：调整后 OCI 营业利润率 (%)</span></div><div class="canvas-stage"><canvas id="chartEps"></canvas></div><div class="chart-legend" id="epsLegend"><button type="button" class="legend-pill" data-eps-series="rev"><span class="legend-dot" style="background:var(--chart-c1);"></span><span data-i18n-zh="不含消费税净营收 (左轴 · $B)" data-i18n-en="Rev Net of Excise (Left · $B)">不含消费税净营收 (左轴 · $B)</span></button><button type="button" class="legend-pill" data-eps-series="oci"><span class="legend-dot" style="background:var(--chart-c2);"></span><span data-i18n-zh="调整后 OCI 利润率 (右轴 · %)" data-i18n-en="Adjusted OCI Margin (Right · %)">调整后 OCI 利润率 (右轴 · %)</span></button><span class="mui-chip mui-chip-warning mono" data-i18n-zh="--- 60.0% 集团2028目标底线" data-i18n-en="--- 60.0% 2028 Goal Floor">--- 60.0% 集团2028目标底线</span></div></div><div class="simulator-grid"><div class="sim-controls"><div><div class="sec-eyebrow mono" style="margin-bottom:2px;">INTERACTIVE PRODUCT UNIT-ECONOMICS &amp; OCI SIMULATOR</div><h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:800;" data-i18n-zh="Marlboro 产品线多年期累计 OCI 现金流与退税/提价敏感度模拟器" data-i18n-en="Marlboro Multi-Year Cumulative OCI &amp; RGM / Drawback Simulator">Marlboro 产品线多年期累计 OCI 现金流与退税/提价敏感度模拟器</h3></div><label class="mui-switch-row" for="simDripToggle"><div><div style="font-size:0.84rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--text-primary);" data-i18n-zh="开启 RGM 净提价跑赢通胀 + PMI 代工出口关税退税协同 (+16% 净现金流增厚)" data-i18n-en="Enable RGM Net Price Elasticity + PMI Export Duty Drawback (+16% Lift)">开启 RGM 净提价跑赢通胀 + PMI 代工出口关税退税协同 (+16% 净现金流增厚)</div><div style="font-size:0.74rem;color:var(--text-secondary);" data-i18n-zh="模拟每年 +7%–8% 目录净提价对冲销量自然下滑，并叠加里士满代工出口退税收益" data-i18n-en="Models +7%–8% annual net price realization offsetting secular stick decline plus export duty refunds">模拟每年 +7%–8% 目录净提价对冲销量自然下滑，并叠加里士满代工出口退税收益</div></div><input type="checkbox" id="simDripToggle" checked /></label><div class="preset-stack" role="group"><button type="button" class="preset-btn" data-preset="p1"><span data-i18n-zh="① 悲观压力情景 (非法电子烟分流加剧+提价受阻)" data-i18n-en="① Stress Case (Steeper Volume Erosion)">① 悲观压力情景 (非法电子烟分流加剧+提价受阻)</span><span class="mono" data-i18n-zh="23亿包 · 5年" data-i18n-en="2.3B Pks · 5Y">23亿包 · 5年</span></button><button type="button" class="preset-btn active" data-preset="p2"><span data-i18n-zh="② 核心基准情景 (Cowboy Cut稳份额 + PMI代工退税)" data-i18n-en="② Base Case (RGM + Cowboy Cut + PMI Deal)">② 核心基准情景 (Cowboy Cut稳份额 + PMI代工退税)</span><span class="mono" data-i18n-zh="26亿包 · 5年" data-i18n-en="2.6B Pks · 5Y">26亿包 · 5年</span></button><button type="button" class="preset-btn" data-preset="p3"><span data-i18n-zh="③ 强化执法情景 (FDA严打非法一次性雾化回流可燃烟)" data-i18n-en="③ Bull Case (Illicit Vape Crackdown + Price Lift)">③ 强化执法情景 (FDA严打非法一次性雾化回流可燃烟)</span><span class="mono" data-i18n-zh="28亿包 · 7年" data-i18n-en="2.8B Pks · 7Y">28亿包 · 7年</span></button></div><div class="slider-group"><div class="slider-head"><span data-i18n-zh="首年基准国内出货规模 (亿包 · 1包=20支)" data-i18n-en="Year-1 Domestic Volume (100M Packs · 20 sticks/pk)">首年基准国内出货规模 (亿包 · 1包=20支)</span><span id="simPrincipalLabel" class="slider-val mono"></span></div><input type="range" id="simPrincipalSlider" class="mui-slider" min="18" max="30" step="1" value="26" /></div><div class="slider-group"><div class="slider-head"><span data-i18n-zh="出厂单包调整后 OCI 净利实现 (USD / 包)" data-i18n-en="Net Manufacturer OCI per Pack (USD / Pack)">出厂单包调整后 OCI 净利实现 (USD / 包)</span><span id="simCagrLabel" class="slider-val mono"></span></div><input type="range" id="simCagrSlider" class="mui-slider" min="2.8" max="5.0" step="0.1" value="3.9" /></div><div class="slider-group"><div class="slider-head"><span data-i18n-zh="代工出口与关税退税年均增量贡献 ($M / 年)" data-i18n-en="Annual Export Mfg &amp; Duty Drawback Lift ($M/yr)">代工出口与关税退税年均增量贡献 ($M / 年)</span><span id="simLiveArpuLabel" class="slider-val mono"></span></div><input type="range" id="simLiveArpuSlider" class="mui-slider" min="100" max="650" step="25" value="400" /></div><div class="slider-group"><div class="slider-head"><span data-i18n-zh="测算运营周期 (Years)" data-i18n-en="Projection Horizon (Years)">测算运营周期 (Years)</span><span id="simYearsLabel" class="slider-val mono"></span></div><input type="range" id="simYearsSlider" class="mui-slider" min="3" max="10" step="1" value="5" /></div></div><div class="sim-output-panel"><div class="sim-readouts"><div class="sim-stat-box"><div class="sim-stat-label" data-i18n-zh="预估周期累计综合 OCI 总贡献 (Total Value)" data-i18n-en="Projected Cumulative Product OCI &amp; Lift">预估周期累计综合 OCI 总贡献 (Total Value)</div><div id="simEndingVal" class="sim-stat-num mono" style="color:var(--mui-primary-lighter);">$0M</div></div><div class="sim-stat-box"><div class="sim-stat-label" data-i18n-zh="相对年均 $350M 制造维护资本开支覆盖倍数" data-i18n-en="Coverage Multiple vs. $350M Annual Maint. CapEx">相对年均 $350M 制造维护资本开支覆盖倍数</div><div id="simMoicVal" class="sim-stat-num mono" style="color:var(--mui-success-text);">0.00x</div></div><div class="sim-stat-box"><div class="sim-stat-label" data-i18n-zh="核心单品内生出货 OCI 基准" data-i18n-en="Core Domestic Shipment OCI">核心单品内生出货 OCI 基准</div><div id="simNetGainVal" class="sim-stat-num mono">$0M</div></div><div class="sim-stat-box"><div class="sim-stat-label" data-i18n-zh="RGM 提价/结构升级/代工协同增量" data-i18n-en="RGM Pricing, Mix &amp; Strategic Lift">RGM 提价/结构升级/代工协同增量</div><div id="simMidVal" class="sim-stat-num mono">$0M</div></div></div><div class="canvas-stage-sim"><canvas id="chartSim"></canvas></div><div class="chart-legend" style="margin-top:4px;"><span class="mui-chip mui-chip-primary mono" data-i18n-zh="━ 叠加 RGM 提价与协同增量累计总价值" data-i18n-en="━ Cumulative OCI + RGM &amp; Strategic Lift">━ 叠加 RGM 提价与协同增量累计总价值</span><span class="mui-chip mono" data-i18n-zh="- - 单纯销量自然演进基准线" data-i18n-en="- - Volume-Only Baseline Trajectory">- - 单纯销量自然演进基准线</span></div><div class="chart-caption" data-i18n-zh="悬停曲线可逐年对比“单纯出货自然演进基准”与叠加“RGM 净提价 + 规格升级 + 代工/国际协同”后的现金流剪刀差。" data-i18n-en="Hover along the curve to compare year-by-year baseline volume OCI against cumulative value with RGM pricing and strategic lift.">悬停曲线可逐年对比“单纯出货自然演进基准”与叠加“RGM 净提价 + 规格升级 + 代工/国际协同”后的现金流剪刀差。</div></div></div><div class="grid-2" style="margin-top: 18px;"><div class="mui-alert mui-alert-success" style="flex-direction:column; gap:8px;"><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;"><span class="mui-chip mui-chip-success mono">STRUCTURAL MOAT</span><strong data-i18n-zh="单品核心商业壁垒与现金流定评" data-i18n-en="Core Product Moat &amp; Cash-Flow Catalysts">单品核心商业壁垒与现金流定评</strong></div><p style="font-size:0.83rem;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.65;" data-i18n-rich="moat_pos"><strong>1. 全球罕见的负销量正利润复利机器：</strong>依靠 60.0% 高端烟绝对心智占有率，Marlboro 无需依赖行业扩容即可通过温和提价持续输出超百亿美元级年化 OCI。<br/><strong>2. 内部阶梯闭环生效：</strong>Cowboy Cut 与 Marlboro Black 在品牌伞内消化了通胀期的消费降级，避免了高端品牌直接打折伤及核心 Red/Gold 价盘。</p></div><div class="mui-alert mui-alert-warning" style="flex-direction:column; gap:8px;"><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;"><span class="mui-chip mui-chip-warning mono">CRITICAL LENS</span><strong data-i18n-zh="单品客观风险、竞争摩擦与跟踪要点" data-i18n-en="Key Product Risks, Friction &amp; Watchpoints">单品客观风险、竞争摩擦与跟踪要点</strong></div><p style="font-size:0.83rem;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.65;" data-i18n-rich="moat_risk"><strong>1. 非法调味一次性电子烟与现代口含袋双重分流：</strong>未获批灰色雾化烟与高强度尼古丁袋仍在持续侵蚀年轻成年烟民基数。<br/><strong>2. 绝对单包价格逼近 $10–$15 心理阈值：</strong>若宏观通胀与州消费税继续大幅叠加，部分边缘客群可能跨级滑向 $5 深折烟或跨境免税渠道。</p></div></div></section><section id="sec-05" class="mui-paper section-block"><div class="sec-header"><div><div class="sec-eyebrow mono">CHAPTER 05 · PRODUCT EVOLUTION TIMELINE &amp; STRATEGIC BATTLES</div><h2 class="sec-h2" data-i18n-zh="五、产品演进脉络与四大关键战役：从西部牛仔图腾到算法化四级价格矩阵" data-i18n-en="5. Product Evolution &amp; Key Case Studies: From 1955 Flip-Top Box to Algorithmic RGM">五、产品演进脉络与四大关键战役：从西部牛仔图腾到算法化四级价格矩阵</h2><p class="sec-sub" data-i18n-zh="复盘 Marlboro 如何跨越广告禁令、PMI 境内外分拆、通胀深折潮与代工退税新纪元" data-i18n-en="Tracing how Marlboro navigated the MSA ad ban, 2008 PMI spin-off, discount waves, and 2026 export manufacturing">复盘 Marlboro 如何跨越广告禁令、PMI 境内外分拆、通胀深折潮与代工退税新纪元</p></div><span class="mui-chip mui-chip-primary mono" data-i18n-zh="1955 硬盒重塑 → 2008 美股独立 → 2026 60%高端新高" data-i18n-en="1955 Flip-Top → 2008 US Split → 2026 60% Premium">1955 硬盒重塑 → 2008 美股独立 → 2026 60%高端新高</span></div><div class="mui-timeline"><div class="timeline-step"><span class="timeline-dot" ></span><div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;margin-bottom:6px;"><strong style="font-size:0.95rem;" data-i18n-zh="第一阶段 · 视觉与配方定型至全美登顶 (1955–1998) —— 翻盖硬盒与美式混合标准确立" data-i18n-en="Act I · Flip-Top Box &amp; American Blend Ascent (1955–1998)">第一阶段 · 视觉与配方定型至全美登顶 (1955–1998) —— 翻盖硬盒与美式混合标准确立</strong><span class="mui-chip mono" data-i18n-zh="1972 起蝉联全美第 1" data-i18n-en="#1 US Brand Since 1972">1972 起蝉联全美第 1</span></div><p style="font-size:0.84rem;color:var(--text-secondary);" data-i18n-rich="act_desc_0">1955 年率先引入防压翻盖硬盒（Flip-Top Box）与红白屋顶几何视觉，自 1972 年起超越温斯顿（Winston）登顶全美销量第一并连续霸榜至今超半个世纪 <a class="cite-link" href="https://www.altria.com/about-altria/our-companies" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Altria Heritage ↗</a>。</p></div><div class="timeline-step"><span class="timeline-dot" style="background:#0284C7;"></span><div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;margin-bottom:6px;"><strong style="font-size:0.95rem;" data-i18n-zh="第二阶段 · MSA 无广告护城河与境内外品牌确权 (1998–2023) —— 专注美国超高毛利本土市场" data-i18n-en="Act II · Post-MSA Backbar Lock &amp; 2008 PMI Spin-Off (1998–2023)">第二阶段 · MSA 无广告护城河与境内外品牌确权 (1998–2023) —— 专注美国超高毛利本土市场</strong><span class="mui-chip mui-chip-primary mono" data-i18n-zh="美国本土商标 100% 归属 PM USA" data-i18n-en="100% US Trademark Ownership">美国本土商标 100% 归属 PM USA</span></div><p style="font-size:0.84rem;color:var(--text-secondary);" data-i18n-rich="act_desc_1">1998 年 MSA 协议终结大众营销战；2008 年菲莫国际（PMI）分拆独立后，PM USA 永久独占美国本土 Marlboro 商标与定价权，并通过 Marlboro Black 与 Rewards 数字化体系深耕单店回报。</p></div><div class="timeline-step"><span class="timeline-dot" style="background:#16A34A;"></span><div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;margin-bottom:6px;"><strong style="font-size:0.95rem;" data-i18n-zh="第三阶段 · Cowboy Cut 防守反击与跨国代工退税跃迁 (2024–2026) —— 高端内份额重上 60.0%" data-i18n-en="Act III · Cowboy Cut Rollout &amp; Export Drawback Era (2024–2026)">第三阶段 · Cowboy Cut 防守反击与跨国代工退税跃迁 (2024–2026) —— 高端内份额重上 60.0%</strong><span class="mui-chip mui-chip-success mono" data-i18n-zh="64.8% 9M&#x27;26 分部 OCI 率" data-i18n-en="64.8% 9M&#x27;26 Adj. OCI Margin">64.8% 9M&#x27;26 分部 OCI 率</span></div><p style="font-size:0.84rem;color:var(--text-secondary);" data-i18n-rich="act_desc_2">面对高通胀与深折烟浪潮，2025–2026 年将 <strong>Marlboro Cowboy Cut</strong> 迅速推向约 100,000 家门店，助推高端烟内部份额于 2026Q3 升至 <strong>60.0%</strong>；同步与 PMI 缔结 2027 互惠代工协议打开退税第二引擎 <a class="cite-link" href="https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/Altria-Reports-2026-Third-Quarter-and-Nine-Months-Results-Announces-Expanded-Share-Repurchase-Program-Raises-2026-Full-Year-Earnings-Guidance/default.aspx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Q3'26 Release ↗</a>。</p></div></div><div class="grid-2" style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><div class="feature-card"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;"><span class="mui-chip mui-chip-error mono" data-i18n-zh="战役 01 · 2025–2026Q3" data-i18n-en="Case 01 · 2025–Q3&#x27;26">战役 01 · 2025–2026Q3</span><span class="mono" style="font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--text-muted);" data-i18n-zh="10万门店侧翼卡位" data-i18n-en="100K-Store Flanker">10万门店侧翼卡位</span></div><h3 data-i18n-zh="Marlboro Cowboy Cut 逆势收复 60% 高端大关" data-i18n-en="Cowboy Cut Propels Premium Share to 60.0%">Marlboro Cowboy Cut 逆势收复 60% 高端大关</h3><p data-i18n-rich="bat_desc_0">在不降低核心红万/金万目录价的前提下，用 Cowboy Cut 精准承接对价格敏感但眷恋万宝路口感的烟民，使高端内份额环比提升 +0.4pp 至 60.0% <a class="cite-link" href="https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/Altria-Reports-2026-Third-Quarter-and-Nine-Months-Results-Announces-Expanded-Share-Repurchase-Program-Raises-2026-Full-Year-Earnings-Guidance/default.aspx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Q3'26 Release ↗</a>。</p></div><div class="feature-card"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;"><span class="mui-chip mui-chip-success mono" data-i18n-zh="战役 02 · 2026-04-13" data-i18n-en="Case 02 · Apr 13, 2026">战役 02 · 2026-04-13</span><span class="mono" style="font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--text-muted);" data-i18n-zh="非对称结构性提价" data-i18n-en="Asymmetric Price Hike">非对称结构性提价</span></div><h3 data-i18n-zh="年内二次提价 Marlboro 而冻结 Basic 价格" data-i18n-en="Hiking Marlboro List Prices While Holding Basic Flat">年内二次提价 Marlboro 而冻结 Basic 价格</h3><p data-i18n-rich="bat_desc_1">2026 年 4 月 PM USA 对 Marlboro 等主流线实施年内第二次提价，但刻意维持折扣牌 Basic 出厂价不变，实现“高端收割利润、底端锁死份额” <a class="cite-link" href="https://www.cspdailynews.com/tobacco/altria-raises-cigarette-prices-second-time-year" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CSP Daily News ↗</a>。</p></div><div class="feature-card"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;"><span class="mui-chip mui-chip-warning mono" data-i18n-zh="战役 03 · 2026-08-24" data-i18n-en="Case 03 · Aug 24, 2026">战役 03 · 2026-08-24</span><span class="mono" style="font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--text-muted);" data-i18n-zh="分拆18年后产能握手" data-i18n-en="PM USA × PMI Alliance">分拆18年后产能握手</span></div><h3 data-i18n-zh="与菲莫国际签署双向代工协议激活 $124M 季退税" data-i18n-en="PMI Mutual Manufacturing Pact &amp; $124M Q3 Duty Refund">与菲莫国际签署双向代工协议激活 $124M 季退税</h3><p data-i18n-rich="bat_desc_2">代工出口卷烟 Q3 猛增至 15.95 亿支（单季退税受益 $124M），并与 PMI 敲定 2027 年起长期双向代工合作，把闲置产能变成纯利中心 <a class="cite-link" href="https://www.investing.com/news/stock-market-news/altria-philip-morris-international-sign-contract-manufacturing-deals-4873428" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">PMI Deal ↗</a>。</p></div><div class="feature-card"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;"><span class="mui-chip mui-chip-primary mono" data-i18n-zh="战役 04 · 2025.08–2026.10" data-i18n-en="Case 04 · Aug&#x27;25–Oct&#x27;26">战役 04 · 2025.08–2026.10</span><span class="mono" style="font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--text-muted);" data-i18n-zh="品牌无烟化跨界延伸" data-i18n-en="Heated Brand Extension">品牌无烟化跨界延伸</span></div><h3 data-i18n-zh="Marlboro 商标首次赋能 Ploom 加热不燃烧烟支" data-i18n-en="Marlboro Heated Tobacco Sticks Enter FDA PMTA/MRTPA">Marlboro 商标首次赋能 Ploom 加热不燃烧烟支</h3><p data-i18n-rich="bat_desc_3">通过与日本烟草合资的 Horizon 提交 FDA 申请并在 2026 NACS 展实机展示 Marlboro 品牌加热烟支，为存量万宝路烟民铺设品牌内减害迁徙通道 <a class="cite-link" href="https://www.2firsts.com/news/altria-showcases-ploom-marlboro-heated-tobacco-sticks-and-non-nicotine-energy-products-at-nacs-show-2026" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">2Firsts NACS ↗</a>。</p></div></div><div class="grid-3"><div class="mui-alert"><div><strong data-i18n-zh="产品铁律一：" data-i18n-en="Product Law 01: ">产品铁律一：</strong><span data-i18n-zh="成熟成瘾性消费品的终极护城河不在总销量增长，而在“净提价幅度持续高于销量衰减率 200–400 bps”的剪刀差。" data-i18n-en="In mature nicotine categories, durability comes from sustaining net price realization 200–400 bps above annual unit volume decline.">成熟成瘾性消费品的终极护城河不在总销量增长，而在“净提价幅度持续高于销量衰减率 200–400 bps”的剪刀差。</span></div></div><div class="mui-alert"><div><strong data-i18n-zh="产品铁律二：" data-i18n-en="Product Law 02: ">产品铁律二：</strong><span data-i18n-zh="绝不用旗舰主线打价格战：必须通过 Cowboy Cut 与 Black 等品牌内子梯队定向隔离价格敏感客群。" data-i18n-en="Never discount flagship Red/Gold across the board; isolate price-sensitive smokers via tiered sub-lines like Cowboy Cut.">绝不用旗舰主线打价格战：必须通过 Cowboy Cut 与 Black 等品牌内子梯队定向隔离价格敏感客群。</span></div></div><div class="mui-alert"><div><strong data-i18n-zh="产品铁律三：" data-i18n-en="Product Law 03: ">产品铁律三：</strong><span data-i18n-zh="高固定资产卷烟厂在减量时代的破局之道，是用跨国合同代工出口与关税退税对冲本土产能摊销压力。" data-i18n-en="Offset domestic factory deleveraging by filling excess high-speed line capacity with export contract manufacturing and duty drawback.">高固定资产卷烟厂在减量时代的破局之道，是用跨国合同代工出口与关税退税对冲本土产能摊销压力。</span></div></div></div></section><section id="sec-06" class="mui-paper section-block"><div class="sec-header"><div><div class="sec-eyebrow mono">CHAPTER 06 · INTERACTIVE PRODUCT MOAT &amp; REGULATORY CHECKLIST</div><h2 class="sec-h2" data-i18n-zh="六、“万宝路定价权法则”旗舰可燃单品护城河核查清单" data-i18n-en="6. &#x27;Marlboro Pricing Law&#x27; Flagship Combustible Moat Checklist">六、“万宝路定价权法则”旗舰可燃单品护城河核查清单</h2><p class="sec-sub" data-i18n-zh="用于量化核验尼古丁消费单品的终端定价权、便利店货架壁垒与 FDA 合规确定性（勾选状态按单品独立保存在本地）" data-i18n-en="Quantitatively audit retail pricing power, c-store shelf moat, and FDA regulatory durability (saved locally per product)">用于量化核验尼古丁消费单品的终端定价权、便利店货架壁垒与 FDA 合规确定性（勾选状态按单品独立保存在本地）</p></div><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;"><span id="checklistScoreChip" class="mui-chip mui-chip-primary mono"></span><button type="button" id="checkAllBtn" class="mui-btn" data-i18n-zh="全部勾选" data-i18n-en="Check All">全部勾选</button><button type="button" id="resetCheckBtn" class="mui-btn" data-i18n-zh="重置清单" data-i18n-en="Reset">重置清单</button></div></div><div class="progress-track"><div id="checklistProgressBar" class="progress-fill"></div></div><div id="checklistContainer" class="checklist-grid"></div></section><footer id="sec-07" class="mui-paper section-block" style="padding: 22px 26px;"><div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:10px;"><strong style="font-size:0.92rem;" data-i18n-zh="数据来源与一手官方财报/FDA 监管核验索引（Altria SEC Form 8-K/10-K · Circana InfoScan · FDA CTP · NACS）" data-i18n-en="Primary SEC Filings, Retail Share &amp; FDA Verification Index (Altria Form 8-K/10-K · Circana · FDA CTP · NACS)">数据来源与一手官方财报/FDA 监管核验索引（Altria SEC Form 8-K/10-K · Circana InfoScan · FDA CTP · NACS）</strong><span class="mui-chip mono">MUI High-Clarity Architecture · Offline Ready</span></div><p style="font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.6;" data-i18n-zh="本单品专论所有出货量（支/罐）、全美零售份额（Circana InfoScan Multi-Outlet + Convenience）、扣除消费税净营收、调整后营业利润（Adjusted OCI）及 FDA PMTA/MRTP 监管状态均严格核验自奥驰亚集团（Altria Group, NYSE: MO）2026 年三季报（2026-10-29）、FY2025 Form 8-K/10-K 及美国 FDA 烟草制品中心官方公告，仅供消费品单品商业模型与产品工程研究参考，不构成任何投资建议。" data-i18n-en="All shipment volumes (sticks/cans), US retail share figures (Circana InfoScan Multi-Outlet + Convenience), revenue net of excise, Adjusted OCI margins, and FDA PMTA/MRTP authorizations are strictly verified against Altria Group (NYSE: MO) Q3 &amp; 9M 2026 Earnings Release (Oct 29, 2026), FY2025 SEC Form 8-K/10-K filings, and official FDA CTP announcements. For product strategy research only; not investment advice.">本单品专论所有出货量（支/罐）、全美零售份额（Circana InfoScan Multi-Outlet + Convenience）、扣除消费税净营收、调整后营业利润（Adjusted OCI）及 FDA PMTA/MRTP 监管状态均严格核验自奥驰亚集团（Altria Group, NYSE: MO）2026 年三季报（2026-10-29）、FY2025 Form 8-K/10-K 及美国 FDA 烟草制品中心官方公告，仅供消费品单品商业模型与产品工程研究参考，不构成任何投资建议。</p><ul class="sources-list"><li><span class="mono">[01]</span><a href="https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/Altria-Reports-2026-Third-Quarter-and-Nine-Months-Results-Announces-Expanded-Share-Repurchase-Program-Raises-2026-Full-Year-Earnings-Guidance/default.aspx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Altria Q3 &amp; 9M 2026 Official Earnings Release (Tables 2, 3 &amp; 4: Marlboro 39.5% Share, 60.0% Premium, Cowboy Cut) ↗</a></li><li><span class="mono">[02]</span><a href="https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000007/exhibit991erq42025.htm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">SEC Form 8-K Exhibit 99.1 — Altria Q4 &amp; Full-Year 2025 Results (54,933M Marlboro Sticks, $11,064M Smokeable Adj. OCI) ↗</a></li><li><span class="mono">[03]</span><a href="https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000093/exhibit991erq22026.htm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">SEC Form 8-K Exhibit 99.1 — Altria Q2 &amp; First-Half 2026 Results (Table 3 &amp; 4 Quarterly Cigarette Volumes) ↗</a></li><li><span class="mono">[04]</span><a href="https://www.cspdailynews.com/tobacco/altria-raises-cigarette-prices-second-time-year" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CSP Daily News: Altria Raises Cigarette Prices for Second Time in 2026 (Apr 13, 2026) ↗</a></li><li><span class="mono">[05]</span><a href="https://www.investing.com/news/stock-market-news/altria-philip-morris-international-sign-contract-manufacturing-deals-4873428" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Investing.com: Altria &amp; Philip Morris International Sign Mutual Contract Manufacturing Deals Starting 2027 (Aug 24, 2026) ↗</a></li><li><span class="mono">[06]</span><a href="https://www.2firsts.com/news/altria-showcases-ploom-marlboro-heated-tobacco-sticks-and-non-nicotine-energy-products-at-nacs-show-2026" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">2Firsts NACS Show 2026 Report: 1.1 Billion Annual PM USA Convenience-Store Trips &amp; Marlboro Heated Sticks ↗</a></li><li><span class="mono">[07]</span><a href="https://www.japantimes.co.jp/business/2025/10/04/companies/japan-tobacco-cheap-cigarettes/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Japan Times / UBS: US Marlboro (~$9.50/pack) vs. Discount Cigarette Pricing &amp; JT Montego Competition ↗</a></li><li><span class="mono">[08]</span><a href="https://oag.ca.gov/tobacco/directory?page=8&amp;order=field_tp_manufacturer&amp;sort=asc" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">State of California DOJ Tobacco Directory: PM USA Certified Marlboro Cowboy Cut &amp; Black Styles ↗</a></li></ul></footer>
