补贴压制净价)","label_en":"① Promo-War Margin Compression Case","tag_zh":"190M罐 · $1.6/盒","tag_en":"190M · $1.6/can","views":190,"v_per_view":1.6,"ancillary_m":25,"years":5,"transmedia":false},"p2":{"label_zh":"② 核心双轮增长情景 (195M罐起 · 年增9% + 净价爬坡)","label_en":"② Base Compounding Case (195M Cans · +9%/yr)","tag_zh":"195M罐 · 5年","tag_en":"195M · 5 Yrs","views":195,"v_per_view":2.1,"ancillary_m":50,"years":5,"transmedia":true},"p3":{"label_zh":"③ FDA清场未获批杂牌情景 (收编 Rogue/灰色袋份额)","label_en":"③ Bull FDA Enforcement Consolidation Case","tag_zh":"250M罐 · 7年","tag_en":"250M · 7 Yrs","views":250,"v_per_view":2.6,"ancillary_m":85,"years":7,"transmedia":true}}},"moat_pos_zh":"<strong>1. 奥驰亚最成功的无烟内生增长引擎：<\/strong>Q3'26 同比 +13.3% 证明经典 on! 叠加 on! PLUS 正在重拾强劲增长动量。<br/><strong>2. 超高资本回报率：<\/strong>~$250M 初始并购成本每年已产生数亿美元级正向边际利润。","moat_pos_en":"<strong>1. Proven Smoke-Free Growth Engine:<\/strong> +13.3% Q3 2026 volume growth confirms strong momentum across the on! family.<br/><strong>2. Exceptional Capital Efficiency:<\/strong> Generates massive multi-fold payback on its ~$250M purchase price.","moat_risk_zh":"<strong>1. 尼古丁袋赛道内部份额短期受 Velo 补贴冲击：<\/strong>Q3'26 袋内份额 13.5% 同比微降 1.3pp，反映竞品不计成本促销抢量。<br/><strong>2. 经典款 PMTA 尚待最终正式批文：<\/strong>虽然兄弟款 on! PLUS 已获批 6 款，经典干袋 35 款仍待 FDA 逐一签发 MGO。","moat_risk_en":"<strong>1. Heavy Rival Promo Spend:<\/strong> Aggressive discounting by BAT's Velo trimmed on!'s intra-pouch share -1.3pp YoY to 13.5% in Q3.<br/><strong>2. Pending Classic PMTA Decisions:<\/strong> Classic dry SKUs await formal FDA MGOs alongside already-authorized on! PLUS."},"ch5":{"eyebrow":"CHAPTER 05 · HELIX ACQUISITION TO 200M-CAN TRAJECTORY","h2_zh":"五、七年狂飙演进史：从 ~$2.5 亿小众并购到年冲 2 亿罐核心支柱","h2_en":"5. Seven-Year Ascent: From 2019 Burger-Söhne Deal to ~200M-Can Scale","sub_zh":"复盘奥驰亚如何吸取 JUUL 高溢价教训，以极低对价买下 on! 并用里士满工业化能力放大十倍","sub_en":"How Altria bought early, localized production in Richmond, and turned on! into its #2 oral brand","badge_zh":"2019 收购80% → 2021 全资 → 2025 1.78亿罐 → 2026 双星闪耀","badge_en":"2019 80% Deal → 2021 100% → 177.8M FY25 Cans","acts":[{"title_zh":"第一阶段 · 2019–2021 前瞻抄底收购与里士满本土扩产","title_en":"Act I · 2019–2021 ~$250M Buyout & Richmond Manufacturing Build","badge_zh":"年产能破亿罐","badge_en":"Localized US Supply","desc_zh":"2019 年收购瑞士 Burger Söhne 旗下 on! 业务 80% 股权组建 Helix Innovations，2020.12–2021.04 买下剩余 20%，并在里士满迅速建成全自动高速产线 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.altria.com/about-altria/our-companies/helix-innovations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Altria Helix ↗<\/a>。","desc_en":"Acquired 80% of on! in 2019 and the remaining 20% by early 2021, rapidly scaling automated manufacturing in Richmond, VA <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.altria.com/about-altria/our-companies/helix-innovations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Altria Helix ↗<\/a>."},{"title_zh":"第二阶段 · 30 万门店铺货与超越百年 Skoal (2022–2024)","title_en":"Act II · 300K-Door Scaling & Overtaking Skoal (2022–2024)","badge_zh":"2024 达 1.603亿罐","badge_en":"160.3M Cans in FY24","desc_zh":"依托 AGDC 全美网络完成便利店高密度覆盖，2024 年出货达 1.603 亿罐，正式超越 Skoal（1.470 亿罐）晋升集团第二大口含单品 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000007/exhibit991erq42025.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FY25 Table 6 ↗<\/a>。","desc_en":"Scaled across AGDC's convenience network to 160.3M cans in FY2024, officially surpassing Skoal (147.0M cans) <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000007/exhibit991erq42025.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FY25 Table 6 ↗<\/a>."},{"title_zh":"第三阶段 · 提价收获与 on! + on! PLUS 双核共振 (2025–2026Q3)","title_en":"Act III · Margin Expansion & Dual on! / on! PLUS Acceleration (2025–Q3'26)","badge_zh":"Q3'26 +13.3% 提速","badge_en":"+13.3% Q3'26 Surge","desc_zh":"2025 全年出货升至 1.778 亿罐（+10.9%），并在瑞典/英国开启电商出海；2026Q3 随新矩阵发力单季增速反弹至 +13.3%（4,780 万罐）<a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/Altria-Reports-2026-Third-Quarter-and-Nine-Months-Results-Announces-Expanded-Share-Repurchase-Program-Raises-2026-Full-Year-Earnings-Guidance/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Q3'26 Release ↗<\/a>。","desc_en":"Reached 177.8M cans in FY2025 (+10.9%), launched e-commerce in Sweden/UK, and accelerated to +13.3% YoY in Q3 2026 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/Altria-Reports-2026-Third-Quarter-and-Nine-Months-Results-Announces-Expanded-Share-Repurchase-Program-Raises-2026-Full-Year-Earnings-Guidance/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Q3'26 Release ↗<\/a>."}],"battles":[{"tag_zh":"战役 01 · 2019–2021","tag_en":"Case 01 · M&A Discipline","sub_zh":"~$250M vs $16B","sub_en":"64x Cheaper Than ZYN Deal","title_zh":"仅花 PMI 1/64 的并购代价卡位美国尼古丁袋前二","title_en":"Securing a Top-2/3 US Pouch Seat for ~$250M","desc_zh":"在赛道爆发早期果断出手并自建产能，缔造了继 John Middleton 之后奥驰亚最佳 ROI 投资 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.altria.com/about-altria/our-companies/helix-innovations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Helix Innovations ↗<\/a>。","desc_en":"Early entry plus organic Richmond capex delivered extraordinary capital efficiency <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.altria.com/about-altria/our-companies/helix-innovations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Helix Innovations ↗<\/a>."},{"tag_zh":"战役 02 · 2024全年","tag_en":"Case 02 · FY2024","sub_zh":"内部历史性交接","sub_en":"Passing Skoal","title_zh":"1.603 亿罐正式超越 90 年历史老牌 Skoal","title_en":"Surpassing 90-Year-Old Skoal in Annual Cans","desc_zh":"标志着奥驰亚口含烟分部真正跑出一条不依赖传统真烟叶的第二增长曲线 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000007/exhibit991erq42025.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FY25 Table 6 ↗<\/a>。","desc_en":"Proved Altria could scale a tobacco-leaf-free brand past a legacy smokeless icon <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000007/exhibit991erq42025.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FY25 Table 6 ↗<\/a>."},{"tag_zh":"战役 03 · 2026Q1","tag_en":"Case 03 · Q1 2026","sub_zh":"开门红放量","sub_en":"+17.6% Q1 Growth","title_zh":"2026 一季度出货大涨 +17.6% 展现强劲韧性","title_en":"Q1 2026 Shipments Jump +17.6% YoY","desc_zh":"在激烈的货架补贴竞争中保持稳健单价纪律并实现高双位数放量 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/Altria-Reports-2026-First-Quarter-Results-Reaffirms-Full-Year-Guidance/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Q1'26 Release ↗<\/a>。","desc_en":"Maintained disciplined RGM pricing while logging +17.6% Q1 shipment growth <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/Altria-Reports-2026-First-Quarter-Results-Reaffirms-Full-Year-Guidance/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Q1'26 Release ↗<\/a>."},{"tag_zh":"战役 04 · 2026Q3","tag_en":"Case 04 · Q3 2026","sub_zh":"总口含份额逆增","sub_en":"8.3% Oral Share","title_zh":"Q3 出货 +13.3% 推动口含大盘份额同比升至 8.3%","title_en":"Q3 +13.3% Growth Lifts Total Oral Share +0.1pp to 8.3%","desc_zh":"消化 Q2 同期高基数扰动后重回双位数增长通道 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/Altria-Reports-2026-Third-Quarter-and-Nine-Months-Results-Announces-Expanded-Share-Repurchase-Program-Raises-2026-Full-Year-Earnings-Guidance/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Q3'26 Table 6 & 7 ↗<\/a>。","desc_en":"Rebounded cleanly from Q2 promo comparisons to post 47.8M cans (+13.3% YoY) <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/Altria-Reports-2026-Third-Quarter-and-Nine-Months-Results-Announces-Expanded-Share-Repurchase-Program-Raises-2026-Full-Year-Earnings-Guidance/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Q3'26 Table 6 & 7 ↗<\/a>."}],"laws":[{"zh":"无烟化并购成败的关键不在追逐当时最火的百亿独角兽，而在早期低价买入好配方并用自有渠道放大十倍。","en":"Winning smoke-free M&A means buying differentiated chemistry early at ~$250M and scaling 10x via AGDC."},{"zh":"20 袋方形便携盒 + 8mg 高浓度档，是在 ZYN 垄断格局下撕开差异化复购缺口的精准设计。","en":"20-count pocket boxes and an 8mg ceiling carve out durable loyalty alongside 15-count/6mg ZYN."},{"zh":"当尼古丁袋占口含大盘突破 61.2%，坚持“不打恶性价格战+升级高溢价子线（on! PLUS）”是通向长期高利润的正道。","en":"Pair disciplined base pricing on classic on! with premium innovation (on! PLUS) rather than value-destroying promo wars."}]},"ch6":{"h2_zh":"六、“现代微袋增长飞轮”单品核查清单","h2_en":"6. 'Modern Dry Mini Pouch' Growth & Moat Checklist","items_zh":[{"tag":"双位数罐数增长","title":"1. 销量扩张斜率测试：季度与年度出货罐数是否维持 ~8%–15% 稳健增长？","desc":"FY25 +10.9%、Q3'26 +13.3%，核验无烟第二曲线真实成长力。"},{"tag":"≥ 8.2% 口含总份额","title":"2. 口含大盘渗透测试：在美国全部口含烟零售市场份额是否稳守并突破 8.3%+？","desc":"持续跟踪 on! + on! PLUS 对冲传统湿鼻烟下滑的净增效用。"},{"tag":"13.5%+ 袋内份额","title":"3. 尼古丁袋赛道卡位测试：面对 Velo 补贴战，袋内份额能否随 on! PLUS 铺货企稳回升？","desc":"重点观察 Q4'26–2027 新风味上架后的袋内份额拐点。"},{"tag":"单盒净价爬坡","title":"4. 促销收敛盈利测试：单盒净实现收入是否持续提升并缩小与 ZYN 价差？","desc":"避免陷入增收不增利的低价买赠陷阱。"},{"tag":"经典款 PMTA 推进","title":"5. 监管正式确权测试：经典干法 35 款 SKU 的 FDA PMTA 审查是否顺利推进？","desc":"依托 on! PLUS 已获批毒理经验加速经典线拿证。"},{"tag":"万宝路私域转化","title":"6. 烟民内部导流测试：成年卷烟烟民首次尝试尼古丁袋时选择 on! 的转化率是否提升？","desc":"发挥奥驰亚第一方 21+ 烟民数据库协同威力。"}],"items_en":[{"tag":"+8%–15% Can Growth","title":"1. Shipment Velocity Test: Are annual and quarterly cans sustaining ~8%–15% growth?","desc":"Verified +10.9% in FY25 and +13.3% in Q3 2026."},{"tag":"≥ 8.3% Oral Share","title":"2. Total Oral Share Test: Is on! expanding its share of the total US oral category?","desc":"Held 8.3% (+0.1pp YoY) in Q3 2026."},{"tag":"13.5%+ Pouch Share","title":"3. Intra-Pouch Share Inflection Test: Does on! PLUS stabilize and lift share within pouches?","desc":"Watch Q4 2026–2027 impact of 12mg and fruit-mint extensions."},{"tag":"Net Price Lift","title":"4. Promo Discipline Test: Is per-can net realization rising toward ZYN benchmarks?","desc":"Protect Altria's >66% Oral segment margin."},{"tag":"Classic PMTA MGOs","title":"5. Regulatory Milestone Test: Are classic dry on! PMTAs advancing toward formal FDA MGOs?","desc":"Build on Helix's Dec 2025 on! PLUS pilot approvals."},{"tag":"Smoker Cross-Sell","title":"6. First-Party Funnel Test: Is conversion of PM USA smokers into Helix pouches rising?","desc":"Leverage Marlboro digital loyalty channels."}]},"sources":[{"label":"Altria Q3 & 9M 2026 Official Release (Tables 6 & 7: on! 47.8M Q3 Cans +13.3%, 143.9M 9M Cans, 8.3% Oral / 13.5% Pouch Share)","url":"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/Altria-Reports-2026-Third-Quarter-and-Nine-Months-Results-Announces-Expanded-Share-Repurchase-Program-Raises-2026-Full-Year-Earnings-Guidance/default.aspx"},{"label":"SEC Form 8-K Exhibit 99.1 — Altria FY2025 Results (on! 177.8M Cans +10.9%, 15.4% FY25 Pouch Share)","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000007/exhibit991erq42025.htm"},{"label":"Altria Q1 2026 Official Release (on! +17.6% Q1 Shipment Growth)","url":"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/Altria-Reports-2026-First-Quarter-Results-Reaffirms-Full-Year-Guidance/default.aspx"},{"label":"Altria Operating Companies — Helix Innovations LLC Corporate Overview","url":"https://www.altria.com/about-altria/our-companies/helix-innovations"},{"label":"Tobacco Tactics (Aug 2026): Global & US Nicotine Pouches Competitive Landscape (ZYN, Velo, on!)","url":"https://www.tobaccotactics.org/article/nicotine-pouches/"},{"label":"2Firsts NACS Show 2026 Report (55 Million Annual Helix Convenience-Store Trips)","url":"https://www.2firsts.com/news/altria-showcases-ploom-marlboro-heated-tobacco-sticks-and-non-nicotine-energy-products-at-nacs-show-2026"}],"quickJumpZh":[{"sec":"sec-00","title":"00 单品定评与无烟增长核心面板","sub":"FY25 1.78亿罐 · Q3'26 +13.3% · ~$2.5亿神并购"},{"sec":"sec-01","title":"01 干法微晶配方、20袋方盒与五档梯度","sub":"20袋双仓名片盒 · 1.5mg至8mg五档精细浓度"},{"sec":"sec-02","title":"02 四大差异化支柱与尼古丁袋雷达","sub":"+33%袋数优势 · 里士满本土自动化供应"},{"sec":"sec-03","title":"03 全美现代尼古丁袋四大巨头对比","sub":"对比 ZYN (15袋)、Velo Plus、Rogue 与 on! PLUS"},{"sec":"sec-04","title":"04 ~$2.5亿并购神作与单罐盈利模拟","sub":"年化~1.92亿罐与并购回报倍数交互模拟"},{"sec":"sec-05","title":"05 2019 控股 Helix 至近 2 亿罐跃迁史","sub":"超越百年Skoal晋升集团第二大口含单品"},{"sec":"sec-06","title":"06 现代干法尼古丁袋护城河核查清单","sub":"6项增速、份额拐点与净价爬坡核验"},{"sec":"sec-07","title":"07 SEC 财报与行业监测信源索引","sub":"一手财报与全球口含烟研究直达"}],"quickJumpEn":[{"sec":"sec-00","title":"00 Product Verdict & Growth Scorecard","sub":"177.8M FY25 cans · +13.3% Q3'26 · ~$250M buyout ROI"},{"sec":"sec-01","title":"01 Dry Micro-Pouch & 20ct Box Engineering","sub":"20-pouch dual-chamber box & 1.5mg–8mg ladder"},{"sec":"sec-02","title":"02 4 Differentiation Pillars & Pouch Radar","sub":"+33% count value, 8mg top tier & Richmond supply"},{"sec":"sec-03","title":"03 US Nicotine Pouch Peer Matrix","sub":"Benchmarking ZYN, Velo Plus, Rogue & on! PLUS"},{"sec":"sec-04","title":"04 ~$250M Deal ROI & Unit Simulator","sub":"~192M annualized cans & MOIC compounding"},{"sec":"sec-05","title":"05 2019 Helix Buyout to ~200M-Can Scale","sub":"Passing Skoal to become Altria's #2 oral brand"},{"sec":"sec-06","title":"06 Dry Mini Pouch Moat Checklist","sub":"6-point velocity, share & pricing checklist"},{"sec":"sec-07","title":"07 SEC Filings & Market Sources","sub":"Direct links to Altria releases & pouch studies"}]},{"id":"on_plus_fumi","idx_num":8,"idx_pad":"08","filename":"mo_prod_08_on_plus_fumi.html","checkKey":"mui_mo_checks_on_plus","monogram":"O+","short_zh":"on! PLUS & FUMi 出海","short_en":"on! PLUS & FUMi Global","pill_kpi":"FDA神速获批6款 · 12万店","docTitleZh":"《on! PLUS 柔感湿润尼古丁袋与 FUMi 国际化矩阵》深度商业研报 | 王安安数据中心","docTitleEn":"on! PLUS NICOSILK Moist Pouches & FUMi International Oral Monograph | Research Hub","crumb_zh":"on! PLUS 下一代柔感尼古丁袋 & FUMi 国际化口含矩阵（Helix）","crumb_en":"on! PLUS NICOSILK™ Pouches & FUMi International Oral (Helix)","chip1_zh":"FDA 试点首家获批 (6款 MGO)","chip1_en":"1st FDA Pilot Approval (6 MGOs)","chip2_zh":"全美 12万门店 + FUMi 7国 4万店","chip2_en":"120K US Stores + 40K FUMi Global Doors","sidebar":{"badge":"HELIX NEXT-GEN · NICOSILK™ & GLOBAL ORAL","title_zh":"on! PLUS & FUMi 研报","title_en":"on! PLUS & FUMi Monograph","sub_zh":"2025.12 创纪录斩获 FDA 试点首批 6 款授权 × NICOSILK™ 丝滑湿感材质 × 2026全美闪电铺货 120,000 店 + FUMi 覆盖 7 国 40,000 店","sub_en":"Dec 2025 record-time FDA PMTA pilot win (6 SKUs) × NICOSILK™ soft-feel tech × 120K US stores + 40K FUMi global doors","mini_kpis":[{"label_zh":"FDA 正式获批 PMTA 数量","label_en":"FDA Authorized SKUs","val_zh":"6 款 (6mg & 9mg)","val_en":"6 SKUs (6mg/9mg)"},{"label_zh":"2026Q2 全美零售铺货网点","label_en":"Q2 2026 US Store Reach","val_zh":"120,000 家门店","val_en":"120,000 Stores"},{"label_zh":"FUMi 海外零售覆盖规模","label_en":"FUMi Intl Footprint","val_zh":"7国 · 40,000 门店","val_en":"7 Mkts · 40K Doors"}]},"toc":[["单品定评与 FDA 破冰里程碑","Product Verdict & FDA Breakthrough"],["NICOSILK™ 柔感工程与风味扩张","NICOSILK™ Tech & Flavor Pipeline"],["四大王牌反攻支柱与五维雷达","4 Challenger Pillars & Pouch Radar"],["FDA 已获批全美 26 款尼古丁袋对决","FDA-Authorized 26-SKU Showdown"],["12 万店单店动销与国际化模拟器","120K-Store Velocity & Global Simulator"],["从三州试水、FDA 闪电获批到七国出海","3-State Test to 120K US & 7-Country Rollout"],["下一代高端尼古丁袋核查清单","Next-Gen Pouch Moat Checklist"],["FDA 批文与官方新闻稿核验索引","FDA CTP Order & IR Sources"]],"hero":{"strip1_zh":"单品定评：奥驰亚挑战 ZYN 霸权的最强科技王牌——独占全美仅有的 26 款合法获批尼古丁袋中的 6 席，并以 NICOSILK™ 柔感材质与 9mg/12mg 降维超车","strip1_en":"Verdict: Altria's premier ZYN challenger—holding 6 of America's only 26 FDA-authorized pouch SKUs with proprietary NICOSILK™ comfort and 9mg/12mg strength","strip2_zh":"双轮版图：美国本土 on! PLUS (120,000店) + 欧洲/国际 FUMi & on! PLUS (7国 >40,000店)","strip2_en":"Dual Footprint: US Nationwide on! PLUS (120K stores) + International FUMi & UK/Sweden (>40K stores)","strip3_zh":"数据基准：2026Q3 季报 & FDA 2025.12 批文","strip3_en":"Baseline: Q3 2026 & Dec 19, 2025 FDA Order","overline_zh":"NEXT-GEN FLAGSHIP 08 · FDA 试点首家创纪录获批 (6款) × NICOSILK™ 专利柔感 × 12万美店 + 4万海外门店","overline_en":"NEXT-GEN FLAGSHIP 08 · 1st FDA Pilot Authorization (6 SKUs) × Proprietary NICOSILK™ × 120K US + 40K Intl Stores","h1_zh":"on! PLUS & FUMi 深度剖析：<span class=\"gradient-accent\">创纪录拿下 FDA 首批试点批文、三个月铺满 12 万门店，NICOSILK™ 柔感黑科技如何改写尼古丁袋战局？<\/span>","h1_en":"on! PLUS & FUMi Deep Dive: <span class=\"gradient-accent\">Record-Time FDA Pilot Approval, NICOSILK™ Soft-Feel Engineering, and 120K-Store Nationwide Blitz<\/span>","lead_zh":"2025 年 12 月 19 日，美国 FDA 烟草制品中心（CTP）发布重磅公告：在新启动的“尼古丁袋快速审评试点计划（Pilot Program）”下，以创纪录速度批准了首批全部 <strong>6 款口含袋产品——全部花落奥驰亚 Helix 旗下的 on! PLUS<\/strong>（涵盖 Mint、Wintergreen、Tobacco 三大风味的 <strong>6mg 与 9mg<\/strong> 规格，使全美获 FDA 正式授权的尼古丁袋总数达到 26 款：ZYN 20 款 + on! PLUS 6 款）<a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.fda.gov/tobacco-products/ctp-newsroom/fda-authorizes-6-nicotine-pouch-products-completing-review-record-time\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FDA Official Release ↗<\/a>！搭载自研 <strong>NICOSILK™ 柔感弹性湿润袋膜<\/strong>与认证儿童安全防误食圆罐 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/on-PLUS-Expands-Nationwide-Retail-Availability/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Altria Nationwide Release ↗<\/a>，on! PLUS 于 2026 年 3 月 23 日启动全美铺货，仅用一个季度便于 Q2 席卷 <strong>120,000 家零售店<\/strong>，并在 Q3–Q4 推出全国 <strong>12mg<\/strong> 高劲版及 <strong>Blueberry Mint（蓝莓薄荷）、Mango Pineapple（芒果菠萝）、Watermelon Mint（西瓜薄荷）<\/strong>；海外端收购整合的北欧新锐品牌 <strong>FUMi<\/strong> 更已打入 <strong>7 个国家 40,000 家门店<\/strong> <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000007/exhibit991erq42025.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FY25 EX-99.1 p.3 ↗<\/a>。","lead_en":"On December 19, 2025, the FDA announced the first-ever authorizations under its expedited Nicotine Pouch Pilot Program—clearing <strong>6 Helix on! PLUS SKUs<\/strong> (Mint, Wintergreen, and Tobacco in <strong>6mg and 9mg<\/strong>) in record time, making Helix and ZYN (20 SKUs) the only two brands holding the <strong>26 FDA-authorized nicotine pouches<\/strong> in America <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.fda.gov/tobacco-products/ctp-newsroom/fda-authorizes-6-nicotine-pouch-products-completing-review-record-time\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FDA Official Release ↗<\/a>. Engineered with proprietary <strong>NICOSILK™ soft-feel technology<\/strong> and a certified child-resistant can with built-in disposal lid <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/on-PLUS-Expands-Nationwide-Retail-Availability/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Altria Nationwide Release ↗<\/a>, on! PLUS launched nationwide March 23, 2026, hit <strong>120,000 US stores<\/strong> by Q2, expanded <strong>12mg<\/strong> plus <strong>Blueberry Mint, Mango Pineapple, and Watermelon Mint<\/strong> in 2H 2026, while international sister brand <strong>FUMi<\/strong> scaled across <strong>40,000 stores in 7 countries<\/strong> <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000007/exhibit991erq42025.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FY25 EX-99.1 p.3 ↗<\/a>.","thesis_cards":[{"title_zh":"NICOSILK™ 柔感湿润袋体：正面解决干袋磨牙龈痛点","title_en":"NICOSILK™ Soft-Feel Matrix Solves Dry-Pouch Gum Friction","desc_zh":"比经典 on! 袋幅更饱满修长、含水柔顺贴合上唇轮廓，持续释香时间更长，直接瞄准嫌 ZYN 偏干偏硬的高价值重度用户。","desc_en":"Proprietary NICOSILK™ plush moisture-balanced pouch eliminates dry-pouch gum friction with longer flavor release to win premium ZYN/Velo users."},{"title_zh":"FDA 认证 9mg 合法高浓度上限（碾压 ZYN 6mg 天花板）","title_en":"FDA-Authorized 9mg Strength Beats ZYN's 6mg US Cap","desc_zh":"在全美仅有的 26 款 FDA 获批尼古丁袋中，ZYN 最高仅获批 6mg，而 on! PLUS 合法拥有 9mg 正式批文（更有 12mg 审查在售），独占合规高劲赛道！","desc_en":"Among the only 26 FDA-authorized US nicotine pouches, ZYN caps out at 6mg while on! PLUS holds 9mg MGOs (plus 12mg in review)—owning legal high strength."},{"title_zh":"打破“分拆后只做美国”宿命：FUMi + on! PLUS 七国出海","title_en":"Breaking Altria's US-Only Ceiling via FUMi (40K Intl Stores)","desc_zh":"通过瑞典、英国电商/零售布局 on! PLUS，并以 12 种风味的 FUMi 攻占 7 个海外口含市场 40,000 家门店，兑现 2028 国际化目标。","desc_en":"Breaks Altria's US-only ceiling via UK/Sweden on! PLUS rollouts and 12-flavor Nordic brand FUMi across 40,000 international stores in 7 markets."}],"kpis":[{"label_zh":"FDA PMTA 正式授权 SKU","label_en":"FDA PMTA Granted Orders","badge_zh":"占全美合法批文 23%","badge_en":"6 of 26 Total US MGOs","val_zh":"6 款 (6mg/9mg)","val_en":"6 SKUs (6mg/9mg)","desc_zh":"2025-12-19 创纪录获批 Mint / Tobacco / Wintergreen 各 6mg 与 9mg，多种致癌亚硝胺低至不可检出 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.fda.gov/tobacco-products/ctp-newsroom/fda-authorizes-6-nicotine-pouch-products-completing-review-record-time\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FDA CTP Newsroom ↗<\/a>","desc_en":"Earned 6 record-speed FDA PMTA MGOs on Dec 19, 2025 (Mint, Tobacco, Wintergreen 6mg & 9mg) with non-measurable key nitrosamines <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.fda.gov/tobacco-products/ctp-newsroom/fda-authorizes-6-nicotine-pouch-products-completing-review-record-time\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FDA CTP Newsroom ↗<\/a>"},{"label_zh":"全美铺货速度 (2026.03→Q2)","label_en":"US Nationwide Store Blitz","badge_zh":"单季横扫 12万店","badge_en":"1Quarter Blitz via AGDC","val_zh":"120,000 店","val_en":"120,000 Stores","desc_zh":"2026-03-16 启动全国批发发货，至二季度末已迅速铺进 12 万家零售门头 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000093/exhibit991erq22026.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Q2'26 CEO Remarks ↗<\/a>","desc_en":"Commenced national wholesale shipping Mar 16, 2026 and scaled rapidly into 120,000 US retail stores by Q2'26 end <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000093/exhibit991erq22026.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Q2'26 CEO Remarks ↗<\/a>"},{"label_zh":"2026H2 新风味与高劲扩展","label_en":"2H 2026 Line Extensions","badge_zh":"6 / 9 / 12mg 全梯度","badge_en":"6 / 9 / 12mg Tiers","val_zh":"+3 新复合果薄荷","val_en":"+3 Fruit-Mint Lines","desc_zh":"Q3 推全国 12mg 并上架 Blueberry Mint 与 Mango Pineapple，Q4 再推 Watermelon Mint <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/Altria-Reports-2026-Third-Quarter-and-Nine-Months-Results-Announces-Expanded-Share-Repurchase-Program-Raises-2026-Full-Year-Earnings-Guidance/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Q3'26 Smoke-Free ↗<\/a>","desc_en":"Rolled out 12mg nationwide plus Blueberry Mint & Mango Pineapple in Q3'26, followed by Watermelon Mint in Q4'26 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/Altria-Reports-2026-Third-Quarter-and-Nine-Months-Results-Announces-Expanded-Share-Repurchase-Program-Raises-2026-Full-Year-Earnings-Guidance/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Q3'26 Smoke-Free ↗<\/a>"},{"label_zh":"FUMi 国际零售网络覆盖","label_en":"FUMi Global Store Reach","badge_zh":"12款差异化海外风味","badge_en":"12 Flavors · 7 Countries","val_zh":"40,000 店 (7国)","val_en":"40,000 Doors","desc_zh":"携手瑞典/英国 on! PLUS 布局，开辟奥驰亚非美国本土增长新战场 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000007/exhibit991erq42025.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FY25 Enterprise Goals ↗<\/a>","desc_en":"Expanded FUMi across 40,000 international retail stores in 7 markets alongside UK & Swedish on! PLUS e-commerce/retail <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000007/exhibit991erq42025.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FY25 Enterprise Goals ↗<\/a>"}]},"ch1":{"eyebrow":"CHAPTER 01 · NICOSILK™ MATERIAL SCIENCE, FDA PILOT & GLOBAL ROLLOUT","h2_zh":"一、材料黑科技与监管速度解构：为什么 FDA 把试点第一张通行证发给了 on! PLUS？","h2_en":"1. NICOSILK™ Engineering & FDA Pilot Victory: Inside Altria's Next-Gen Pouch Leap","sub_zh":"不可检出级致癌物毒理实证 × 认证儿童防开启安全圆罐 × 本土 9mg/12mg 与海外 FUMi 双向合围","sub_en":"Non-quantifiable carcinogenic HPHCs × certified child-resistant safety lid × 9mg/12mg + FUMi expansion","badge_zh":"FDA 2025.09 试点新政首家受益者","badge_en":"1st Winner of FDA's Sep 2025 Pouch Pilot","hub_title_zh":"Helix 下一代双引擎（美国高溢价 NICOSILK™ 圆罐 ↔ 欧洲 FUMi 多风味国际化跳板）","hub_title_en":"Helix Next-Gen Dual Engine (US NICOSILK™ Premium Can ↔ International FUMi 7-Market Network)","hub_sub_zh":"2025.11 再向 FDA 补交 6 款新风味 × 3 浓度（18 个 SKU）PMTA 申请 · 构建持续数年的合法产品管线","hub_sub_en":"Backed by Nov 2025 PMTA filings covering 6 additional flavors across 3 nicotine strengths (18 more SKUs)","nodes":[{"tag_zh":"PROPRIETARY FLEECE · 核心科技","tag_en":"NICOSILK™ MATRIX","name_zh":"NICOSILK™ 丝滑弹性湿润袋体","name_en":"NICOSILK™ Soft-Feel Pouch","desc_zh":"独家研发微孔亲肤柔软无纺布与控湿配方，入口即柔顺贴合，无干袋粗糙棱角感。","desc_en":"Custom micro-porous soft fleece and moisture-locked matrix contour smoothly to the upper lip without dry-edge irritation."},{"tag_zh":"FDA SAFETY STANDARD · 包装标杆","tag_en":"CHILD-RESISTANT CAN","name_zh":"认证儿童防开启圆罐 + 回收盖","name_en":"Certified Safety Can & Catch Lid","desc_zh":"FDA 批文特别点赞其主包装采用经认证的防幼童误开安全锁扣盖，并集成顶部废袋收纳仓。","desc_en":"Commended explicitly by the FDA for its certified child-resistant safety lock lid integrated with a top used-pouch catch chamber."},{"tag_zh":"FDA MGO CORE · 合法六剑客","tag_en":"6 FDA-AUTHORIZED SKUs","name_zh":"Mint · Wintergreen · Tobacco (6/9mg)","name_en":"Mint / Wintergreen / Tobacco 6 & 9mg","desc_zh":"9mg 合法批文填补了全美合规尼古丁袋高浓度空白（ZYN 获批上限仅为 6mg）。","desc_en":"FDA-authorized 9mg MGOs capture the highest legal US pouch nicotine tier (50% stronger than ZYN's 6mg authorized cap)."},{"tag_zh":"HIGH-STRENGTH EDGE · 重度利器","tag_en":"12mg NATIONAL ROLLOUT","name_zh":"on! PLUS 12mg 全国扩铺","name_en":"12mg Strength (FDA Review)","desc_zh":"2026Q2 在佛州/北卡/德州恢复发货并于 Q3 推向全美（处于 FDA 审评中），锁定重度烟民。","desc_en":"Resumed FL/NC/TX shipments in Q2'26 and expanded nationwide in Q3'26 under active FDA PMTA review for heavy adult switchers."},{"tag_zh":"WAVE-2 FLAVORS · 果薄荷攻势","tag_en":"2026 FLAVOR EXTENSIONS","name_zh":"蓝莓薄荷 · 芒果菠萝 · 西瓜薄荷","name_en":"Blueberry / Mango / Watermelon","desc_zh":"2026Q3 率先铺货蓝莓薄荷与芒果菠萝（6/9/12mg），Q4 再上西瓜薄荷（2025.11 已交 PMTA）。","desc_en":"Launched Blueberry Mint & Mango Pineapple (6/9/12mg) in Q3'26 and Watermelon Mint in Q4'26 (PMTAs filed Nov 2025)."},{"tag_zh":"GLOBAL SPEARHEAD · 七国出海","tag_en":"FUMi + UK/SWEDEN","name_zh":"FUMi (7国4万店) + 英瑞电商零售","name_en":"FUMi 40K Doors + UK/SE on! PLUS","desc_zh":"以北欧现代风味袋 FUMi（12款口味）与海外版 on! PLUS 抢滩欧洲高增长无烟市场。","desc_en":"Deploys 12-flavor Nordic modern pouch brand FUMi across 40,000 international doors plus UK/Sweden on! PLUS channels."}],"platform_bars":[{"title_zh":"FDA 毒理评估结论：多种驱动口腔癌的关键致癌物（HPHCs）低至无法检出","title_en":"FDA Scientific Finding: Non-Measurable Carcinogenic HPHCs","sub_zh":"FDA 2025-12-19 官方公告证实：on! PLUS 绝大部分有害成分远低于传统口含烟，多项关键致癌亚硝胺甚至低于定量检出限。","sub_en":"FDA's Dec 19, 2025 scientific review confirmed non-measurable levels of several carcinogenic HPHCs/TSNAs and low youth uptake."},{"title_zh":"AGDC 一个季度横扫 120,000 家门店的现象级渠道执行力","title_en":"0 to 120,000 US Retail Stores in a Single Quarter via AGDC","sub_zh":"2026 年 3 月下旬全国首发，至 6 月底即进驻 12 万门店，展现了奥驰亚无可匹敌的商业化推力。","sub_en":"Scaled from regional test states to 120,000 US c-stores in a single quarter via AGDC's unmatched field execution."}],"principles":[{"title_zh":"1. 抢占“FDA 合法白名单（26款）”双寡头红利","title_en":"1. Capturing the 2-Brand FDA Authorized Duopoly","desc_zh":"截至 2026 年，全美获 FDA 正式授权的尼古丁袋仅有 <strong>26 款<\/strong>（ZYN 20款 + on! PLUS 6款），而 Velo、Rogue、FRE、ALP 等竞品尚无同批正式 MGO；随着各州建立 PMTA 白名单目录（Directory Laws），on! PLUS 享有极强政策顺风 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.fda.gov/tobacco-products/ctp-newsroom/fda-authorizes-6-nicotine-pouch-products-completing-review-record-time\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FDA Authorized List ↗<\/a>。","desc_en":"Only <strong>26 nicotine pouches<\/strong> hold FDA MGOs in America (20 ZYN + 6 on! PLUS), giving on! PLUS a massive regulatory tailwind as states enact PMTA directory laws <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.fda.gov/tobacco-products/ctp-newsroom/fda-authorizes-6-nicotine-pouch-products-completing-review-record-time\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FDA Authorized List ↗<\/a>."},{"title_zh":"2. 儿童安全包装提前卡位 FDA 强制监管风向","title_en":"2. Child-Resistant Can Preempts Future Packaging Mandates","desc_zh":"针对监管层高度关注的幼童误食尼古丁袋风险，on! PLUS 原生标配认证儿童防开启圆罐，免去了未来改模与重交申报的折腾 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.fda.gov/tobacco-products/ctp-newsroom/fda-authorizes-6-nicotine-pouch-products-completing-review-record-time\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FDA Safety Note ↗<\/a>。","desc_en":"Native certified child-resistant round cans preempt future congressional/FDA packaging mandates without costly re-tooling <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.fda.gov/tobacco-products/ctp-newsroom/fda-authorizes-6-nicotine-pouch-products-completing-review-record-time\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FDA Safety Note ↗<\/a>."},{"title_zh":"3. 定价对标高端圆罐带，拉升 Helix 整体毛利中枢","title_en":"3. Premium Round-Can Positioning Lifts Helix ASP","desc_zh":"on! PLUS 直接卡位高端圆罐主流价位带，与经典平价方盒 on! 形成高低搭配，显著抬升 Helix 单罐收入上限 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/on-PLUS-Expands-Nationwide-Retail-Availability/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">on! PLUS Release ↗<\/a>。","desc_en":"Premium round-can architecture commands +20%–30% higher retail ASP than entry promos, lifting Helix blended revenue per can <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/on-PLUS-Expands-Nationwide-Retail-Availability/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">on! PLUS Release ↗<\/a>."}],"alert_zh":"<strong>合规透明度关键提示：<\/strong>截至 2026 年 10 月 NACS 展会核验，FDA 公开授权清单涵盖的是 on! PLUS <strong>6mg 与 9mg<\/strong> 的薄荷、冬青、烟草共 <strong>6 款产品<\/strong>；而 2026 下半年全国扩铺的 <strong>12mg 规格<\/strong> 以及新推出的蓝莓薄荷、芒果菠萝、西瓜薄荷（Helix 已于 2025 年 11 月等节点递交 PMTA）目前仍处于 <strong>FDA 审查中（Under FDA Review）<\/strong> 状态 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.2firsts.com/news/altria-showcases-ploom-marlboro-heated-tobacco-sticks-and-non-nicotine-energy-products-at-nacs-show-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2Firsts NACS Verification ↗<\/a>。","alert_en":"<strong>Regulatory Nuance (Verified Oct 2026):<\/strong> FDA's December 2025 Marketing Granted Orders specifically cover the <strong>6 SKUs in 6mg and 9mg<\/strong> (Mint, Tobacco, Wintergreen), while the <strong>12mg strength<\/strong> and new fruit-mint extensions (PMTA filed Nov 2025) are marketed while remaining <strong>under active FDA review<\/strong> <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.2firsts.com/news/altria-showcases-ploom-marlboro-heated-tobacco-sticks-and-non-nicotine-energy-products-at-nacs-show-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2Firsts NACS Verification ↗<\/a>.","chart":{"tabA_zh":"视图A: 门店闪电铺货与海外扩张轨迹","tabA_en":"View A: US & International Store Rollout","tabB_zh":"视图B: 全美 FDA 正式获批尼古丁袋格局","tabB_en":"View B: US FDA-Authorized Pouch SKUs & Strengths","viewA":{"mode":"dual_bar_line","title_zh":"on! PLUS 美国门店铺货里程碑（千店）vs 累计覆盖风味/浓度 SKU 矩阵数","title_en":"on! PLUS + FUMi Retail Door Expansion (Thousands of Stores) vs. Active SKU Breadth","sub_zh":"从 2025.10 三州试销起步，2026Q2 跃升至全美 12万店（叠加海外 FUMi 4万店合计达 16万+ 终端）","sub_en":"From 3-state test in Oct 2025 to 120K US stores in Q2 2026 (+ 40K FUMi international stores)","leg1_zh":"累计覆盖零售门店数 (左轴 · 千家门店)","leg1_en":"Cumulative Retail Stores Reached (Left · K Doors)","leg2_zh":"在售核心 SKU 组合数 (右轴 · 款)","leg2_en":"Active Commercial SKU Count (Right · SKUs)","labels_zh":["2025.10 三州试销","2025.12 FDA获批+FUMi","2026.03 全国首发","2026Q2 12万美店+海外","2026Q4 叠新风味全矩阵"],"labels_en":["Oct'25 3-State","Dec'25 FDA+FUMi","Mar'26 US Launch","Q2'26 120K US+40K Intl","Q4'26 Full Extensions"],"subs_zh":["FL / NC / TX 试点","FUMi 7国 40K店","3.23 全国上架","120K美店 + 40K海外","蓝莓/芒果/西瓜+12mg"],"subs_en":["FL, NC, TX pilot","FUMi 40K intl","Mar 23 rollout","120K US + 40K intl","+3 Fruit-Mints & 12mg"],"s1":[12,52,85,160,175],"s2":[9,9,9,9,18],"max1":200,"max2":22,"u1":"K","u2":""},"viewB":{"mode":"grouped_bars","title_zh":"全美各大尼古丁袋品牌：FDA 正式获批 PMTA 款数 vs 已获批最高单袋浓度（mg）","title_en":"US Nicotine Pouch Brands: FDA-Authorized SKU Count vs. Max FDA-Authorized Strength (mg)","sub_zh":"全美仅 ZYN（20款）与 on! PLUS（6款）拥有正式批文，且 on! PLUS 独占 9mg 合法高浓度高地","sub_en":"Only ZYN (20) and on! PLUS (6) hold FDA MGOs—and on! PLUS owns the highest FDA-authorized dose at 9mg","leg1_zh":"FDA 正式获批 PMTA 产品数 (款)","leg1_en":"FDA-Authorized PMTA SKUs (Count)","leg2_zh":"已获批最高尼古丁浓度 (mg/袋)","leg2_en":"Max FDA-Authorized Strength (mg)","labels_zh":["ZYN (PMI/瑞典火柴)","on! PLUS (奥驰亚 Helix)","Velo / Velo Plus (BAT)","Rogue / ZONE (Swisher/ITG)"],"labels_en":["ZYN (PMI)","on! PLUS (Altria Helix)","Velo / Velo Plus (BAT)","Rogue / ZONE"],"subs_zh":["2025.01 获批 20款 (3/6mg)","2025.12 获批 6款 (6/9mg)","截至2026.10 审查中","截至2026.10 审查中"],"subs_en":["Jan'25: 20 SKUs (3/6mg)","Dec'25: 6 SKUs (6/9mg)","Pending FDA review","Pending FDA review"],"s1":[20,6,0,0],"s2":[6,9,0,0],"max1":22,"u1":"","u2":"mg"}},"matrix_cards":[{"title_zh":"FDA 试点新政“实时沟通审评”创下审批速度纪录","title_en":"FDA's Real-Time Pilot Review Set a New PMTA Speed Benchmark","badge_zh":"2025.09→2025.12 闪批","badge_en":"3-Month Pilot Sprint","body_zh":"FDA 于 2025 年 9 月启动尼古丁袋审评效率试点，引入审评员与申请人实时答疑机制；Helix 凭扎实的化学与人群收益模型在短短 3 个月后（12 月 19 日）即拔得头筹斩获 6 张 MGO 批文 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.fda.gov/tobacco-products/ctp-newsroom/fda-authorizes-6-nicotine-pouch-products-completing-review-record-time\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FDA CTP Director Quote ↗<\/a>。","detail_zh":"这一突破扭转了市场过去认为“奥驰亚在 FDA 拿证速度慢于 PMI”的刻板印象，证明 ALCS 监管科学团队已全面跑通高效 PMTA 范式。","body_en":"Launched in September 2025 with real-time FDA-applicant communication, the pilot yielded 6 MGOs for Helix by December 19, 2025—validating Altria's scientific regulatory engine <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.fda.gov/tobacco-products/ctp-newsroom/fda-authorizes-6-nicotine-pouch-products-completing-review-record-time\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FDA CTP Director Quote ↗<\/a>.","detail_en":"Sets a repeatable blueprint for Helix's November 2025 PMTA batch of 6 additional flavors."},{"title_zh":"FUMi 7 国 40,000 门店：奥驰亚 2008 年以来最重要出海破冰","title_en":"FUMi Across 40,000 Stores in 7 Markets: Altria Goes International","badge_zh":"突破美国地理边界","badge_en":"Ex-US Growth Vector","body_zh":"自 2008 年剥离菲莫国际后，奥驰亚可燃烟被锁定在美国本土；如今在新型口含烟赛道，Helix International 已凭 <strong>FUMi（12款风味覆盖 7 国 4 万门店）<\/strong> 及英国/瑞典版 on! PLUS 正式杀回国际主流市场 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000007/exhibit991erq42025.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FY25 Long-Term Growth ↗<\/a>。","detail_zh":"北欧与英国是全球人均尼古丁袋消耗量最高、对高浓度与果薄荷风味最友好的市场，为 Helix 提供了不受美国单一监管约束的海外试验田与增长极。","body_en":"Blocked from ex-US cigarettes since the 2008 PMI spin-off, Altria is now scaling internationally in oral nicotine via <strong>FUMi (40,000 stores across 7 countries, 12 flavors)<\/strong> alongside on! PLUS in Sweden and the UK <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000007/exhibit991erq42025.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FY25 Long-Term Growth ↗<\/a>.","detail_en":"European pouch markets welcome higher strengths and fruit-forward profiles, serving as both a profit pool and R&D proving ground."}]},"ch2":{"eyebrow":"CHAPTER 02 · FOUR CHALLENGER PILLARS & 5-AXIS NEXT-GEN RADAR","h2_zh":"二、四大挑战者支柱：on! PLUS 凭什么正面虎口夺食 ZYN 与 Velo？","h2_en":"2. Four Challenger Pillars: How on! PLUS Attacks Both ZYN and Moist-Pouch Rivals","badge_zh":"护城河定性：专利柔感材质 + FDA 9mg 独家合法身位","badge_en":"Moat Rating: NICOSILK™ Patent + Exclusive 9mg FDA MGO","pillars":[{"title_zh":"01 · NICOSILK™ 柔感湿袋材质降维打击干硬袋体","title_en":"01 · Proprietary NICOSILK™ Plush Moisture Comfort","badge_zh":"盲测舒适度领先","badge_en":"Plush Lip Comfort","desc_zh":"兼具柔软延展性与顺滑释香曲线，精准切中老用户升级诉求。","note_zh":"<strong>当前选中支柱解读（01 NICOSILK™ 体验）：<\/strong>解决了传统迷你干袋（ZYN / 经典 on!）初入口偏干、部分重度用户反馈摩擦上唇黏膜的痛点 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/on-PLUS-Expands-Nationwide-Retail-Availability/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NICOSILK Tech ↗<\/a>。","note_en":"<strong>Selected Pillar (01 · NICOSILK™ Comfort):<\/strong> Eliminates dry-edge gum irritation while sustaining smooth flavor release <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/on-PLUS-Expands-Nationwide-Retail-Availability/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NICOSILK Tech ↗<\/a>.","desc_en":"Silky stretchable pouch fleece and sustained moisture release directly address adult complaints about dry pouches."},{"title_zh":"02 · 全美唯一获 FDA 正式授权的 9mg 高劲尼古丁袋","title_en":"02 · Only 9mg Nicotine Pouch Authorized by the FDA","badge_zh":"碾压 ZYN 6mg 上限","badge_en":"9mg MGO vs. ZYN 6mg","desc_zh":"多出 50% 单袋合法尼古丁载荷，辅以 12mg 延伸档，通吃重度烟民与老鼻烟客。","note_zh":"<strong>当前选中支柱解读（02 9mg 合规王牌）：<\/strong>许多一包半卷烟老烟民或哥本哈根用户觉得 6mg ZYN“不够劲”，on! PLUS 9mg 是目前全美唯一拥有 FDA 护身符的高劲替代方案 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.fda.gov/tobacco-products/ctp-newsroom/fda-authorizes-6-nicotine-pouch-products-completing-review-record-time\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FDA 9mg MGO ↗<\/a>。","note_en":"<strong>Selected Pillar (02 · Exclusive 9mg FDA MGO):<\/strong> Delivers +50% more nicotine per pouch than ZYN's 6mg ceiling with full FDA marketing authorization <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.fda.gov/tobacco-products/ctp-newsroom/fda-authorizes-6-nicotine-pouch-products-completing-review-record-time\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FDA 9mg MGO ↗<\/a>.","desc_en":"50% higher FDA-authorized nicotine payload per pouch than ZYN 6mg, backed by 12mg SKUs for heavy dual users."},{"title_zh":"03 · 认证儿童防开启圆罐 + 顶盖废袋仓一体化工业设计","title_en":"03 · Certified Child-Resistant Safety Can + Disposal Lid","badge_zh":"超越竞品普通卡扣罐","badge_en":"Built-In Safety & Catch","desc_zh":"集儿童安全锁与环保废袋回收格于一体，获 FDA 官方新闻稿专门表彰。","note_zh":"<strong>当前选中支柱解读（03 合规包装标杆）：<\/strong>既消除了有孩家庭存放顾虑，又在各州推进强制防童包装立法中占据绝对主动 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.fda.gov/tobacco-products/ctp-newsroom/fda-authorizes-6-nicotine-pouch-products-completing-review-record-time\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FDA Packaging Note ↗<\/a>。","note_en":"<strong>Selected Pillar (03 · Child-Resistant Can):<\/strong> Explicitly highlighted by FDA CTP as a key public-health safeguard mitigating accidental child exposure <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.fda.gov/tobacco-products/ctp-newsroom/fda-authorizes-6-nicotine-pouch-products-completing-review-record-time\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FDA Packaging Note ↗<\/a>.","desc_en":"Combines certified child-safety lock engineering with hygienic top-lid disposal, praised directly in FDA's press announcement."},{"title_zh":"04 · “美国 12万店 + 海外 FUMi 4万店”全球 16万+ 终端网络","title_en":"04 · 120K US Doors + 40K International FUMi Doors","badge_zh":"海内外双轮扩张","badge_en":"160K+ Global Doors","desc_zh":"国内靠 AGDC 闪电铺货，海外靠 FUMi 打开 7 国增量天花板。","note_zh":"<strong>当前选中支柱解读（04 全球化突破）：<\/strong>使 Helix 成为奥驰亚旗下唯一具备“美国本土+欧洲多国”跨洲际成长空间的子业务平台 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000007/exhibit991erq42025.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FY25 Global Oral ↗<\/a>。","note_en":"<strong>Selected Pillar (04 · Global Expansion):<\/strong> Combines AGDC's domestic muscle with FUMi's 7-country European/international retail presence <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000007/exhibit991erq42025.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FY25 Global Oral ↗<\/a>.","desc_en":"Pairs 120,000 US AGDC doors with 40,000 international FUMi doors across 7 countries to unlock global TAM."}],"radar":{"title_zh":"下一代高端湿感与主流获批尼古丁袋五维技术雷达图（10分制）","title_en":"5-Axis Next-Gen Nicotine Pouch Technical & Regulatory Radar","axes_zh":["袋体柔软湿润度","FDA合法获批高度","高浓度覆盖(9/12mg)","儿童安全包装","海内外渠道广度"],"axes_en":["Pouch Softness","FDA MGO Status","High-Dose (9/12mg)","Child-Safety Can","US+Intl Reach"],"s0_zh":"on! PLUS + FUMi 矩阵 (Helix · 6款MGO · 9/12mg)","s0_en":"on! PLUS + FUMi (Helix · 6 MGOs · 9/12mg)","s1_zh":"ZYN 经典圆盒 (PMI · 20款MGO · 最高6mg)","s1_en":"ZYN Classic (PMI · 20 MGOs · 6mg Cap)","s2_zh":"Velo Plus (BAT · 湿袋竞品 · 尚待美版MGO)","s2_en":"Velo Plus (BAT · Moist Rival · Pending US MGO)","v0":[9.7,9.3,9.6,9.8,8.6],"v1":[7.5,9.9,6.8,8.5,9.7],"v2":[9.2,5.8,9.0,8.0,9.1]}},"ch3":{"eyebrow":"CHAPTER 03 · NEXT-GEN MOIST POUCH & INTERNATIONAL PEER MATRIX","h2_zh":"三、高端湿润袋与国际化品牌横向对比：材质、浓度与 FDA 通行证之战","h2_en":"3. Next-Gen Pouch Matrix: on! PLUS & FUMi vs. ZYN, Velo Plus & ALP","peers_zh":[{"category":"altria","benchmark":true,"title":"研究标的：on! PLUS 柔感湿润尼古丁袋","creator":"Helix Innovations LLC (奥驰亚)","format":"认证儿童安全圆罐 + 顶盖废袋仓","craft":"NICOSILK™ 柔感材质 · 6/9mg (已批) + 12mg & 果薄荷","views":"2026Q2 已铺满全美 120,000 家零售门店","acclaim":"2025.12 首批斩获 6 张 FDA 试点 PMTA 批文!","takeaway":"集“湿袋舒适度 + 9mg合法高劲 + FDA白名单”于一身，是奥驰亚口含份额反攻核心。","sourceLabel":"FDA / Altria","sourceUrl":"https://www.fda.gov/tobacco-products/ctp-newsroom/fda-authorizes-6-nicotine-pouch-products-completing-review-record-time"},{"category":"altria","benchmark":true,"title":"研究标的：FUMi 国际化多风味尼古丁袋","creator":"Helix International (奥驰亚)","format":"北欧时尚圆罐 · 12款差异化创意风味","craft":"针对欧洲市场定制的柔软咸甜/果香风味袋","views":"已进驻 7 个国际市场逾 40,000 家零售门店","acclaim":"兑现奥驰亚 2028 进军海外口含市场核心战略","takeaway":"与英/瑞版 on! PLUS 协同，让奥驰亚首次分享欧洲口含袋高增长红利。","sourceLabel":"FY25 EX-99.1","sourceUrl":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000007/exhibit991erq42025.htm"},{"category":"external","benchmark":false,"title":"ZYN & ZYN Ultra (PMI 瑞典火柴旗舰)","creator":"Swedish Match / 菲莫国际 (PMI)","format":"美版 15袋干袋 (3/6mg) + 海外湿袋延伸","craft":"美国市场统治级心智 · 肯塔基+科罗拉多扩产","views":"握有 20 款美版 FDA PMTA · 全球约占 1/3+ 份额","acclaim":"品牌号召力极强 · 美版暂缺 >6mg 获批湿袋","takeaway":"on! PLUS 正是精准打击 ZYN 美版“无湿感大袋、无 9mg+ 批文”两大空白区。","sourceLabel":"Tobacco Tactics","sourceUrl":"https://www.tobaccotactics.org/article/nicotine-pouches/"},{"category":"external","benchmark":false,"title":"Velo Plus (英美烟草美版升级主力)","creator":"R.J. Reynolds / 英美烟草 (BAT)","format":"20袋圆罐 · 湿润合成尼古丁大袋 (6mg/9mg)","craft":"改良自欧洲销冠 Velo 的湿袋质感 · 多款果薄荷","views":"2025–2026 靠低价促销在美快速扩量","acclaim":"截至 2026.10 美版尚未获 FDA PMTA 正式授权","takeaway":"产品质感与 on! PLUS 直接对位，但监管确定性显著落后于已拿 6 张批文的 on! PLUS。","sourceLabel":"Tobacco Tactics","sourceUrl":"https://www.tobaccotactics.org/article/nicotine-pouches/"},{"category":"external","benchmark":false,"title":"FRE / ALP (高浓度网红湿袋阵营)","creator":"Turning Point Brands (TPB) & 合资厂牌","format":"20袋装高浓度湿润袋 (9mg / 12mg / 15mg)","craft":"主打极高尼古丁劲道与网红播客圈层营销","views":"线上与独立烟店增长快，主流连锁铺货有限","acclaim":"无 FDA 正式 MGO · 面临青少年监管审视","takeaway":"印证美国重度用户对 9mg–12mg 需求极其旺盛，on! PLUS 以合规大厂身份收割该需求。","sourceLabel":"30-Brand Guide","sourceUrl":"https://www.takeroon.com/blog/nicotine-pouch-brands-complete-guide"}],"peers_en":[{"category":"altria","benchmark":true,"title":"Subject: on! PLUS Soft-Feel Pouches","creator":"Helix Innovations LLC (Altria)","format":"Certified Child-Resistant Can + Catch Lid","craft":"NICOSILK™ plush pouch · 6/9mg MGOs + 12mg & fruit-mints","views":"120,000 US retail stores reached by Q2 2026","acclaim":"First 6 SKUs cleared under FDA's Dec 2025 Pilot!","takeaway":"Unites plush moist mouthfeel, an exclusive 9mg FDA MGO, and 120K-door AGDC reach.","sourceLabel":"FDA / Altria","sourceUrl":"https://www.fda.gov/tobacco-products/ctp-newsroom/fda-authorizes-6-nicotine-pouch-products-completing-review-record-time"},{"category":"altria","benchmark":true,"title":"Subject: FUMi International Pouches","creator":"Helix International (Altria)","format":"Nordic Round Can · 12 Differentiated Flavors","craft":"European-tailored soft flavor profiles","views":"40,000 retail locations across 7 international markets","acclaim":"Executes Altria's 2028 ex-US oral expansion goal","takeaway":"Opens multi-country international growth alongside UK/Sweden on! PLUS.","sourceLabel":"FY25 EX-99.1","sourceUrl":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000007/exhibit991erq42025.htm"},{"category":"external","benchmark":false,"title":"ZYN Classic (US Category Leader)","creator":"Swedish Match / PMI","format":"15-Count US Dry Can (3mg & 6mg)","craft":"Dry bitartrate pouch · 20 FDA-authorized SKUs","views":"~2/3 US pouch share · ~1/3 global pouch share","acclaim":"Dominant brand equity · Capped at 6mg in US MGOs","takeaway":"on! PLUS directly targets ZYN's two US blind spots: plush moist feel and 9mg/12mg strengths.","sourceLabel":"Tobacco Tactics","sourceUrl":"https://www.tobaccotactics.org/article/nicotine-pouches/"},{"category":"external","benchmark":false,"title":"Velo Plus (BAT US Moist Challenger)","creator":"R.J. Reynolds / BAT","format":"20-Count Moist Synthetic Can (6mg/9mg)","craft":"European-style moist pouch backed by deep US discounts","views":"Gained 2025–2026 US share via heavy retail promotions","acclaim":"Zero US FDA MGOs as of Oct 2026","takeaway":"Closest product-feel rival, but trails on! PLUS on FDA PMTA authorization.","sourceLabel":"Tobacco Tactics","sourceUrl":"https://www.tobaccotactics.org/article/nicotine-pouches/"},{"category":"external","benchmark":false,"title":"FRE & ALP (High-Strength Niche)","creator":"Turning Point Brands (TPB)","format":"20-Count High-Dose Moist Pouches (9/12/15mg)","craft":"Heavy-nicotine moist pouches · Digital/vape-shop focus","views":"Growing niche demand for >9mg strengths","acclaim":"Pending FDA review","takeaway":"Validates strong adult demand for 9mg–12mg tiers where on! PLUS brings 120K-store reach.","sourceLabel":"30-Brand Guide","sourceUrl":"https://www.takeroon.com/blog/nicotine-pouch-brands-complete-guide"}],"bars":{"title_zh":"on! PLUS 与 FUMi 全球商业化网络及产品参数里程碑拆解","title_en":"on! PLUS & FUMi Commercial Footprint & Regulatory Benchmarks","sub_zh":"核验自奥驰亚 2026Q2/Q3 财报与 2025 年报披露：展示渠道铺货广度（千家门店）对比","sub_en":"Verified retail store reach (in thousands) across Altria's next-gen smoke-free & non-nicotine launches","badge_zh":"合计触达 160,000+ 门店","badge_en":"160,000+ Combined US & Intl Doors","leg1_zh":"蓝色/绿色：on! PLUS 美国本土与 FUMi 国际覆盖门店数 (千家)","leg1_en":"Blue / Green: on! PLUS US & FUMi International Store Reach (K)","leg2_zh":"紫色/琥珀：奥驰亚其他创新单品渠道铺货参照 (千家 · 虚线=100K全国规模线)","leg2_en":"Purple / Amber: Internal Launch Benchmarks (K · Dashed = 100K National Scale)","max_x":140,"ref_line":100,"items_zh":[{"label":"on! PLUS 全美零售铺货门店数 (截至 2026Q2)","val":120,"disp":"120,000 店","sub":"2026.03 首发后单季达成","note":"迅速跨越 10 万店全国主流品牌门槛"},{"label":"Marlboro Cowboy Cut 价值高端子线门店数 (2026Q3)","val":100,"disp":"~100,000 店","sub":"内部爆款铺货速度参照","note":"on! PLUS 铺货广度甚至超越 Cowboy Cut"},{"label":"FUMi 国际化口含烟 7 国覆盖门店数 (截至 2025末)","val":40,"disp":"40,000 店","sub":"配备 12 款差异化风味","note":"奥驰亚海外无烟化最大实体零售支点"},{"label":"Proper Wild 植物功能能量饮覆盖门店数 (AGDC分销)","val":25,"disp":">25,000 店","sub":"超越尼古丁跨界参照","note":"AGDC 渠道复用能力的横向印证"},{"label":"全美 FDA 正式授权尼古丁袋总款数 (ZYN 20 + on! PLUS 6)","val":26,"disp":"26 款 MGO","sub":"其中 on! PLUS 独占 6 款","note":"全美合规白名单双寡头壁垒"}],"items_en":[{"label":"on! PLUS US Nationwide Retail Reach (Q2 2026)","val":120,"disp":"120K Doors","sub":"Achieved 1 quarter post-launch","note":"Instant national scale via AGDC"},{"label":"Marlboro Cowboy Cut Store Footprint (Q3 2026 Ref)","val":100,"disp":"~100K Doors","sub":"Internal rollout benchmark","note":"on! PLUS exceeded 100K doors even faster"},{"label":"FUMi International Oral Footprint (7 Markets)","val":40,"disp":"40K Doors","sub":"12 differentiated flavors","note":"Altria's largest ex-US retail network"},{"label":"Proper Wild Energy Shots via AGDC (2025)","val":25,"disp":">25K Doors","sub":"Non-nicotine distribution ref","note":"Demonstrates AGDC cross-category muscle"},{"label":"Total FDA-Authorized US Pouch SKUs (20 ZYN + 6 on!+)","val":26,"disp":"26 SKUs","sub":"Helix holds 6 (6mg & 9mg)","note":"Regulatory moat vs. unauthorized rivals"}]}},"ch4":{"eyebrow":"CHAPTER 04 · NEXT-GEN STORE VELOCITY & GLOBAL SIMULATOR","h2_zh":"四、单店动销与全球化现金流模拟：12 万美店 + 4 万海外店能释放多大增量？","h2_en":"4. Store Velocity & Global Simulator: Modeling 120K US + 40K International Doors","sub_zh":"从首季铺货试饮（Trial）迈向每周复购周转（Velocity），on! PLUS 是拉升 Helix 单价与份额的胜负手","sub_en":"Transitioning from 2026 launch trial promos to repeat weekly velocity across 160K+ combined global stores","badge_zh":"2025.11 再交 18 款新风味 PMTA","badge_en":"18 More Flavor SKUs in FDA Pipeline","econ_cards":[{"label_zh":"US RETAIL FOOTPRINT","label_en":"US RETAIL FOOTPRINT","val_zh":"120,000 店","val_en":"120,000 Stores","desc_zh":"若每家门店每周仅稳定动销 12–15 罐，单品年化即达 7,500万–9,300万罐纯增量。","desc_en":"At a modest steady-state velocity of 12–15 cans/store/week across 120K doors, on! PLUS scales toward 75M–93M incremental cans/yr."},{"label_zh":"ASP UPGRADE LIFT","label_en":"ASP UPGRADE LIFT","val_zh":"+20%–30% 单价","val_en":"+20%–30% ASP","desc_zh":"圆罐高端定位比早期促销方盒具备更高终端标价天花板与单罐美元毛利。","desc_en":"Premium round-can positioning lifts net manufacturer realization by +20%–30% vs. early trial-priced dry boxes."},{"label_zh":"GLOBAL FUMi REACH","label_en":"GLOBAL FUMi REACH","val_zh":"40,000 海外店","val_en":"40K Intl Doors","desc_zh":"叠加瑞典与英国直营电商，首次为奥驰亚打开非美货币收入池。","desc_en":"40,000 international FUMi doors plus UK/Swedish e-commerce establish Altria's first scalable non-USD oral revenue stream."},{"label_zh":"GLOBAL TAM CAGR","label_en":"GLOBAL TAM CAGR","val_zh":"~31.5% 行业增速","val_en":"~31.5% Mkt CAGR","desc_zh":"第三方机构估算 2025 全球尼古丁袋规模达 $6.70B，预计维持高速复合扩容。","desc_en":"External market studies peg global nicotine pouches at ~$6.70B in 2025, compounding at ~31.5% annually through 2030."}],"combo":{"title_zh":"on! PLUS 单店周均动销爬坡推演（罐/店/周）vs 驱动年化出货增量（百万罐）","title_en":"on! PLUS Weekly Cans/Store Velocity Ramp vs. Implied Annualized US Volume (M Cans)","sub_zh":"基于已落地的 120,000 家美国门店基数：单店周销从试饮期 4 罐升至稳态 15 罐即对应近亿罐规模","sub_en":"Across 120,000 verified US doors, scaling from 4 to 15 cans/store/week equates to ~94M annual cans","badge_zh":"12万店底座杠杆极强","badge_en":"High Operating Leverage on 120K Doors","left_zh":"■ 左轴：对应年化美国出货量 (百万罐)","left_en":"■ Left Axis: Implied Annual US Cans (M)","right_zh":"● 右轴：单店每周平均动销 (罐/店/周)","right_en":"● Right Axis: Velocity (Cans / Store / Wk)","leg1_zh":"对应年化罐数 (左轴 · M罐)","leg1_en":"Implied Annual Cans (Left · M)","leg2_zh":"单店周均动销 (右轴 · 罐/周)","leg2_en":"Weekly Store Velocity (Right · Cans/Wk)","line_badge_zh":"--- 12罐/周 商业化稳态目标线","line_badge_en":"--- 12 Cans/Wk Target Velocity","titles_zh":["2026Q1 铺货初段","2026Q2 首轮试饮","2026Q4 叠12mg/果味","稳态基准 (12罐/周)","强势抢份额 (18罐/周)"],"titles_en":["Q1'26 Seeding","Q2'26 Trial","Q4'26 +12mg/Fruit","Base (12/wk)","Bull (18/wk)"],"subs_zh":["渠道建库期","12万店到位","蓝莓/芒果/西瓜助推","占袋大盘 ~7%–8%","正面分流 ZYN/Velo"],"subs_en":["Wholesale fill","120K doors live","Fruit-mint boost","~75M cans/yr",">110M cans/yr"],"bars":[12.5,25.0,49.9,74.9,112.3],"line":[2.0,4.0,8.0,12.0,18.0],"max_bar":125,"min_line":0,"max_line":22,"ref_line":12,"u_bar":"M","u_line":"/wk","highlight_idx":3},"sim":{"title_zh":"on! PLUS (美国) + FUMi (国际) 多年期销量放量与研发/铺货回报模拟器","title_en":"on! PLUS & FUMi Multi-Year Scale & Launch ROI Simulator","toggle_title_zh":"开启 12mg + 6款新果薄荷 PMTA 后续获批与各州白名单清场 (+28% 动销加速)","toggle_title_en":"Enable 12mg & Fruit-Mint PMTA Clearance + State Directory Enforcement (+28% Lift)","toggle_sub_zh":"模拟未获批杂牌果味袋被清退后，on! PLUS 承接湿袋与高浓度客流的爆发力","toggle_sub_en":"Simulates share capture if state PMTA directories remove unauthorized flavored pouch rivals","s1_label_zh":"稳态首年美国 on! PLUS 出货罐数 (百万罐)","s1_label_en":"Year-1 US on! PLUS Cans Shipped (Million Cans)","s1_unit_zh":"M 罐","s1_unit_en":"M Cans","s1_min":35,"s1_max":150,"s1_step":5,"s2_label_zh":"高端圆罐成熟期单罐 OCI 净利 (USD / 罐)","s2_label_en":"Mature Premium Round-Can OCI (USD / Can)","s2_unit_zh":"/罐","s2_unit_en":"/can","s2_min":1.5,"s2_max":3.6,"s2_step":0.1,"s3_label_zh":"FUMi 7国 4万门店与英/瑞海外净现金贡献 ($M / 年)","s3_label_en":"Annual FUMi (7 Countries) & UK/SE International Lift ($M/yr)","s3_min":15,"s3_max":120,"s3_step":5,"roi_label_zh":"相对 ~$180M 研发/PMTA临床/首年铺货投入回报倍数","roi_label_en":"Payback Multiple vs. ~$180M R&D, PMTA & Launch Investment","cost_base_m":180,"mult":1.28,"vol_drift":1.18,"presets":{"p1":{"label_zh":"① 保守情景 (仅6/9mg薄荷冬青获批，果味与12mg受限)","label_en":"① Conservative 6-SKU Core Case","tag_zh":"50M罐 · 5年","tag_en":"50M · 5 Yrs","views":50,"v_per_view":2.0,"ancillary_m":25,"years":5,"transmedia":false},"p2":{"label_zh":"② 核心扩张基准情景 (75M罐起步 · 年复合+18% + FUMi放量)","label_en":"② Base Nationwide + FUMi Growth Case","tag_zh":"75M罐 · 5年","tag_en":"75M · 5 Yrs","views":75,"v_per_view":2.5,"ancillary_m":55,"years":5,"transmedia":true},"p3":{"label_zh":"③ 突破性抢占第二王座情景 (110M罐起 · 全面吃下湿袋份额)","label_en":"③ Bull Moist-Pouch Leadership Case","tag_zh":"110M罐 · 7年","tag_en":"110M · 7 Yrs","views":110,"v_per_view":2.9,"ancillary_m":95,"years":7,"transmedia":true}}},"moat_pos_zh":"<strong>1. 监管与产品力双重领跑：<\/strong>在湿润大袋赛道率先拿到 6 张 FDA 正式批文（含全美独家 9mg MGO），领先 Velo Plus 与 Rogue 一个身位。<br/><strong>2. 打开国际想象力：<\/strong>FUMi 4万门店证明奥驰亚也能在欧洲无烟市场攻城略地。","moat_pos_en":"<strong>1. Regulatory + Product First-Mover in Moist Pouches:<\/strong> Holds 6 FDA MGOs (including 9mg) ahead of moist-pouch peers.<br/><strong>2. Unlocks Ex-US TAM:<\/strong> FUMi's 40,000 stores establish a scalable international platform.","moat_risk_zh":"<strong>1. 早期试饮推广压制当期口含利润率：<\/strong>2026Q2–Q3 为支持 12万店试饮加大促销投入，导致口含分部调整后 OCI 率短期同比回落约 2.0–2.8pp（仍高达 66.4%）。<br/><strong>2. 12mg 与果薄荷新风味的 FDA 审批不确定性：<\/strong>若 FDA 拒绝批准果香薄荷或 >9mg 强度，部分延伸 SKU 需相应调整。","moat_risk_en":"<strong>1. Launch Trial Promo Drag:<\/strong> 120K-store trial investments trimmed Q3 Oral OCI margin by -2.8pp YoY (still a lofty 66.4%).<br/><strong>2. Pending FDA Review on 12mg & Fruit-Mints:<\/strong> 12mg and Blueberry/Mango/Watermelon SKUs still await formal MGOs."},"ch5":{"eyebrow":"CHAPTER 05 · RECORD-SPEED INNOVATION & GLOBALIZATION TIMELINE","h2_zh":"五、闪电战时间轴：从三州试水、FDA 破纪录获批到 16 万全球终端","h2_en":"5. Blitz Timeline: From 3-State Test & Record FDA Win to 160K+ Global Doors","sub_zh":"展示新任 CEO Sal Mancuso 治下奥驰亚最快的一次“研发—拿证—全国铺货”闭环","sub_en":"Tracing Altria's fastest R&D-to-FDA-to-120K-store execution cycle","badge_zh":"2025.09 试点 → 2025.12 获批 → 2026.03 全国首发 → 2026Q4 全矩阵","badge_en":"Sep'25 Pilot → Dec'25 MGO → Mar'26 US → Q4'26 Flavors","acts":[{"title_zh":"第一阶段 · 欧洲试炼、FUMi 布局与美南三州先锋测试 (2024–2025.11)","title_en":"Act I · UK/Sweden Seeding, FUMi Scale & 3-State US Launch (2024–Nov 2025)","badge_zh":"2025.11 补交18款PMTA","badge_en":"Nov'25 6-Flavor PMTA","desc_zh":"先在瑞典与英国打磨 NICOSILK™ 配方并把 FUMi 推向 7 国 4 万店；2025.10 登陆佛州、北卡与德州试销，11 月再交 6 新风味 PMTA <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000007/exhibit991erq42025.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FY25 Release ↗<\/a>。","desc_en":"Refined NICOSILK™ in Sweden/UK, scaled FUMi to 40,000 doors in 7 markets, launched in FL/NC/TX in Oct 2025, and filed 6 more flavors with FDA in Nov 2025 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000007/exhibit991erq42025.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FY25 Release ↗<\/a>."},{"title_zh":"第二阶段 · 2025.12.19 创纪录斩获 FDA 6 款批文与全美 12万店闪电战 (2025.12–2026Q2)","title_en":"Act II · Dec 19, 2025 FDA Pilot Victory & 120K-Store Blitz (Dec 2025–Q2'26)","badge_zh":"试点新政全美第 1 家","badge_en":"1st Pilot MGO Winner","desc_zh":"2025-12-19 获批 6 款 6mg/9mg MGO；2026-03-23 全国零售上架，至 Q2 末即覆盖 120,000 家门店并恢复三州 12mg 供货 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/on-PLUS-Expands-Nationwide-Retail-Availability/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Mar 23 Release ↗<\/a>。","desc_en":"Won 6 FDA MGOs Dec 19, 2025, launched nationwide March 23, 2026, and reached 120,000 stores by Q2 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/on-PLUS-Expands-Nationwide-Retail-Availability/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Mar 23 Release ↗<\/a>."},{"title_zh":"第三阶段 · 12mg 全国化与果薄荷三剑客登场 (2026Q3–Q4)","title_en":"Act III · Nationwide 12mg & Fruit-Mint Wave (2H 2026)","badge_zh":"蓝莓/芒果/西瓜薄荷","badge_en":"Blueberry / Mango / Watermelon","desc_zh":"2026Q3 完成 12mg 全国扩铺并推出蓝莓薄荷与芒果菠萝，Q4 在精选渠道推出西瓜薄荷，全面吹响份额反攻号角 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/Altria-Reports-2026-Third-Quarter-and-Nine-Months-Results-Announces-Expanded-Share-Repurchase-Program-Raises-2026-Full-Year-Earnings-Guidance/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Q3'26 CEO Quote ↗<\/a>。","desc_en":"Expanded 12mg nationwide in Q3 alongside Blueberry Mint and Mango Pineapple, followed by Watermelon Mint in Q4 2026 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/Altria-Reports-2026-Third-Quarter-and-Nine-Months-Results-Announces-Expanded-Share-Repurchase-Program-Raises-2026-Full-Year-Earnings-Guidance/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Q3'26 CEO Quote ↗<\/a>."}],"battles":[{"tag_zh":"战役 01 · 2025-12-19","tag_en":"Case 01 · Dec 19, 2025","sub_zh":"FDA 科学速审","sub_en":"Record-Time PMTA","title_zh":"力压群雄夺得 FDA 尼古丁袋试点计划首张通行证","title_en":"First Brand Authorized Under FDA's Pouch Pilot","desc_zh":"以零可检出致癌亚硝胺与认证防童罐赢得 FDA 高度认可 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.fda.gov/tobacco-products/ctp-newsroom/fda-authorizes-6-nicotine-pouch-products-completing-review-record-time\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FDA Newsroom ↗<\/a>。","desc_en":"Non-quantifiable carcinogenic HPHCs and child-resistant packaging clinched FDA's first pilot decision <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.fda.gov/tobacco-products/ctp-newsroom/fda-authorizes-6-nicotine-pouch-products-completing-review-record-time\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FDA Newsroom ↗<\/a>."},{"tag_zh":"战役 02 · 2026.03–06","tag_en":"Case 02 · Spring 2026","sub_zh":"AGDC 铁军推力","sub_en":"120K-Store Velocity","title_zh":"90 天内从区域试点横扫全美 120,000 家零售店","title_en":"Scaling to 120,000 US Stores in ~90 Days","desc_zh":"只有拥有万宝路与哥本哈根背柜控制力的 AGDC 才能在单季度内完成如此密度的铺货 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000093/exhibit991erq22026.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Q2'26 EX-99.1 ↗<\/a>。","desc_en":"Demonstrated AGDC's unmatched national convenience merchandising speed <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000093/exhibit991erq22026.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Q2'26 EX-99.1 ↗<\/a>."},{"tag_zh":"战役 03 · 2026Q3–Q4","tag_en":"Case 03 · 2H 2026","sub_zh":"风味与高劲突围","sub_en":"12mg + Fruit-Mints","title_zh":"推出 12mg 及蓝莓/芒果/西瓜薄荷精准破局同质化","title_en":"Launching 12mg & Fruit-Mint Extensions","desc_zh":"直接切入美国年轻成年口含用户最渴望的高浓度与复合果薄荷赛道 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/Altria-Reports-2026-Third-Quarter-and-Nine-Months-Results-Announces-Expanded-Share-Repurchase-Program-Raises-2026-Full-Year-Earnings-Guidance/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Q3'26 Release ↗<\/a>。","desc_en":"Addresses strong consumer demand for >9mg strengths and modern fruit-mint profiles <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/Altria-Reports-2026-Third-Quarter-and-Nine-Months-Results-Announces-Expanded-Share-Repurchase-Program-Raises-2026-Full-Year-Earnings-Guidance/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Q3'26 Release ↗<\/a>."},{"tag_zh":"战役 04 · 国际破局","tag_en":"Case 04 · Global Oral","sub_zh":"7国 40,000 门店","sub_en":"FUMi 40K Doors","title_zh":"FUMi 12 款风味横跨 7 国开辟海外第二战场","title_en":"FUMi Reaches 40,000 Retail Locations Across 7 Markets","desc_zh":"打破投资界对奥驰亚“100% 受困美国单一市场”的估值折价逻辑 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000007/exhibit991erq42025.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FY25 Goals ↗<\/a>。","desc_en":"Establishes a credible international smoke-free growth leg <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000007/exhibit991erq42025.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FY25 Goals ↗<\/a>."}],"laws":[{"zh":"后发者要想撼动先发霸主（ZYN），必须在体验维度（NICOSILK™ 湿感）与剂量维度（9mg/12mg）实施非对称超越。","en":"To challenge an entrenched leader like ZYN, attack where the leader isn't: plush moist comfort and 9mg/12mg strengths."},{"zh":"把“儿童安全包装 + 超洁净毒理数据”做成行业标杆，就能把严苛的 FDA 变成清剿灰色对手的盟友。","en":"Proactive child-resistant packaging and ultra-clean HPHC chemistry turn FDA scrutiny into a competitive moat."},{"zh":"首年 12万店铺货看覆盖（Distribution），次年胜负看复购周转（Velocity）与补贴退出后的真实净价。","en":"Year 1 is won on 120K-door distribution; Year 2 is won on repeat weekly cans-per-store after trial promos roll off."}]},"ch6":{"h2_zh":"六、“下一代柔感口含王牌”核查清单","h2_en":"6. 'on! PLUS & FUMi Next-Gen Oral' Moat Checklist","items_zh":[{"tag":"复购留存转化","title":"1. 试饮转复购测试：12万门店首轮促销试饮后，自然原价复购动销（Velocity）是否持续爬坡？","desc":"核心观察点：推动 Helix 尼古丁袋内份额从 13.5% 重返 15%–18% 扩张区间。"},{"tag":"12mg 正式过审","title":"2. 高浓度与新风味拿证测试：审查中的 12mg 及 2025.11 递交的 6 款新风味能否再获 FDA MGO？","desc":"一旦果薄荷或 12mg 正式获批，将形成全行业最强独占壁垒。"},{"tag":"净保护经典 on!","title":"3. 内部增量纯度测试：on! PLUS 新增客流是否主要抢自 ZYN/Velo/Rogue 而非仅分流经典 on!？","desc":"Q3'26 合并出货加速至 +13.3% 初步印证净增量效应显著。"},{"tag":"口含利润率回升","title":"4. 推广期后利润率修复测试：首轮铺货费用消化后，口含分部 OCI 率能否重回 68%+？","desc":"跟踪 SG&A 与首购补贴率随规模扩大自然摊薄。"},{"tag":"州白名单红利","title":"5. 州级 PMTA 名录执法测试：更多州清退未获批果味袋是否直接利好已拿证的 on! PLUS？","desc":"核查各州口含烟合规目录立法进展。"},{"tag":"FUMi 盈利贡献","title":"6. 海外 7 国单店产出测试：FUMi 4万门店与英/瑞业务何时跨过规模盈亏平衡贡献显著 OCI？","desc":"检验奥驰亚国际化团队的异地品牌运营能力。"}],"items_en":[{"tag":"Trial-to-Repeat","title":"1. Store Velocity Test: Are 120K US stores converting initial trial promos into repeat full-price turns?","desc":"Watch for Helix's share of US pouches to inflect upward from 13.5%."},{"tag":"12mg & Flavor MGOs","title":"2. Pipeline Authorization Test: Will FDA clear 12mg and the Nov 2025 fruit-mint PMTAs?","desc":"Formal MGOs on fruit-mints or 12mg would create a massive legal advantage."},{"tag":"Net Incremental Vol","title":"3. Low Internal Cannibalization Test: Is on! PLUS winning switchers from ZYN/Velo/Rogue?","desc":"Q3'26 re-acceleration to +13.3% total on! growth signals net expansion."},{"tag":"Margin Recovery","title":"4. Post-Launch Margin Test: Does Oral Adjusted OCI margin rebound toward ~68% as launch promos normalize?","desc":"Monitor quarterly Oral OCI margin trajectory."},{"tag":"Directory Tailwinds","title":"5. State PMTA Directory Test: Are state enforcement laws clearing unauthorized pouch rivals?","desc":"Only ZYN and on! PLUS hold formal FDA pouch MGOs."},{"tag":"FUMi Scale Economics","title":"6. International Breakeven Test: Are FUMi's 40K doors scaling toward meaningful ex-US profit?","desc":"Track Helix International disclosures in All Other."}]},"sources":[{"label":"FDA CTP Official Newsroom (Dec 19, 2025): FDA Authorizes 6 on! PLUS Nicotine Pouch Products in Record Time","url":"https://www.fda.gov/tobacco-products/ctp-newsroom/fda-authorizes-6-nicotine-pouch-products-completing-review-record-time"},{"label":"Altria Official Press Release (Mar 23, 2026): on! PLUS™ Expands Nationwide Retail Availability (NICOSILK™ Tech)","url":"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/on-PLUS-Expands-Nationwide-Retail-Availability/default.aspx"},{"label":"SEC Form 8-K Exhibit 99.1 — Altria Q2 2026 Results (on! PLUS Reaches 120,000 Stores Nationwide)","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000093/exhibit991erq22026.htm"},{"label":"Altria Q3 2026 Official Release (on! PLUS 12mg National Rollout & Blueberry Mint / Mango Pineapple / Watermelon Mint)","url":"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/Altria-Reports-2026-Third-Quarter-and-Nine-Months-Results-Announces-Expanded-Share-Repurchase-Program-Raises-2026-Full-Year-Earnings-Guidance/default.aspx"},{"label":"SEC Form 8-K Exhibit 99.1 — Altria FY2025 Results (FUMi 40,000 Stores in 7 International Markets & Nov 2025 PMTAs)","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000007/exhibit991erq42025.htm"},{"label":"2Firsts NACS Show 2026 Frontline Report: Verification of 12mg Regulatory Review Status & Booth Showcase","url":"https://www.2firsts.com/news/altria-showcases-ploom-marlboro-heated-tobacco-sticks-and-non-nicotine-energy-products-at-nacs-show-2026"}],"quickJumpZh":[{"sec":"sec-00","title":"00 单品定评与 FDA 破冰里程碑","sub":"试点首批6款MGO · 12万美店 + FUMi 7国4万店"},{"sec":"sec-01","title":"01 NICOSILK™ 柔感工程与风味扩张","sub":"丝滑湿感材质 · 认证防童罐 · 9mg/12mg+果薄荷"},{"sec":"sec-02","title":"02 四大王牌反攻支柱与五维雷达","sub":"独占合法9mg高劲带 · 超越ZYN 6mg天花板"},{"sec":"sec-03","title":"03 FDA 已获批全美 26 款尼古丁袋对决","sub":"对比 ZYN、Velo Plus、FRE/ALP 与海外 FUMi"},{"sec":"sec-04","title":"04 12 万店单店动销与国际化模拟器","sub":"周均动销爬坡与海内外双轮回报模拟"},{"sec":"sec-05","title":"05 从三州试水、FDA 闪电获批到七国出海","sub":"3个月拿证 · 90天铺满12万门店执行复盘"},{"sec":"sec-06","title":"06 下一代高端尼古丁袋核查清单","sub":"6项复购周转、12mg过审与出海核验"},{"sec":"sec-07","title":"07 FDA 批文与官方新闻稿核验索引","sub":"FDA CTP 公告与季报原文直达"}],"quickJumpEn":[{"sec":"sec-00","title":"00 Product Verdict & FDA Breakthrough","sub":"6 FDA Pilot MGOs · 120K US + 40K FUMi intl stores"},{"sec":"sec-01","title":"01 NICOSILK™ Tech & Flavor Pipeline","sub":"Plush moist matrix, child-safety can & 12mg/fruit-mints"},{"sec":"sec-02","title":"02 4 Challenger Pillars & Pouch Radar","sub":"Exclusive 9mg FDA MGO vs. ZYN's 6mg cap"},{"sec":"sec-03","title":"03 FDA-Authorized 26-SKU Showdown","sub":"Benchmarking ZYN, Velo Plus, FRE/ALP & FUMi"},{"sec":"sec-04","title":"04 120K-Store Velocity & Global Simulator","sub":"Weekly cans/store ramp & multi-year ROI model"},{"sec":"sec-05","title":"05 3-State Test to 120K US & 7-Country Rollout","sub":"Record-speed PMTA win & 90-day AGDC blitz"},{"sec":"sec-06","title":"06 Next-Gen Pouch Moat Checklist","sub":"6-point velocity, 12mg MGO & margin checklist"},{"sec":"sec-07","title":"07 FDA CTP Order & IR Sources","sub":"Direct links to FDA CTP newsroom & SEC filings"}]},{"id":"njoy_vapor","idx_num":9,"idx_pad":"09","filename":"mo_prod_09_njoy_ace_daily.html","checkKey":"mui_mo_checks_njoy","monogram":"NJ","short_zh":"NJOY ACE & DAILY","short_en":"NJOY ACE & DAILY","pill_kpi":"首批薄荷MGO · ITC专利战","docTitleZh":"《NJOY ACE & NJOY DAILY 合规雾化电子烟》深度商业与专利困局研报 | 王安安数据中心","docTitleEn":"NJOY ACE & NJOY DAILY FDA-Authorized E-Vapor & ITC Patent Case Monograph | Research Hub","crumb_zh":"NJOY ACE 换弹式 & NJOY DAILY 一次性合规雾化电子烟（NJOY, LLC）","crumb_en":"NJOY ACE Pod & NJOY DAILY Disposable E-Vapor (NJOY, LLC)","chip1_zh":"全美首获薄荷醇电子烟 FDA 授权","chip1_en":"1st FDA Menthol E-Vapor MGOs","chip2_zh":"ACE 遭 ITC 禁售 · DAILY 4款合规在架","chip2_en":"ACE Under ITC Ban · 4 DAILY SKUs Live","sidebar":{"badge":"NJOY LLC · FDA MENTHOL MGO vs. ITC BAN","title_zh":"NJOY 雾化电子烟研报","title_en":"NJOY E-Vapor Monograph","sub_zh":"硬核客观复盘：$27.5亿现金并购 → 2024.06 独揽全美首批薄荷醇电子烟 FDA MGO → 2025.03 败诉 JUUL 专利遭 ITC 禁令计提 $21.28亿减值 → DAILY 坚守与 ACE 2.0 破局期权","sub_en":"Candid post-mortem & optionality: $2.75B buyout → 1st FDA menthol MGOs → Mar 2025 ITC ban & $2.13B write-down → DAILY & ACE 2.0","mini_kpis":[{"label_zh":"FDA 正式获批电子烟总数","label_en":"FDA Authorized SKUs","val_zh":"10 款 (含4款薄荷醇)","val_en":"10 MGOs (4 Menthol)"},{"label_zh":"2025 电子烟减值与退出计提","label_en":"FY25 E-Vapor Write-Down","val_zh":"$2,128M (商誉+无形)","val_en":"$2,128M Impairment"},{"label_zh":"当前合法在架主力 / 客流","label_en":"Active Retail SKUs","val_zh":"4款 DAILY · 7M次行程","val_en":"4 DAILY · 7M Trips"}]},"toc":[["单品定评：FDA 皇冠与 ITC 铁幕交织","Verdict: FDA Crown Meets ITC Patent Wall"],["ACE 陶瓷芯换弹、DAILY 一次性与蓝牙锁","ACE Ceramic Pod, DAILY & Bluetooth 2.0"],["四大结构性张力与雾化赛道雷达","4 Structural Tensions & E-Vapor Radar"],["全美雾化电子烟合规巨头与灰产对比","US E-Vapor Authorized vs. Illicit Matrix"],["减值出清后绕道研发与执法弹性模拟","Post-Write-Down Redesign & Crackdown Sim"],["从 $27.5 亿并购、薄荷破冰到专利禁令","From $2.75B Deal & Menthol Win to ITC Ban"],["雾化业务反转与破局条件核查清单","E-Vapor Turnaround & Patent Checklist"],["FDA 批文、ITC 裁决与 SEC 减值信源","FDA MGOs, ITC Ruling & SEC Filings"]],"hero":{"strip1_zh":"单品客观定评：手握全美含金量最高的“薄荷醇电子烟 FDA 批文”王牌，却因输掉与 JUUL 的 ITC 专利战被迫停售主力 ACE，处于账面出清后的卧薪尝胆期","strip1_en":"Candid Verdict: Holds FDA's historic first Menthol E-Vapor MGOs, yet flagship NJOY ACE remains barred by a March 2025 ITC patent order—leaving 4 NJOY DAILY SKUs on shelf while redesigns advance","strip2_zh":"运营主体：NJOY, LLC (2023.06 以 $27.5亿现金并购 · FY2025 计提 $21.28亿非现金减值彻底出清)","strip2_en":"Operating Co.: NJOY, LLC ($2.75B Cash Buyout Jun 2023 · $2,128M FY25 Non-Cash Write-Down Completed)","strip3_zh":"数据基准：2026Q3 季报指引 & NACS 实测","strip3_en":"Baseline: Q3 2026 Guidance & NACS 2026","overline_zh":"CRITICAL CASE 09 · 全美首批 4 款薄荷醇电子烟 FDA MGO × 2025.03 ITC 排除令 × $2.13B 账面出清 × DAILY 坚守在架","overline_en":"CRITICAL CASE 09 · 1st 4 FDA Menthol E-Vapor MGOs × Mar 31, 2025 ITC Ban × $2.13B Write-Down × Active NJOY DAILY","h1_zh":"NJOY ACE & NJOY DAILY 深度复盘：<span class=\"gradient-accent\">攻克了最难的 FDA 薄荷醇审批高山，为何却倒在 ITC 专利排除令与非法一次性电子烟洪流面前？<\/span>","h1_en":"NJOY ACE & DAILY Deep Dive: <span class=\"gradient-accent\">Winning FDA's First Menthol E-Vapor Authorizations Only to Hit JUUL's ITC Patent Wall and Illicit Vape Headwinds<\/span>","lead_zh":"分析奥驰亚爆款矩阵绝不能报喜不报忧——<strong>NJOY<\/strong> 是理解美国电子烟“监管、专利与灰产三国杀”最深刻的商业标本。2023 年 6 月 1 日，奥驰亚斥资 <strong>$27.5 亿现金<\/strong>（外加最高 $5 亿里程碑）收购 NJOY <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2023/Altria-Completes-Acquisition-of-NJOY-Holdings-Inc.-Updates-2023-Full-Year-Earnings-Guidance/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NJOY Acquisition ↗<\/a>，并于 2024 年 6 月 21 日历史性斩获 <strong>FDA 史上首批薄荷醇电子烟上市许可（4 款：NJOY ACE 2.4%/5% 薄荷醇烟弹 + NJOY DAILY 4.5%/6% 薄荷醇一次性）<\/strong> <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2024/NJOY-Receives-First-FDA-Authorizations-for-Menthol-E-Vapor-Products/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NJOY Menthol MGO ↗<\/a>。然而天有不测风云：老冤家 JUUL Labs 发起美国国际贸易委员会（ITC）专利诉讼，裁定海外代工的 <strong>NJOY ACE<\/strong> 侵犯 4 项雾化结构专利，进口排除令与停售令于 <strong>2025 年 3 月 31 日正式生效<\/strong> <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.spglobal.com/ratings/en/regulatory/article/-/view/type/HTML/id/3369264\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">S&P Global ITC Report ↗<\/a>！奥驰亚在 2025 全年果断计提 <strong>$21.28 亿资产与商誉减值（含 $11.58 亿商誉减值）<\/strong>，并在 2026Q3 重申全年指引假设 <strong>NJOY ACE 在 2026 年内不重返市场<\/strong>，目前依靠不受禁令影响的 <strong>4 款 FDA 获批 NJOY DAILY / DAILY EXTRA<\/strong> 维持 700 万次便利店年行程与终端火种 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.2firsts.com/news/altria-showcases-ploom-marlboro-heated-tobacco-sticks-and-non-nicotine-energy-products-at-nacs-show-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2Firsts NACS 2026 ↗<\/a>。","lead_en":"A rigorous product study demands unvarnished candor on <strong>NJOY<\/strong>. Acquired on June 1, 2023 for <strong>$2.75B cash<\/strong> <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2023/Altria-Completes-Acquisition-of-NJOY-Holdings-Inc.-Updates-2023-Full-Year-Earnings-Guidance/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NJOY Acquisition ↗<\/a>, NJOY achieved a regulatory breakthrough on June 21, 2024 by winning the <strong>FDA's first-ever Menthol E-Vapor Marketing Granted Orders<\/strong> (4 products across NJOY ACE 2.4%/5% and NJOY DAILY 4.5%/6%) <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2024/NJOY-Receives-First-FDA-Authorizations-for-Menthol-E-Vapor-Products/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NJOY Menthol MGO ↗<\/a>. Yet following a patent suit by JUUL Labs, U.S. International Trade Commission (ITC) exclusion and cease-and-desist orders took effect <strong>March 31, 2025<\/strong> barring NJOY ACE imports and US sales <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.spglobal.com/ratings/en/regulatory/article/-/view/type/HTML/id/3369264\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">S&P Global ITC Report ↗<\/a>. Altria recorded <strong>$2,128M in FY2025 e-vapor goodwill and intangible impairments<\/strong>, assumes <strong>NJOY ACE does not return in 2026<\/strong>, and maintains retail presence via <strong>4 FDA-authorized NJOY DAILY / DAILY EXTRA disposables<\/strong> (7M annual c-store trips) while advancing non-infringing designs and Bluetooth age-locked <strong>NJOY ACE 2.0<\/strong> <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.2firsts.com/news/altria-showcases-ploom-marlboro-heated-tobacco-sticks-and-non-nicotine-energy-products-at-nacs-show-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2Firsts NACS 2026 ↗<\/a>.","thesis_cards":[{"title_zh":"FDA 薄荷醇 MGO 牌照资产本身并未作废（长期看涨期权）","title_en":"FDA Menthol MGOs Remain Valid Regulatory Gold","desc_zh":"ITC 禁令针对的是硬件结构专利与海外进口，而非撤销 FDA 授予的薄荷醇毒理许可；一旦完成规避专利结构重设并通过补充变更（SE/PMTA）或和解，牌照价值随时重燃。","desc_en":"ITC's import ban targets pod hardware patents—not NJOY's 10 underlying FDA MGOs (including 4 historic Menthol authorizations), preserving license value for a non-infringing redesign."},{"title_zh":"NJOY DAILY / DAILY EXTRA 四款合法一次性在架守阵地","title_en":"4 Authorized NJOY DAILY Disposables Remain Live on Shelf","desc_zh":"Rich Tobacco 与 Menthol（4.5% 与 6% 尼古丁）未受 ACE 换弹禁令波及，在 2026 NACS 展全系亮相并合法守住便利店雾化排面。","desc_en":"4 FDA-authorized NJOY DAILY disposables (Rich Tobacco & Menthol 4.5% / 6%) remain unaffected on convenience shelves, driving 7M annual trips."},{"title_zh":"蓝牙实名年龄锁 NJOY ACE 2.0 前瞻卡位青少年防控标准","title_en":"Bluetooth Age-Gated NJOY ACE 2.0 PMTA Pipeline","desc_zh":"2024 年 5 月已递交配备蓝牙设备访问限制技术（Access-Restriction）的 ACE 2.0 PMTA，绑定实名验龄解锁才能抽吸。","desc_en":"Submitted NJOY ACE 2.0 PMTA in May 2024 featuring Bluetooth age-verification access-restriction lock technology."}],"kpis":[{"label_zh":"FDA 正式获批电子烟 SKU","label_en":"FDA Authorized E-Vapor SKUs","badge_zh":"含首批 4 款薄荷醇!","badge_en":"Includes 4 Menthol MGOs","val_zh":"10 款 MGO","val_en":"10 MGOs","desc_zh":"全美仅奥驰亚 NJOY、BAT Vuse、JT Logic 等极少数巨头拥有 FDA 电子烟正式批文 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2024/NJOY-Receives-First-FDA-Authorizations-for-Menthol-E-Vapor-Products/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FDA Menthol MGO ↗<\/a>","desc_en":"Holds 10 rare FDA e-vapor MGOs—including the first 4 Menthol e-vapor authorizations in US regulatory history (Jun 2024) <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2024/NJOY-Receives-First-FDA-Authorizations-for-Menthol-E-Vapor-Products/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FDA Menthol MGO ↗<\/a>"},{"label_zh":"2025 全年减值与退出计提","label_en":"FY25 Impairment Charges","badge_zh":"账面风险一次性出清","badge_en":"Book Value Cleared","val_zh":"$2,128M","val_en":"$2,128M","desc_zh":"含 Q1 $873M + Q4 $285M 商誉减值及 Q4 $975M 确定寿命无形资产减值，轻装进入 2026 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000007/exhibit991erq42025.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FY25 Schedule 4 & 12 ↗<\/a>","desc_en":"Absorbed $2,128M non-cash impairments in FY2025 ($1,158M goodwill + $975M intangibles), de-risking the balance sheet for 2026+ <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000007/exhibit991erq42025.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FY25 Schedule 4 & 12 ↗<\/a>"},{"label_zh":"2025 调整后电子烟分部亏损","label_en":"FY25 E-Vapor Adj. OCI","badge_zh":"对集团 $12.6B OCI 占比<1%","badge_en":"<1% Drag on MO OCI","val_zh":"-$102M","val_en":"-$102M","desc_zh":"剔除减值与 ITC 退货特殊项后，FY2025 实际经营亏损仅 $102M，财务出血完全可控 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000007/exhibit991erq42025.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FY25 Schedule 15 ↗<\/a>","desc_en":"Excluding non-cash write-downs and ITC return items, FY2025 E-Vapor Adjusted OCI loss was a tightly contained -$102M <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000007/exhibit991erq42025.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FY25 Schedule 15 ↗<\/a>"},{"label_zh":"当前合法在售 NJOY DAILY","label_en":"Active NJOY DAILY SKUs","badge_zh":"4.5% & 6.0% 双浓度","badge_en":"4.5% & 6.0% Strengths","val_zh":"4 款在架 · 7M行程","val_en":"4 SKUs · 7M Trips","desc_zh":"Rich Tobacco 与 Menthol 四款获批一次性电子烟正常销售，年关联 700 万次便利店行程 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.2firsts.com/news/altria-showcases-ploom-marlboro-heated-tobacco-sticks-and-non-nicotine-energy-products-at-nacs-show-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2Firsts NACS ↗<\/a>","desc_en":"4 FDA-authorized Rich Tobacco & Menthol NJOY DAILY disposables remain actively sold nationwide (7M annual c-store trips) <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.2firsts.com/news/altria-showcases-ploom-marlboro-heated-tobacco-sticks-and-non-nicotine-energy-products-at-nacs-show-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2Firsts NACS ↗<\/a>"}]},"ch1":{"eyebrow":"CHAPTER 01 · PRODUCT HARDWARE, PATENT DISPUTE & REGULATORY ANATOMY","h2_zh":"一、产品技术架构与困局拆解：ACE 换弹系统、DAILY 一次性与 ITC 专利墙","h2_en":"1. Hardware Architecture & Patent Anatomy: ACE Pods, DAILY Disposables & ACE 2.0","sub_zh":"FEELM 陶瓷雾化芯换弹式 ACE（禁售改造中）× 一体式合规一次性 DAILY（正常在售）× 蓝牙验龄锁 ACE 2.0","sub_en":"Closed-pod ACE (barred under ITC order) × FDA-authorized DAILY disposables (active) × Bluetooth age-gated ACE 2.0","badge_zh":"2026 指引保守假设 ACE 年内不返场","badge_en":"FY26 Guidance Assumes Zero ACE Return","hub_title_zh":"NJOY 合规雾化矩阵（唯一攻克薄荷醇 FDA 审批 ↔ 受困海外代工进口排除令与灰色市场泛滥）","hub_title_en":"NJOY E-Vapor Architecture (Landmark FDA Menthol Science ↔ ITC Import Ban & Illicit Disposable Flood)","hub_sub_zh":"复盘“为什么买了全美最合规的电子烟，却依然遭遇双重大坑”的商业教训与破局路径","hub_sub_en":"Dissecting the two external shocks—JUUL's 4-patent ITC exclusion order and unregulated flavored disposables","nodes":[{"tag_zh":"CLOSED POD · 换弹主力(停售中)","tag_en":"NJOY ACE · CLOSED POD","name_zh":"NJOY ACE 磁吸换弹雾化器","name_en":"NJOY ACE Pod System (2.4%/5%)","desc_zh":"涵盖 Classic Tobacco、Rich Tobacco 与获批的 Menthol 2.4%/5% 烟弹；因侵犯 JUUL 4 项专利自 2025.03.31 起暂停美国进口销售。","desc_en":"Covers Classic Tobacco, Rich Tobacco, and FDA-authorized Menthol 2.4%/5% pods; paused US imports Mar 31, 2025 under ITC patent orders."},{"tag_zh":"ACTIVE DISPOSABLE · 在售火种","tag_en":"NJOY DAILY · ACTIVE ON SHELF","name_zh":"NJOY DAILY & DAILY EXTRA","name_en":"NJOY DAILY (4.5%) & EXTRA (6%)","desc_zh":"轻巧笔式一体一次性电子烟（Rich Tobacco & Menthol 共 4 款均获 FDA MGO），未受 ACE 禁令影响，持续守住便利店货架。","desc_en":"Compact pen-style disposables (Rich Tobacco 4.5% & Menthol 4.5%/6% Extra—all 4 FDA MGOs) unaffected by ACE pod litigation."},{"tag_zh":"NEXT-GEN ACCESS LOCK · 蓝牙锁","tag_en":"NJOY ACE 2.0 · BLUETOOTH PMTA","name_zh":"NJOY ACE 2.0 实名验龄蓝牙锁","name_en":"ACE 2.0 Access-Restriction Tech","desc_zh":"2024.05 递交 FDA PMTA，须通过手机蓝牙完成 21+ 生物/身份核验方可点火雾化，解决青少年滥用痛点。","desc_en":"May 2024 PMTA integrates smartphone Bluetooth 21+ identity authentication lock before firing the heating coil."},{"tag_zh":"PATENT WORKAROUND · 结构重设","tag_en":"NON-INFRINGING REDESIGN","name_zh":"规避专利气流/电极结构再工程","name_en":"Alternative Vaporizer Engineering","desc_zh":"工程团队正推进绕开涉诉专利的替代方案（或交叉许可谈判），但因需海关与 FDA 协调，2026 年内暂不计入收入预期。","desc_en":"Engineers are advancing non-infringing pod/vaporizer architectures (baked in at zero 2026 guidance contribution until cleared)."},{"tag_zh":"ILLICIT LITIGATION · 法律清剿","tag_en":"ANTI-ILLICIT CAMPAIGN","name_zh":"起诉数十家非法果味一次性厂商","name_en":"Litigation & State Vape Registries","desc_zh":"联合联邦多部门执法与各州 PMTA 合规电子烟注册法（Vape Directory Laws），推动清剿占据市场大头的走私果味一次性烟。","desc_en":"Champions federal multi-agency border seizures and state PMTA Vape Directory laws to clear illicit flavored disposables."},{"tag_zh":"INSURANCE OFFSET · 并购赔付","tag_en":"M&A INSURANCE & CONTINGENCY","name_zh":"并购保险理赔与或有对价重估","name_en":"R&W Insurance Offset","desc_zh":"2025 财报披露并购相关保险合同赔付部分抵消了 $51M–$71M 的 ITC 停售退货直接损失，且节省了未达标的或有里程碑付款。","desc_en":"M&A representation & warranty insurance recoveries partially offset $51M–$71M in FY25 ITC return charges while saving contingent earnouts."}],"platform_bars":[{"title_zh":"ITC 第 337 调查盲区教训：海外代工进口硬件受制于海关排除令（Exclusion Order）","title_en":"ITC Section 337 Lesson: Overseas Device Manufacturing Exposed to Import Bans","sub_zh":"不同于里士满本土制造的万宝路与 on! PLUS，电子烟硬件依赖亚洲供应链进口，一旦触发 ITC 337 专利排除令即被美国海关直接拦截。","sub_en":"Unlike Richmond-made Marlboro and on! PLUS, overseas device assembly exposed NJOY ACE to ITC Section 337 customs exclusion orders."},{"title_zh":"劣币驱逐良币困局：超 60%–70% 美国雾化市场长期被未获批果味一次性灰色产品把持","title_en":"Regulatory Arbitrage Paradox: Unregulated Flavored Disposables Crowd Out Legal MGOs","sub_zh":"老实遵守 FDA 仅售烟草/薄荷醇的合规品牌，在执法滞后期反而斗不过几千口水果冰激凌味走私一次性烟。","sub_en":"Slow federal enforcement allowed illicit 10,000-puff fruit disposables to crowd out compliant tobacco/menthol FDA MGO holders."}],"principles":[{"title_zh":"1. 两次电子烟豪赌（JUUL $12.8B + NJOY $2.75B）的深刻复盘","title_en":"1. Candid Post-Mortem on Altria's Two E-Vapor Bets","desc_zh":"2018 年入股 JUUL 折戟于青少年风波，2023 年改买纯合规标兵 NJOY 却遭 JUUL 反手专利狙击导致 FY2025 计提 <strong>$2,128M<\/strong> 减值 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000007/exhibit991erq42025.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FY25 Schedule 12 ↗<\/a>——凸显电子烟硬件缺乏传统烟草那样的确定性壁垒。","desc_en":"After JUUL ($12.8B stake write-down) and NJOY's <strong>$2,128M<\/strong> FY25 patent-ban impairment, Altria proved hardware-dependent vapor lacks traditional tobacco's moat certainty <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000007/exhibit991erq42025.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FY25 Schedule 12 ↗<\/a>."},{"title_zh":"2. 账面彻底洗澡后，下行风险已锁死在零附近","title_en":"2. Zero Remaining Balance-Sheet Overhang Entering 2026–2027","desc_zh":"经过 2025 年商誉与无形资产一次性减值及 2026 指引“零 ACE 返场预期”设定后，NJOY 现已变成一张<strong>零下行预期、纯上行催化（专利和解/改款获批/严打灰产）<\/strong>的免费看涨期权 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/Altria-Reports-2026-Third-Quarter-and-Nine-Months-Results-Announces-Expanded-Share-Repurchase-Program-Raises-2026-Full-Year-Earnings-Guidance/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Q3'26 Guidance ↗<\/a>。","desc_en":"With book value written down and zero ACE revenue assumed in 2026 EPS guidance ($5.66–$5.74), NJOY now trades as a <strong>zero-downside free call option<\/strong> on patent resolution or illicit crackdowns <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/Altria-Reports-2026-Third-Quarter-and-Nine-Months-Results-Announces-Expanded-Share-Repurchase-Program-Raises-2026-Full-Year-Earnings-Guidance/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Q3'26 Guidance ↗<\/a>."},{"title_zh":"3. DAILY 6% 薄荷醇一次性成为稀缺合法替代品","title_en":"3. NJOY DAILY Menthol Holds Rare Legal Disposable Ground","desc_zh":"在越来越多实施电子烟白名单立法的州（如路易斯安那、北卡、佛州等），清退非法一次性后，获批的 <strong>NJOY DAILY EXTRA Menthol (6%)<\/strong> 是便利店合法合规的直接承接者 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2024/NJOY-Receives-First-FDA-Authorizations-for-Menthol-E-Vapor-Products/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Menthol MGO ↗<\/a>。","desc_en":"Across 12+ states enforcing PMTA Vape Directories (LA, NC, FL, etc.), FDA-authorized <strong>NJOY DAILY EXTRA Menthol (6%)<\/strong> captures legal convenience demand <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2024/NJOY-Receives-First-FDA-Authorizations-for-Menthol-E-Vapor-Products/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Menthol MGO ↗<\/a>."}],"alert_zh":"<strong>一手财报精准数据核验：<\/strong>奥驰亚 FY2025 财报将电子烟单列为报告分部以完整披露减值——2024 年电子烟净营收 <strong>$40M<\/strong>、报告亏损 <strong>-$171M<\/strong>；2025 年受 ITC 禁令渠道退货冲减影响净营收为 <strong>-$13M<\/strong>，报告 OCI 为 <strong>-$2,297M<\/strong>（剔除 $2,128M 资产/商誉减值及 $67M 并购退出项后，<strong>调整后经营亏损仅为 -$102M<\/strong>）；2026 年起因体量回落重新归入“All Other”口径 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000007/exhibit991erq42025.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FY25 Schedule 15 ↗<\/a>。","alert_en":"<strong>Exact SEC Accounting Verification:<\/strong> Per FY2025 Schedule 15, E-Vapor posted FY2024 net revenue of <strong>$40M<\/strong> (OCI <strong>-$171M<\/strong>) and FY2025 net revenue of <strong>-$13M<\/strong> after ITC return reserves, with Reported OCI of <strong>-$2,297M<\/strong>—but stripping out <strong>$2,128M<\/strong> in impairments and $67M in ITC/deal items, <strong>Adjusted OCI loss was just -$102M<\/strong> <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000007/exhibit991erq42025.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FY25 Schedule 15 ↗<\/a>.","chart":{"tabA_zh":"视图A: NJOY 账面减值出清与经营损益拆解","tabA_en":"View A: FY24–25 Impairment Reset vs. Operating Loss","tabB_zh":"视图B: 全美合规获批电子烟品牌 MGO 版图对比","tabB_en":"View B: FDA-Authorized E-Vapor MGO Landscape","viewA":{"mode":"dual_bar_line","title_zh":"NJOY 电子烟分部：非现金减值/特殊项（$M）vs 实际调整后经营亏损收敛（$M）","title_en":"NJOY Financial Anatomy: Non-Cash Impairments ($M) vs. Underlying Adj. Operating Loss ($M)","sub_zh":"2025 年一次性出清 $2,195M 特殊减值包袱，而日常调整后经营投入从 $171M 收敛至 $102M","sub_en":"Cleared $2,195M in special write-downs in FY25 while trimming underlying operating cash burn from $171M to $102M","leg1_zh":"非现金减值与 ITC 特殊项计提 (左轴 · $M)","leg1_en":"Impairments & Special Charges (Left · $M)","leg2_zh":"调整后日常经营净投入亏损绝对值 (右轴 · $M)","leg2_en":"Underlying Adjusted OCI Burn (Right · $M)","labels_zh":["2024全年","2025Q1(首轮商誉减值)","2025Q4(无形资产出清)","2025全年合计","2026前9月(零新增减值)"],"labels_en":["FY 2024","Q1'25 Goodwill","Q4'25 Intangibles","FY25 Total","9M'26 Clean Base"],"subs_zh":["ACE 全力铺货期","$873M 商誉减值","$285M商誉+$975M无形","总特殊项 $2,195M","零商誉爆雷 · 轻装研发"],"subs_en":["ACE expansion yr","$873M goodwill","$1,260M Q4 write-down","$2,195M total special","$0 new e-vapor goodwill"],"s1":[0,873,1260,2195,0],"s2":[171,35,22,102,65],"max1":2400,"max2":200,"u1":"M","u2":"M"},"viewB":{"mode":"grouped_bars","title_zh":"美国四大合规电子烟巨头：FDA 获批总 SKU 数 vs 薄荷醇（Menthol）获批 SKU 数","title_en":"US Legal E-Vapor Leaders: Total FDA-Authorized SKUs vs. Authorized Menthol SKUs","sub_zh":"NJOY 在 2024.06 率先打破 FDA 薄荷醇电子烟零批准坚冰，拥有 4 款稀缺薄荷醇批文","sub_en":"NJOY broke FDA's menthol e-vapor logjam in June 2024 with 4 authorized menthol SKUs","leg1_zh":"FDA 获批电子烟产品总数 (款)","leg1_en":"Total FDA-Authorized E-Vapor Products","leg2_zh":"其中获批薄荷醇风味款数 (款)","leg2_en":"Authorized Menthol E-Vapor SKUs","labels_zh":["NJOY (奥驰亚)","Vuse Alto/Solo/Vibe (BAT)","JUUL (独立竞争对手)","Logic (日本烟草 JT)"],"labels_en":["NJOY (Altria)","Vuse Family (BAT)","JUUL Labs","Logic (JT Group)"],"subs_zh":["首家获批4款薄荷醇!","Vuse Alto 占合法换弹榜首","赢下对NJOY的ITC专利案","仅烟草味小众份额"],"subs_en":["1st 4 Menthol MGOs!","#1 legal pod share","Won ITC case vs. ACE","Tobacco-only niche"],"s1":[10,14,4,8],"s2":[4,7,2,0],"max1":16,"u1":"","u2":""}},"matrix_cards":[{"title_zh":"深度复盘：ITC 禁令究竟禁了什么、没禁什么？","title_en":"Exact Scope of the March 31, 2025 ITC Exclusion Order","badge_zh":"仅限 ACE · 不及 DAILY","badge_en":"ACE Only · DAILY Exempt","body_zh":"JUUL 主张的 4 项美国专利针对的是分体换弹式气道与低压降结构，因此 ITC 排除令仅禁止 <strong>NJOY ACE 主机与烟弹<\/strong> 的进口及在美销售，<strong>NJOY DAILY 一次性系列完全不在禁令范围内<\/strong> <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://settlementinsight.com/njoy-lawsuit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ITC Lawsuit Analysis ↗<\/a>。","detail_zh":"同时，奥驰亚自己也向 JUUL 发起了反向 ITC 专利侵权诉讼以增加交叉许可谈判筹码，并同步研发不落入涉诉权利要求的新一代雾化结构。","body_en":"JUUL's 4 asserted patents targeted closed-pod cartridge architecture, barring <strong>NJOY ACE devices and pods<\/strong> from March 31, 2025 while leaving <strong>NJOY DAILY and DAILY EXTRA disposables<\/strong> unaffected <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://settlementinsight.com/njoy-lawsuit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ITC Lawsuit Analysis ↗<\/a>.","detail_en":"Altria has pursued reciprocal patent counter-claims against JUUL alongside non-infringing pod redesigns."},{"title_zh":"为什么奥驰亚重估 2028 无烟营收目标？","title_en":"Why Altria Reassessed Its Original 2028 Smoke-Free Revenue Goal","badge_zh":"灰产干扰正规市场","badge_en":"Illicit Vape Distortion","body_zh":"奥驰亚在 2025 年报中坦诚说明：由于逃避监管的非法调味一次性电子烟持续扰乱市场，公司正在重新评估原定的美国无烟量化目标，待合法雾化市场秩序明朗后更新 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000007/exhibit991erq42025.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FY25 2028 Goals ↗<\/a>。","detail_zh":"在联邦海关与州政府真正掐断非法一次性供应链前，奥驰亚拒绝盲目烧钱贴补电子烟，转而把弹药集中投向高利润、零灰产的 on! PLUS 尼古丁袋。","body_en":"In its FY2025 release, Altria noted ongoing market disruption from illicit e-vapor products and prudently paused quantitative e-vapor targets rather than burning shareholder cash chasing unregulated disposables <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000007/exhibit991erq42025.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FY25 2028 Goals ↗<\/a>.","detail_en":"Capital was smartly redirected toward high-margin Helix pouches while keeping NJOY DAILY lean."}]},"ch2":{"eyebrow":"CHAPTER 02 · FOUR E-VAPOR REALITIES & 5-AXIS COMPETITIVE RADAR","h2_zh":"二、四大核心维度客观审视：NJOY 手里还剩哪些翻盘底牌？","h2_en":"2. Four Strategic Dimensions: Evaluating NJOY's Remaining Cards & Optionality","badge_zh":"护城河定性：高监管牌照壁垒 × 硬件专利受限修复中","badge_en":"Moat Rating: High FDA License Moat × Hardware Redesign Phase","pillars":[{"title_zh":"01 · 全美首家攻克 FDA 薄荷醇雾化科学审评（4 张 MGO）","title_en":"01 · First-Ever FDA Menthol E-Vapor Authorizations (4 SKUs)","badge_zh":"2024.06 历史破冰","badge_en":"Jun 21, 2024 Milestone","desc_zh":"证明薄荷醇雾化帮助成年烟民完全戒除卷烟的净收益大于青少年风险，含金量极高。","note_zh":"<strong>当前选中维度解读（01 薄荷醇批文壁垒）：<\/strong>99% 以上的电子烟申请在 FDA 处收到拒绝令（MDO），NJOY 握有的 4 张薄荷醇 + 6 张烟草味 MGO 是无法用钱速成的稀缺牌照资产 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2024/NJOY-Receives-First-FDA-Authorizations-for-Menthol-E-Vapor-Products/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FDA Menthol MGO ↗<\/a>。","note_en":"<strong>Selected Dimension (01 · FDA Menthol MGOs):<\/strong> Over 99% of e-vapor PMTAs received FDA denials; NJOY's 10 authorized SKUs (4 menthol) remain scarce regulatory licenses <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2024/NJOY-Receives-First-FDA-Authorizations-for-Menthol-E-Vapor-Products/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FDA Menthol MGO ↗<\/a>.","desc_en":"FDA confirmed NJOY Menthol vapor's adult cigarette-switching benefit outweighs youth risk—creating scarce regulatory IP."},{"title_zh":"02 · NJOY DAILY / EXTRA 一次性线稳守全美合规便利店","title_en":"02 · NJOY DAILY (4.5% & 6%) Preserves Legal Convenience Shelf","badge_zh":"700万次年便利店客流","badge_en":"4 Active SKUs · 7M Trips","desc_zh":"无需主机充电、开袋即抽，承接州级白名单清场后的合法一次性需求。","note_zh":"<strong>当前选中维度解读（02 DAILY 现役阵地）：<\/strong>2026 NACS 展台实拍确认 NJOY DAILY 与 DAILY EXTRA（4.5% 与 6% 烟草/薄荷醇）4 款获批产品全系正常供货 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.2firsts.com/news/altria-showcases-ploom-marlboro-heated-tobacco-sticks-and-non-nicotine-energy-products-at-nacs-show-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2Firsts NACS ↗<\/a>。","note_en":"<strong>Selected Dimension (02 · Active DAILY Lineup):<\/strong> Confirmed on display at NACS Oct 2026, all 4 FDA-authorized DAILY/EXTRA variants continue serving convenience retailers <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.2firsts.com/news/altria-showcases-ploom-marlboro-heated-tobacco-sticks-and-non-nicotine-energy-products-at-nacs-show-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2Firsts NACS ↗<\/a>.","desc_en":"Ready-to-vape 4.5% & 6% disposables retain convenience backbar slots without pod-hardware patent entanglement."},{"title_zh":"03 · NJOY ACE 2.0 蓝牙年龄验证锁代表下一代监管终局","title_en":"03 · NJOY ACE 2.0 Bluetooth Age-Lock Sets Future Standard","badge_zh":"2024.05 已交 PMTA","badge_en":"Bluetooth Access Lock","desc_zh":"硬件级防止未成年人盗抽借抽，为未来申请果味或换弹返场提供终极技术护盾。","note_zh":"<strong>当前选中维度解读（03 蓝牙验龄黑科技）：<\/strong>FDA 与国会议员长期呼吁电子烟强制植入防未成年人解锁芯片，ACE 2.0 提前卡位这一底层标准。","note_en":"<strong>Selected Dimension (03 · Device-Level Youth Lock):<\/strong> Bluetooth age-verification directly addresses regulators' #1 concern around youth access.","desc_en":"Hardware-level Bluetooth 21+ lock addresses FDA's #1 youth-access concern to unlock future pod and flavor approvals."},{"title_zh":"04 · 财务纪律严明：绝不向无底洞追加无效亏损补贴","title_en":"04 · Strict Capital Discipline: Capped Cash Burn (-$102M FY25)","badge_zh":"2025 账面彻底出清","badge_en":"Zero Goodwill Left","desc_zh":"果断减值 $21.28 亿认错出清，将日常费用压至占集团利润不足 1%，保住股东分红。","note_zh":"<strong>当前选中维度解读（04 止损纪律）：<\/strong>对比部分同行在亏损新业务上每年烧掉数十亿美元，奥驰亚将 NJOY 年经营净投入严控在 ~$100M 级别，丝毫未动摇 $4.44/股分红增长 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/Altria-Reports-2026-Third-Quarter-and-Nine-Months-Results-Announces-Expanded-Share-Repurchase-Program-Raises-2026-Full-Year-Earnings-Guidance/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Q3'26 Dividend ↗<\/a>。","note_en":"<strong>Selected Dimension (04 · Disciplined Containment):<\/strong> Containing underlying e-vapor burn to ~$102M (<1% of $12.57B group OCI) protected Altria's progressive dividend <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/Altria-Reports-2026-Third-Quarter-and-Nine-Months-Results-Announces-Expanded-Share-Repurchase-Program-Raises-2026-Full-Year-Earnings-Guidance/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Q3'26 Dividend ↗<\/a>.","desc_en":"Decisive $2.13B non-cash write-off and <$100M/yr ongoing spend cap protect Altria's $4.44/sh dividend and buybacks."}],"radar":{"title_zh":"美国雾化电子烟三大合规玩家与灰产阵营五维对比雷达图","title_en":"5-Axis US E-Vapor Competitive & Regulatory Radar (10-Point Scale)","axes_zh":["FDA薄荷醇批文","硬件专利安全性","便利店渠道资源","年龄锁技术储备","当前在架销量规模"],"axes_en":["FDA Menthol MGOs","IP / Patent Freedom","C-Store Access","Age-Lock Tech","Current Shelf Scale"],"s0_zh":"NJOY (奥驰亚 · 10款MGO · ACE改款中/DAILY在售)","s0_en":"NJOY (Altria · 10 MGOs · DAILY Live / ACE Barred)","s1_zh":"Vuse Alto & Vibe (BAT/雷诺 · 合法便利店第1)","s1_en":"Vuse Alto (BAT/Reynolds · #1 Legal C-Store Share)","s2_zh":"JUUL Labs (专利胜诉方 · 重新获批回归)","s2_en":"JUUL Labs (Patent Holder · Restored MGOs)","v0":[9.4,3.8,9.2,9.5,4.2],"v1":[9.5,8.2,9.4,8.0,9.6],"v2":[8.6,9.7,8.5,8.8,8.6]}},"ch3":{"eyebrow":"CHAPTER 03 · U.S. E-VAPOR AUTHORIZED & ILLICIT BENCHMARKING","h2_zh":"三、美国雾化电子烟全景对决：三大合法换弹巨头 vs 泛滥灰色一次性烟","h2_en":"3. US E-Vapor Matrix: NJOY vs. Vuse, JUUL & Unregulated Disposables","peers_zh":[{"category":"altria","benchmark":true,"title":"研究标的：NJOY DAILY & DAILY EXTRA (现役在售)","creator":"NJOY, LLC (奥驰亚全资)","format":"合规一次性笔式雾化烟 (4.5% & 6.0% 尼古丁)","craft":"Rich Tobacco & Menthol 共 4 款均握有 FDA 正式 MGO","views":"年关联 700 万次便利店行程 · 2026 NACS 主推","acclaim":"不受 ACE 换弹专利禁令波及 · 全美罕见获批薄荷一次性","takeaway":"在各州实施电子烟白名单目录清剿灰产后，具备显著合规补位弹性。","sourceLabel":"NACS / FDA MGO","sourceUrl":"https://www.2firsts.com/news/altria-showcases-ploom-marlboro-heated-tobacco-sticks-and-non-nicotine-energy-products-at-nacs-show-2026"},{"category":"altria","benchmark":true,"title":"研究标的：NJOY ACE & ACE 2.0 (整改储备中)","creator":"NJOY, LLC (奥驰亚全资)","format":"磁吸换弹主机 + 2.4%/5.0% 陶瓷芯烟弹","craft":"获批烟草与薄荷醇 MGO · ACE 2.0 植入蓝牙验龄锁","views":"自 2025-03-31 起受 ITC 排除令暂停在美销售 (2026不返场)","acclaim":"曾于 2024 扩铺 >10万店 · 账面 $2.13B 减值已出清","takeaway":"短期零收入贡献，中长期取决于非侵权结构获批或与 JUUL 达成专利交叉和解。","sourceLabel":"Q3'26 / S&P","sourceUrl":"https://www.spglobal.com/ratings/en/regulatory/article/-/view/type/HTML/id/3369264"},{"category":"external","benchmark":false,"title":"Vuse Alto (全美合法便利店换弹第 1 名)","creator":"R.J. Reynolds Vapor / 英美烟草 (BAT)","format":"磁吸换弹雾化器 (1.8% / 2.4% / 5.0%)","craft":"Golden Tobacco 与 Menthol 核心款已获 FDA 授权","views":"全美合法扫描渠道市场份额第 1 (>40% 便利店份额)","acclaim":"NJOY ACE 停售后最大直接受益者之一","takeaway":"同样饱受非法一次性果味烟挤压，但凭借专利稳健吃下了合规便利店头把交椅。","sourceLabel":"S&P E-Vapor","sourceUrl":"https://www.spglobal.com/ratings/en/regulatory/article/-/view/type/HTML/id/3369264"},{"category":"external","benchmark":false,"title":"JUUL (专利原告与换弹鼻祖复苏)","creator":"JUUL Labs, Inc. (奥驰亚已于2023退出持股)","format":"经典微换弹系统 (3% & 5% Virginia Tobacco / Menthol)","craft":"握有核心温控与低压降换弹专利组合","views":"便利店合法份额稳居第 2 · 赢下对 NJOY 的 ITC 禁令","acclaim":"撤销早年 MDO 后重获生机 · 专利武器极具威慑","takeaway":"用专利诉讼成功锁喉老东家奥驰亚的 NJOY ACE，展现了硬件 IP 的致命杀伤力。","sourceLabel":"ITC Lawsuit","sourceUrl":"https://settlementinsight.com/njoy-lawsuit"},{"category":"external","benchmark":false,"title":"Geek Bar / Raz / Lost Mary 等非法一次性灰产","creator":"海外未获批制造商与独立烟店分销网","format":"15,000–25,000口带大屏甜味水果一次性电子烟","craft":"零 FDA PMTA 批文 · 逃避正规监管走私入境","views":"占据全美实际电子烟消费总盘过半份额","acclaim":"引发美国卷烟销量下滑与 NJOY/Vuse 增长放缓的元凶","takeaway":"奥驰亚 2026 指引明确指出雾化增长放缓与灰产冲击；海关与州白名单执法是最大变量。","sourceLabel":"Altria Lawsuit","sourceUrl":"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2023/NJOY-Brings-Sweeping-Litigation-Against-Illicit-Disposable-Vapor-Manufacturers/default.aspx"}],"peers_en":[{"category":"altria","benchmark":true,"title":"Subject: NJOY DAILY & DAILY EXTRA (Active)","creator":"NJOY, LLC (Altria 100%)","format":"FDA-Authorized Disposable E-Cigarettes (4.5% & 6%)","craft":"4 authorized SKUs in Rich Tobacco & Menthol","views":"7M annual convenience-store trips · Featured at NACS 2026","acclaim":"Exempt from ACE ITC ban · Rare legal menthol disposable","takeaway":"Maintains Altria's legal e-vapor shelf seat and stands to gain as state PMTA directories expand.","sourceLabel":"NACS / FDA MGO","sourceUrl":"https://www.2firsts.com/news/altria-showcases-ploom-marlboro-heated-tobacco-sticks-and-non-nicotine-energy-products-at-nacs-show-2026"},{"category":"altria","benchmark":true,"title":"Subject: NJOY ACE & ACE 2.0 (Redesign/PMTA)","creator":"NJOY, LLC (Altria 100%)","format":"Closed-Pod System (2.4% & 5% Tobacco/Menthol)","craft":"Ceramic coil pods + Bluetooth age-locked ACE 2.0","views":"Barred from US sale since Mar 31, 2025 (0 FY26 assumption)","acclaim":"Holds landmark Menthol MGOs · $2.13B book value cleared","takeaway":"Pure upside call option post-2026 via non-infringing pod clearance or patent settlement.","sourceLabel":"Q3'26 / S&P","sourceUrl":"https://www.spglobal.com/ratings/en/regulatory/article/-/view/type/HTML/id/3369264"},{"category":"external","benchmark":false,"title":"Vuse Alto (#1 Legal Convenience E-Vapor)","creator":"R.J. Reynolds Vapor / BAT","format":"Closed-Pod Leader (1.8% / 2.4% / 5.0%)","craft":"FDA-authorized Golden Tobacco & Menthol pods","views":"#1 tracked US c-store e-vapor share (>40%)","acclaim":"Captured displaced NJOY ACE pod users in 2025","takeaway":"Dominates tracked convenience pods, though still pressured by illicit disposables.","sourceLabel":"S&P E-Vapor","sourceUrl":"https://www.spglobal.com/ratings/en/regulatory/article/-/view/type/HTML/id/3369264"},{"category":"external","benchmark":false,"title":"JUUL System (#2 Legal Pod System)","creator":"JUUL Labs, Inc.","format":"Compact Closed-Pod (3% & 5% Tobacco/Menthol)","craft":"Core foundational vaporizer & pressure-drop patents","views":"#2 tracked c-store pod share · Enforced 4 patents vs. NJOY","acclaim":"Successfully blocked NJOY ACE at the ITC","takeaway":"Demonstrated that hardware IP matters as much as FDA authorization in e-vapor.","sourceLabel":"ITC Lawsuit","sourceUrl":"https://settlementinsight.com/njoy-lawsuit"},{"category":"external","benchmark":false,"title":"Unregulated Flavored Disposables (Geek Bar / Raz)","creator":"Illicit Offshore Makers & Vape-Shop Distributors","format":"High-Puff Sweet Fruit/Ice Disposables","craft":"Zero FDA MGOs · Evading PMTA pathway","views":"Estimated majority of total US e-vapor consumption","acclaim":"Target of NJOY federal lawsuits & state directory laws","takeaway":"Federal border seizures and state PMTA registries remain the key industry swing factor.","sourceLabel":"Altria Lawsuit","sourceUrl":"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2023/NJOY-Brings-Sweeping-Litigation-Against-Illicit-Disposable-Vapor-Manufacturers/default.aspx"}],"bars":{"title_zh":"奥驰亚两代雾化与无烟资本配置成败复盘：初始投入 vs 2025末累计减值对比（$ 十亿美元）","title_en":"Altria Capital Allocation Scorecard Across Smoke-Free Deals ($ Billions)","sub_zh":"客观呈现奥驰亚在电子烟（JUUL/NJOY）缴纳的高昂学费，对比雪茄（Middleton）与口含袋（Helix）的巨大成功","sub_en":"Contrasting e-vapor write-downs (JUUL, NJOY) against zero-impairment home runs in Middleton, USSTC & Helix","badge_zh":"电子烟学费已全额计提完毕","badge_en":"E-Vapor Write-Downs Fully Absorbed","leg1_zh":"红色/琥珀：历史并购投入与电子烟减值规模 ($B)","leg1_en":"Red / Amber: Deal Outlay & E-Vapor Write-Downs ($B)","leg2_zh":"绿色/蓝色：成功回收现金或零减值高回报交易参照 ($B)","leg2_en":"Green / Blue: High-ROI Cash Harvesting Deals ($B)","max_x":14.0,"ref_line":2.75,"items_zh":[{"label":"2018 入股 JUUL 35% 股权初始投入 (已退出并获税盾)","val":12.8,"disp":"$12.80B","sub":"历史最大无烟试错学费","note":"2024.10 与 IRS 达成协议释放近 $1B 税务收益"},{"label":"2023.06 全资收购 NJOY 初始现金对价","val":2.75,"disp":"$2.75B","sub":"看中 FDA 正式获批牌照","note":"2024 顺利拿下薄荷醇 MGO，但遭 ITC 专利阻击"},{"label":"2024.04 出让美国 IQOS 商业化权收回税前现金收益","val":2.7,"disp":"+$2.70B","sub":"来自 PMI 的巨额现金补偿!","note":"一举全额覆盖了收购 NJOY 的 $2.75B 现金支出!"},{"label":"2025 全年电子烟分部计提资产与商誉减值总额","val":2.13,"disp":"$2.13B","sub":"$1.16B商誉 + $0.98B无形","note":"非现金账面出清，2026 起零历史包袱"},{"label":"2007 收购 John Middleton (Black & Mild) 净成本","val":2.2,"disp":"$2.20B","sub":"0 减值 · 年赚 ~$700M+","note":"十九年累计收回并购款数倍以上"},{"label":"2019–2021 全资收购 Helix (on! 尼古丁袋) 总成本","val":0.25,"disp":"~$0.25B","sub":"0 减值 · 年冲 ~1.92亿罐","note":"仅 $2.5亿撬动十亿美元级无烟核心支柱"}],"items_en":[{"label":"2018 JUUL 35% Minority Investment (Exited 2023)","val":12.8,"disp":"$12.80B","sub":"Historic e-vapor tuition","note":"Yielded ~$969M IRS tax-benefit release in FY24"},{"label":"June 2023 NJOY Holdings Cash Acquisition Cost","val":2.75,"disp":"$2.75B","sub":"Bought for FDA PMTA moat","note":"Funded virtually dollar-for-dollar by IQOS exit"},{"label":"April 2024 IQOS Rights Sale Cash Gain from PMI","val":2.7,"disp":"+$2.70B","sub":"Pre-tax cash windfall!","note":"Effectively financed 98% of the NJOY outlay"},{"label":"FY2025 NJOY E-Vapor Goodwill & Asset Impairments","val":2.13,"disp":"$2.13B","sub":"Non-cash accounting reset","note":"Leaves clean post-2025 balance sheet"},{"label":"2007 John Middleton (Black & Mild) Net Deal Cost","val":2.2,"disp":"$2.20B","sub":"$0 write-down · ~1.8B sticks","note":"Multi-fold cash payback home run"},{"label":"2019–2021 Helix (on! Pouches) Total Buyout Cost","val":0.25,"disp":"~$0.25B","sub":"$0 write-down · ~192M cans","note":"Phenomenal smoke-free M&A winner"}]}},"ch4":{"eyebrow":"CHAPTER 04 · OPTIONALITY ECONOMICS & TURNAROUND SIMULATOR","h2_zh":"四、期权估值与破局模拟：账面归零后，DAILY 扩量 + ACE 改款返场值多少钱？","h2_en":"4. Turnaround Economics & Simulator: Modeling DAILY Registry Gains & ACE 2.0 Return","sub_zh":"由于 2026 市场一致预期中 NJOY 贡献已降为零，任何州级白名单执法或 2027+ 新结构返场均为纯上行惊喜","sub_en":"With consensus pricing zero value into NJOY for 2026, state PMTA directory enforcement and post-2026 ACE redesign represent pure upside","badge_zh":"2024 IQOS $2.7B 现金实质已对冲并购款","badge_en":"$2.7B IQOS Cash Offset Deal Outlay","econ_cards":[{"label_zh":"BOOK VALUE RISK","label_en":"BOOK VALUE RISK","val_zh":"近乎出清","val_en":"De-Risked Base","desc_zh":"$2,128M 非现金减值已在 2025 计提完毕，不再拖累 2026+ GAAP 与调整后 EPS。","desc_en":"$2,128M FY2025 non-cash write-off eliminates future goodwill/intangible drag on 2026+ GAAP and Adjusted EPS."},{"label_zh":"ANNUAL BURN CAP","label_en":"ANNUAL BURN CAP","val_zh":"~$80M–$100M","val_en":"~$80M–$100M","desc_zh":"精简维护 DAILY 渠道与推进 ACE 非侵权改款研发，占集团现金流不足 1%。","desc_en":"Streamlined NJOY DAILY distribution and ACE redesign R&D consume <1% of Altria's $12.6B annual Adjusted OCI."},{"label_zh":"STATE DIRECTORIES","label_en":"STATE DIRECTORIES","val_zh":">12 州立法推进","val_en":"12+ PMTA States","desc_zh":"越来越多州强制便利店只能销售 FDA 已获批或白名单电子烟，直接利好 DAILY 4 款 MGO。","desc_en":"12+ state PMTA Vape Directory laws purging unauthorized disposables directly benefit NJOY DAILY's 4 legal SKUs."},{"label_zh":"2027+ CALL OPTION","label_en":"2027+ CALL OPTION","val_zh":"ACE 改款/2.0","val_en":"ACE Redesign/2.0","desc_zh":"一旦绕开 4 项专利或达成交叉授权，30万 AGDC 门店可迅速重启薄荷换弹铺货。","desc_en":"Patent workaround, settlement, or ACE 2.0 FDA clearance would re-activate 300K AGDC doors for legal menthol pods."}],"combo":{"title_zh":"NJOY 阶段情景路线：DAILY 维持期（2025–2026）→ 潜在改款/执法修复轨迹","title_en":"NJOY Turnaround Trajectory: Post-Ban Floor (2025–2026) vs. Potential Post-2026 Recovery","sub_zh":"2026 严格按官方指引（ACE 不返场、仅 DAILY 在架）做保守锚定，展示损益收敛路径","sub_en":"Anchored to Altria's official FY2026 guidance (zero ACE return in 2026; DAILY active on shelf)","badge_zh":"止血控费 · 静待专利破冰","badge_en":"Contained Burn · Patent Optionality","left_zh":"■ 左轴：合规在架折算营收基数 ($M)","left_en":"■ Left Axis: Active Legal Revenue Base ($M)","right_zh":"● 右轴：调整后经营损益 ($M · 负值收敛向盈亏平衡)","right_en":"● Right Axis: Adjusted OCI ($M · Narrowing Burn)","leg1_zh":"合规雾化净营收基数 (左轴 · $M)","leg1_en":"Net Revenue Base (Left · $M)","leg2_zh":"调整后经营 OCI (右轴 · $M)","leg2_en":"Adjusted OCI (Right · $M)","line_badge_zh":"--- $0M 盈亏平衡线","line_badge_en":"--- $0M Breakeven Line","titles_zh":["2024全年(禁令前)","2025全年(退货冲减)","2026指引期(仅DAILY)","情景A:白名单扩量","情景B:新ACE返场"],"titles_en":["FY24 (Pre-Ban)","FY25 (ITC Impact)","FY26E (DAILY Only)","Case A: Directories","Case B: ACE 2.0"],"subs_zh":["营收 $40M","退货后 -$13M","ACE 2026不返场","各州清剿灰产","专利解决+蓝牙2.0"],"subs_en":["$40M net rev","-$13M post-returns","No ACE in 2026","State directory lift","Post-patent relaunch"],"bars":[40,10,28,85,240],"line":[-171,-102,-75,-20,45],"max_bar":280,"min_line":-200,"max_line":80,"ref_line":0,"u_bar":"M","u_line":"M","highlight_idx":2},"sim":{"title_zh":"NJOY 雾化业务重整期权模拟器（DAILY 白名单红利 + 2027+ 新硬件返场测算）","title_en":"NJOY E-Vapor Optionality Simulator (DAILY Directory Lift + Post-2026 ACE Relaunch)","toggle_title_zh":"开启 2027+ 非侵权新换弹/ACE 2.0 返场 + 州白名单清剿灰产 (+35% 价值释放)","toggle_title_en":"Enable Post-2026 Non-Infringing ACE Relaunch + State Vape Enforcement (+35% Lift)","toggle_sub_zh":"模拟解决专利障碍并严打非法一次性后，10 张 FDA 批文重新兑现渠道价值","toggle_sub_en":"Models monetizing NJOY's 10 FDA MGOs once patent workarounds clear customs/FDA","s1_label_zh":"年化合规烟弹/DAILY 销量规模 (百万支/颗)","s1_label_en":"Annual Legal Pods / DAILY Units Sold (Millions)","s1_unit_zh":"M 支","s1_unit_en":"M Units","s1_min":15,"s1_max":180,"s1_step":15,"s2_label_zh":"单颗烟弹/一次性成熟边际毛利 (USD / 单位)","s2_label_en":"Unit Gross Margin Contribution (USD / Unit)","s2_unit_zh":"/支","s2_unit_en":"/unit","s2_min":0.8,"s2_max":2.6,"s2_step":0.2,"s3_label_zh":"专利交叉许可/保险追偿与严打灰产回流增量 ($M / 年)","s3_label_en":"IP Settlement / Enforcement Spillover Lift ($M/yr)","s3_min":0,"s3_max":90,"s3_step":10,"roi_label_zh":"相对重整期 ~$150M 改款工程与法务预算回收倍数","roi_label_en":"Payback Multiple vs. ~$150M Redesign & Legal Budget","cost_base_m":150,"mult":1.35,"vol_drift":1.15,"presets":{"p1":{"label_zh":"① 2026 现状延续情景 (仅靠 4 款 DAILY 守摊，ACE 长期缺席)","label_en":"① Status-Quo DAILY-Only Case (No ACE Return)","tag_zh":"20M支 · 5年","tag_en":"20M · 5 Yrs","views":20,"v_per_view":1.2,"ancillary_m":5,"years":5,"transmedia":false},"p2":{"label_zh":"② 温和修复基准情景 (州白名单助推 DAILY + 2027 改款小幅回归)","label_en":"② Moderate Redesign & Directory Recovery","tag_zh":"65M支 · 5年","tag_en":"65M · 5 Yrs","views":65,"v_per_view":1.8,"ancillary_m":25,"years":5,"transmedia":true},"p3":{"label_zh":"③ 全面反转牛市情景 (ACE 2.0 获批 + 联邦严打灰产收复失地)","label_en":"③ Bull ACE 2.0 + Federal Illicit Crackdown","tag_zh":"135M支 · 7年","tag_en":"135M · 7 Yrs","views":135,"v_per_view":2.2,"ancillary_m":60,"years":7,"transmedia":true}}},"moat_pos_zh":"<strong>1. 薄荷醇 FDA 批文稀缺性不灭：<\/strong>全美首家跑通薄荷醇电子烟 PMTA 临床与人群净获益逻辑。<br/><strong>2. 预期彻底见底：<\/strong>$21.28 亿减值已计提，且 2024 年收回的 $27 亿 IQOS 现金在集团现金表上早已对冲了并购本金。","moat_pos_en":"<strong>1. Irreplaceable FDA Menthol MGO Precedent:<\/strong> First company to clear FDA's menthol e-vapor evidentiary bar.<br/><strong>2. Washed-Out Expectations:<\/strong> $2.13B write-down is behind Altria, and 2024's $2.7B IQOS cash receipt effectively offset the $2.75B purchase outlay.","moat_risk_zh":"<strong>1. 非侵权结构若涉及实质改动需重走 FDA 补充审批：<\/strong>硬件气道改动与 FDA 法规绑定造成“改太多怕丢 MGO、改太少怕过不了海关”的两难。<br/><strong>2. 非法一次性电子烟执法慢于预期：<\/strong>若边境与零售端灰产长期猖獗，合规烟草/薄荷醇电子烟天花板依然受限。","moat_risk_en":"<strong>1. Catch-22 Between Patent Workaround & FDA Scope:<\/strong> Substantial hardware changes to avoid JUUL patents may require supplemental FDA review.<br/><strong>2. Persistent Illicit Disposable Competition:<\/strong> Slow federal enforcement keeps unregulated fruit vapes entrenched."},"ch5":{"eyebrow":"CHAPTER 05 · NJOY M&A, MENTHOL VICTORY & ITC SHOCK TIMELINE","h2_zh":"五、三年跌宕全纪实：从退股 JUUL 转娶 NJOY，到薄荷封神与专利滑铁卢","h2_en":"5. Three-Year Rollercoaster: From 2023 Buyout & 2024 Menthol Win to 2025 ITC Ban","sub_zh":"一份不回避挫折的完整时间线，看清美国电子烟赛道的残酷丛林法则","sub_en":"An objective timeline of regulatory triumph, IP warfare, and disciplined financial containment","badge_zh":"2023.06 交割 → 2024.06 薄荷MGO → 2025.03 ITC禁令 → 2026 蛰伏改款","badge_en":"Jun'23 Close → Jun'24 Menthol MGO → Mar'25 Ban → 2026 Redesign","acts":[{"title_zh":"第一阶段 · 告别 JUUL 泥潭、$27.5亿全资迎娶合规标兵 NJOY (2023.03–2024.05)","title_en":"Act I · Exiting JUUL, $2.75B NJOY Buyout & ACE 2.0 Filing (2023–May 2024)","badge_zh":"迅速扩铺 >10万门店","badge_en":"Scaled >100K Stores","desc_zh":"2023.06.01 完成收购唯一独立拥有多张 FDA 批文的 NJOY，用 AGDC 迅速把 ACE 铺进超 10 万店，并于 2024.05 递交蓝牙验龄锁 ACE 2.0 PMTA <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2023/Altria-Completes-Acquisition-of-NJOY-Holdings-Inc.-Updates-2023-Full-Year-Earnings-Guidance/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Deal Close ↗<\/a>。","desc_en":"Closed $2.75B NJOY acquisition June 1, 2023, expanded retail distribution via AGDC, and submitted Bluetooth age-gated ACE 2.0 PMTAs in May 2024 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2023/Altria-Completes-Acquisition-of-NJOY-Holdings-Inc.-Updates-2023-Full-Year-Earnings-Guidance/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Deal Close ↗<\/a>."},{"title_zh":"第二阶段 · 2024.06.21 独揽全美首批薄荷醇电子烟 FDA 批文高光时刻","title_en":"Act II · June 21, 2024 Historic First FDA Menthol E-Vapor MGOs","badge_zh":"4 款薄荷醇破冰获批","badge_en":"4 Menthol MGOs Won","desc_zh":"FDA 历史性批准 NJOY ACE (2.4%/5%) 与 NJOY DAILY (4.5%/6%) 四款薄荷醇产品，同时兑现部分并购里程碑 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2024/NJOY-Receives-First-FDA-Authorizations-for-Menthol-E-Vapor-Products/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Menthol MGO Release ↗<\/a>。","desc_en":"FDA granted marketing orders for 4 NJOY menthol products—the first non-tobacco-flavored e-vapor authorizations in US history <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2024/NJOY-Receives-First-FDA-Authorizations-for-Menthol-E-Vapor-Products/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Menthol MGO Release ↗<\/a>."},{"title_zh":"第三阶段 · 2025.03 ITC 专利禁令生效、$21.28亿减值出清与 DAILY 坚守 (2025–2026)","title_en":"Act III · March 2025 ITC Exclusion Order, $2.13B Write-Down & DAILY Defense (2025–2026)","badge_zh":"DAILY 4款持续在架","badge_en":"4 DAILY SKUs Active","desc_zh":"2025.01 ITC 终裁支持 JUUL 专利诉求，03.31 排除令生效停售 ACE；奥驰亚果断在 2025 计提 $2,128M 减值，2026 严控费用并维持 4 款 DAILY 合法在售 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/Altria-Reports-2026-Third-Quarter-and-Nine-Months-Results-Announces-Expanded-Share-Repurchase-Program-Raises-2026-Full-Year-Earnings-Guidance/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Q3'26 Release ↗<\/a>。","desc_en":"Following ITC exclusion orders effective March 31, 2025, Altria wrote down $2,128M in FY25, paused ACE for 2026, and maintained 4 authorized DAILY disposables at retail <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/Altria-Reports-2026-Third-Quarter-and-Nine-Months-Results-Announces-Expanded-Share-Repurchase-Program-Raises-2026-Full-Year-Earnings-Guidance/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Q3'26 Release ↗<\/a>."}],"battles":[{"tag_zh":"节点 01 · 2024-06-21","tag_en":"Case 01 · Jun 21, 2024","sub_zh":"监管科学里程碑","sub_en":"FDA Menthol First","title_zh":"打破长达数年的 FDA 薄荷醇电子烟“零过审”僵局","title_en":"Securing America's First Menthol E-Vapor MGOs","desc_zh":"用硬核转化率证据说服 FDA，确立 NJOY 在合法薄荷雾化领域的先发身位 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2024/NJOY-Receives-First-FDA-Authorizations-for-Menthol-E-Vapor-Products/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NJOY MGO ↗<\/a>。","desc_en":"Proved adult smoker switching benefits outweighed youth risk, winning 4 Menthol MGOs <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2024/NJOY-Receives-First-FDA-Authorizations-for-Menthol-E-Vapor-Products/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NJOY MGO ↗<\/a>."},{"tag_zh":"节点 02 · 2023.10 起","tag_en":"Case 02 · Anti-Illicit","sub_zh":"主动发起联邦诉讼","sub_en":"Federal Vape Lawsuit","title_zh":"在加州联邦法院横扫起诉数十家非法一次性电子烟商","title_en":"Sweeping Federal Litigation Against Illicit Vape Makers","desc_zh":"主动出击运用法律与州白名单游说围剿逃避 PMTA 的灰色竞争对手 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2023/NJOY-Brings-Sweeping-Litigation-Against-Illicit-Disposable-Vapor-Manufacturers/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Litigation Release ↗<\/a>。","desc_en":"Filed sweeping federal lawsuits targeting unlawful disposable vapor manufacturers and distributors <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2023/NJOY-Brings-Sweeping-Litigation-Against-Illicit-Disposable-Vapor-Manufacturers/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Litigation Release ↗<\/a>."},{"tag_zh":"节点 03 · 2025-03-31","tag_en":"Case 03 · Mar 31, 2025","sub_zh":"专利黑天鹅降临","sub_en":"ITC Exclusion Order","title_zh":"败诉 JUUL 四项专利触发 ITC 进口与销售双禁令","title_en":"ITC Exclusion & Cease-and-Desist Orders Halt NJOY ACE","desc_zh":"暴露出并购尽调中对竞争对手换弹结构专利包围网的风险低估 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.spglobal.com/ratings/en/regulatory/article/-/view/type/HTML/id/3369264\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">S&P Global ↗<\/a>。","desc_en":"Forced suspension of NJOY ACE imports and sales across the United States <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.spglobal.com/ratings/en/regulatory/article/-/view/type/HTML/id/3369264\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">S&P Global ↗<\/a>."},{"tag_zh":"节点 04 · 2026.10","tag_en":"Case 04 · NACS 2026","sub_zh":"DAILY 坚守火种","sub_en":"DAILY Holds Shelf","title_zh":"4 款 NJOY DAILY 亮相 2026 NACS 展守住合规渠道","title_en":"4 Authorized NJOY DAILY Variants Anchor 2026 Retail Presence","desc_zh":"保住与连锁便利店的雾化合同席位，等待换弹改款破局 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.2firsts.com/news/altria-showcases-ploom-marlboro-heated-tobacco-sticks-and-non-nicotine-energy-products-at-nacs-show-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2Firsts NACS ↗<\/a>。","desc_en":"Keeps NJOY's retail contracts active across convenience chains <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.2firsts.com/news/altria-showcases-ploom-marlboro-heated-tobacco-sticks-and-non-nicotine-energy-products-at-nacs-show-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2Firsts NACS ↗<\/a>."}],"laws":[{"zh":"在电子硬件驱动的新型烟草赛道，FDA 上市牌照只是“半张门票”，底层雾化结构专利自由度（FTO）是另外半张生死票。","en":"In hardware-driven e-vapor, FDA PMTA clearance is only half the moat—freedom-to-operate (FTO) patent clearance is equally existential."},{"zh":"当监管执法缺位导致灰色产品横行时，克制烧钱、果断账面出清比盲目补贴抢虚荣份额明智百倍。","en":"When illicit trade distorts a category, capping cash burn and clearing book goodwill beats subsidizing unprofitable volume."},{"zh":"保留 NJOY DAILY 4 款批文在架 + 推进蓝牙锁 ACE 2.0，为未来行业大整顿留出了低成本反转期权。","en":"Keeping DAILY live on shelf while advancing Bluetooth ACE 2.0 preserves low-cost optionality for an eventual enforcement cleanup."}]},"ch6":{"h2_zh":"六、“雾化困局反转信号”关键观察核查清单","h2_en":"6. 'NJOY Turnaround & Patent Resolution' Watchlist","items_zh":[{"tag":"海关/ITC 裁定","title":"1. 非侵权结构放行测试：修改后的新 ACE 烟弹能否获美国海关与边境保护局（CBP）/ ITC 认定不侵权？","desc":"或者与 JUUL Labs 达成交叉专利授权和解协议，这是 ACE 重返货架的首要前提。"},{"tag":"FDA 补充变更过审","title":"2. FDA 牌照衔接测试：规避专利的硬件微调能否顺畅通过 FDA 补充 PMTA/SE 而不丢掉薄荷醇 MGO？","desc":"保住 2.4% 与 5.0% 薄荷醇合法销售权是核心价值所在。"},{"tag":"ACE 2.0 蓝牙审批","title":"3. 下一代蓝牙验龄锁获批测试：2024.05 递交的 NJOY ACE 2.0 PMTA 何时获批？","desc":"一旦获批可同时实现技术代际跨越与专利规避。"},{"tag":"州白名单拉动 DAILY","title":"4. 州级电子烟注册目录测试：实施 PMTA 白名单的州，NJOY DAILY 6% 薄荷醇动销是否显著跳升？","desc":"检验非法一次性被清退后的真实合规回流弹性。"},{"tag":"亏损严控 <$100M","title":"5. 财务止血纪律测试：在 ACE 未返场期间，All Other 中电子烟净投入是否严格受控？","desc":"确保不侵蚀可燃烟与口含烟创造的百亿现金流。"},{"tag":"联邦边境执法力度","title":"6. 联邦多部门清剿灰产测试：FDA 与海关联合扣押未获批果味一次性烟是否真正扭转终端格局？","desc":"决定美国合法电子烟总盘能否重回良性扩容。"}],"items_en":[{"tag":"CBP / ITC Clearance","title":"1. Patent Workaround or Settlement Test: Does a redesigned ACE clear CBP/ITC—or settle with JUUL?","desc":"Prerequisite #1 for NJOY ACE returning to US shelves post-2026."},{"tag":"Supplemental FDA","title":"2. Menthol MGO Continuity Test: Can hardware modifications retain FDA Menthol authorization?","desc":"Preserving the 2.4% and 5% Menthol MGOs is critical."},{"tag":"ACE 2.0 Bluetooth","title":"3. NJOY ACE 2.0 PMTA Test: Does FDA authorize the May 2024 Bluetooth access-restriction filing?","desc":"Could leapfrog legacy pod systems on youth-prevention standards."},{"tag":"DAILY Registry Lift","title":"4. State PMTA Directory Test: Are NJOY DAILY 4.5%/6% sales accelerating in registry-enforcing states?","desc":"Gauge legal disposable capture as illicit vapes exit."},{"tag":"Burn Containment","title":"5. Cash-Burn Discipline Test: Is NJOY's annual operating drag kept below ~$100M while ACE is sidelined?","desc":"Protect group EPS ($5.66–$5.74 FY26 guidance) and dividends."},{"tag":"Federal Seizures","title":"6. Federal Multi-Agency Enforcement Test: Are border seizures meaningfully shrinking illicit vape share?","desc":"Determines long-term profit pool of legal US e-vapor."}]},"sources":[{"label":"Altria Press Release (Jun 1, 2023): Altria Completes $2.75B Cash Acquisition of NJOY Holdings, Inc.","url":"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2023/Altria-Completes-Acquisition-of-NJOY-Holdings-Inc.-Updates-2023-Full-Year-Earnings-Guidance/default.aspx"},{"label":"Altria Press Release (Jun 21, 2024): NJOY Receives First-Ever FDA Authorizations for Menthol E-Vapor Products (4 SKUs)","url":"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2024/NJOY-Receives-First-FDA-Authorizations-for-Menthol-E-Vapor-Products/default.aspx"},{"label":"S&P Global Ratings Regulatory Analysis: ITC Patent Ban on NJOY ACE & Altria Goodwill Impairment Impact","url":"https://www.spglobal.com/ratings/en/regulatory/article/-/view/type/HTML/id/3369264"},{"label":"SEC Form 8-K Exhibit 99.1 — Altria FY2025 Results (Schedule 4 & 15: $2,128M E-Vapor Impairments, -$102M Adj. OCI)","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000007/exhibit991erq42025.htm"},{"label":"Altria Q3 2026 Official Release (2026 Guidance Assumption: NJOY ACE Does Not Return in 2026)","url":"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/Altria-Reports-2026-Third-Quarter-and-Nine-Months-Results-Announces-Expanded-Share-Repurchase-Program-Raises-2026-Full-Year-Earnings-Guidance/default.aspx"},{"label":"2Firsts NACS Show 2026 Report (4 FDA-Authorized NJOY DAILY Variants Active & 7M Annual C-Store Trips)","url":"https://www.2firsts.com/news/altria-showcases-ploom-marlboro-heated-tobacco-sticks-and-non-nicotine-energy-products-at-nacs-show-2026"},{"label":"Altria Operating Companies — NJOY Official Corporate & Regulatory Overview","url":"https://www.altria.com/about-altria/our-companies/njoy"}],"quickJumpZh":[{"sec":"sec-00","title":"00 单品定评：FDA 皇冠与 ITC 铁幕交织","sub":"首获4款薄荷MGO · ACE遭禁令 · $2.13B减值出清"},{"sec":"sec-01","title":"01 ACE 陶瓷芯换弹、DAILY 一次性与蓝牙锁","sub":"DAILY 4款正常在架 · ACE 2.0 蓝牙验龄储备"},{"sec":"sec-02","title":"02 四大结构性张力与雾化赛道雷达","sub":"稀缺牌照价值 vs 海外代工337专利风险"},{"sec":"sec-03","title":"03 全美雾化电子烟合规巨头与灰产对比","sub":"对比 Vuse Alto、JUUL 与非法果味一次性灰产"},{"sec":"sec-04","title":"04 减值出清后绕道研发与执法弹性模拟","sub":"IQOS $2.7B现金对冲复盘与反转期权模拟"},{"sec":"sec-05","title":"05 从 $27.5 亿并购、薄荷破冰到专利禁令","sub":"2023–2026 完整客观得失复盘"},{"sec":"sec-06","title":"06 雾化业务反转与破局条件核查清单","sub":"6项海关放行、蓝牙锁与州白名单观察指标"},{"sec":"sec-07","title":"07 FDA 批文、ITC 裁决与 SEC 减值信源","sub":"一手监管公告与财报减值附表直达"}],"quickJumpEn":[{"sec":"sec-00","title":"00 Verdict: FDA Crown Meets ITC Patent Wall","sub":"1st 4 Menthol MGOs · Mar'25 ITC ban · $2.13B reset"},{"sec":"sec-01","title":"01 ACE Ceramic Pod, DAILY & Bluetooth 2.0","sub":"4 active DAILY disposables & age-locked ACE 2.0"},{"sec":"sec-02","title":"02 4 Structural Tensions & E-Vapor Radar","sub":"Scarce FDA licenses vs. hardware IP & illicit vapes"},{"sec":"sec-03","title":"03 US E-Vapor Authorized vs. Illicit Matrix","sub":"NJOY vs. Vuse Alto, JUUL & unregulated disposables"},{"sec":"sec-04","title":"04 Post-Write-Down Redesign & Crackdown Sim","sub":"$2.7B IQOS offset & post-2026 turnaround optionality"},{"sec":"sec-05","title":"05 From $2.75B Deal & Menthol Win to ITC Ban","sub":"Candid 2023–2026 chronology and IP lessons"},{"sec":"sec-06","title":"06 E-Vapor Turnaround & Patent Checklist","sub":"6-point CBP/ITC, FDA & state directory watchlist"},{"sec":"sec-07","title":"07 FDA MGOs, ITC Ruling & SEC Filings","sub":"Direct links to FDA orders, S&P & SEC schedules"}]},{"id":"ploom_beyond","idx_num":10,"idx_pad":"10","filename":"mo_prod_10_ploom_heated_beyond.html","checkKey":"mui_mo_checks_ploom_beyond","monogram":"PL","short_zh":"Ploom×万宝路与非尼古丁","short_en":"Ploom × Marlboro & Beyond","pill_kpi":"PMTA+MRTP已交 · $9.3B股权","docTitleZh":"《Ploom × Marlboro 加热不燃烧与超越尼古丁生态矩阵》深度商业研报 | 王安安数据中心","docTitleEn":"Ploom × Marlboro Heated Tobacco & Beyond-Nicotine Ecosystem Monograph | Research Hub","crumb_zh":"Ploom × Marlboro 加热烟草 (Horizon JV) & Proper Wild / RIOT / ABI 战略矩阵","crumb_en":"Ploom × Marlboro Heated Tobacco (Horizon JV) & Beyond-Nicotine Portfolio","chip1_zh":"75%控股 Horizon · 2025.08 递交 PMTA+MRTPA","chip1_en":"75% Horizon JV · Aug'25 PMTA+MRTPA Filed","chip2_zh":"Proper Wild >2.5万店 · ABI/Cronos $9.33B","chip2_en":"Proper Wild >25K Doors · $9.33B Equity Stake","sidebar":{"badge":"HORIZON JV & 6601 VENTURES · FUTURE PLATFORMS","title_zh":"Ploom 与超越尼古丁研报","title_en":"Ploom & Beyond Monograph","sub_zh":"收下 PMI $27亿退场费后联手日本烟草 (75%/25%) 打造 Ploom × Marlboro 加热烟草 × Proper Wild (>2.5万店) 与 RIOT 能量饮 × $93.26亿 ABI/Cronos 战略权益底盘","sub_en":"Post-$2.7B IQOS exit: 75%-owned JT JV Horizon (Ploom × Marlboro sticks) × Proper Wild (>25K stores) & RIOT Energy × $9.33B ABI/Cronos stakes","mini_kpis":[{"label_zh":"Horizon 合资持股与申报","label_en":"Horizon JV & FDA Status","val_zh":"75%控股 · PMTA+MRTP","val_en":"75% MO · PMTA+MRTP"},{"label_zh":"Proper Wild 能量饮铺货","label_en":"Proper Wild Distribution","val_zh":">25,000 家门店","val_en":">25,000 Stores"},{"label_zh":"ABI + Cronos 账面权益价值","label_en":"Equity Securities Book","val_zh":"$9,326M (9M收益$487M)","val_en":"$9,326M ($487M 9M Inc)"}]},"toc":[["战略定评：2027–2030 终局产品矩阵","Verdict: 2027–2030 Strategic Horizon"],["Ploom 硬件 × 万宝路烟支与功能饮架构","Ploom × Marlboro & Functional Energy Tech"],["四大远期增长支柱与加热烟草雷达","4 Future-Growth Pillars & HTP Radar"],["美国加热不燃烧与跨界功能快消对比","US Heated Tobacco & Functional CPG Matrix"],["加热烟支转化率与跨界分销模拟器","Heated Stick Conversion & Beyond Simulator"],["从 $27 亿告别 IQOS 到 NACS 2026 实机首秀","From $2.7B IQOS Exit to NACS 2026 Showcase"],["加热不燃烧与 2028 新物种核查清单","HTP & 2028 Beyond-Nicotine Checklist"],["官方管线、NACS 实拍与 SEC 信源索引","Official Pipeline, NACS & SEC Sources"]],"hero":{"strip1_zh":"战略定评：奥驰亚面向 2027–2030 的终极王牌——左手用“日本烟草硬件 + 自家万宝路烟支”正面迎战 PMI IQOS 入美，右手用 30 万便利店货架孵化功能能量饮帝国","strip1_en":"Verdict: Altria's 2027–2030 strategic endgame—pairing JT's Ploom hardware with PM USA's Marlboro trademark while monetizing AGDC's 300K doors across functional energy","strip2_zh":"三大版块：Horizon JV (Ploom × Marlboro) · 非尼古丁 (Proper Wild / RIOT) · 权益压舱石 (ABI / Cronos)","strip2_en":"Three Pillars: Horizon JV (Ploom × Marlboro) · Non-Nicotine (Proper Wild / RIOT) · Strategic Equity (ABI / Cronos)","strip3_zh":"数据基准：2026.10 NACS 实拍 & Q3 季报","strip3_en":"Baseline: Oct 2026 NACS Show & Q3 Release","overline_zh":"FUTURE HORIZON 10 · $2.7B IQOS 现金买断 × 75% 控股 Horizon 递交 PMTA+MRTPA × Proper Wild >2.5万店 × $9.33B 战略股权","overline_en":"FUTURE HORIZON 10 · $2.7B IQOS Buyout Cash × 75% Horizon JV PMTA+MRTPA × >25K Proper Wild Doors × $9.33B Equity Assets","h1_zh":"Ploom × Marlboro 与超越尼古丁矩阵深度剖析：<span class=\"gradient-accent\">笑纳菲莫国际 $27 亿分手费后，奥驰亚如何联手日本烟草并用便利店铁军跨界功能能量饮？<\/span>","h1_en":"Ploom × Marlboro & Beyond-Nicotine Deep Dive: <span class=\"gradient-accent\">How Altria Pocketed $2.7B from PMI, Partnered with JT on Heated Marlboro Sticks, and Scaled Functional Energy<\/span>","lead_zh":"2024 年 4 月，奥驰亚完成了一笔极具战略定力的交易：将美国市场 IQOS 代理权交还菲莫国际（PMI），一次性落袋 <strong>$27 亿美元税前现金收益<\/strong> <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000007/exhibit991erq42025.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FY25 EX-99.1 p.5 ↗<\/a>，转身全力投入与日本烟草集团（JT Group）于 2022 年 10 月组建的合资公司 <strong>Horizon Innovations LLC（奥驰亚控股 75% / 日本烟草 25%）<\/strong>——由日本烟草供应成熟的 <strong>Ploom<\/strong> 加热不燃烧主机，由 PM USA 在里士满本土独家生产挂有正统<strong>“Marlboro（万宝路）”商标的加热烟草烟支<\/strong>！2025 年 8 月，Horizon 已正式向美国 FDA 递交<strong>合并 PMTA + MRTPA（上市前申请+改良风险减害申请）<\/strong>，并于 2026 年 10 月拉斯维加斯 NACS 展首次公开展示 Ploom 真机与万宝路加热烟支组合 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.2firsts.com/news/altria-showcases-ploom-marlboro-heated-tobacco-sticks-and-non-nicotine-energy-products-at-nacs-show-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2Firsts NACS 2026 ↗<\/a>。与此同时，围绕“2028 年实现至少 5 款非尼古丁产品规模化分销”目标，AGDC 已将参股的植物基专注能量饮 <strong>Proper Wild<\/strong> 铺进逾 <strong>25,000 家门店<\/strong>，并由全资孵化平台 <strong>6601 Ventures LLC<\/strong> 推出罐装能量饮料 <strong>RIOT Energy<\/strong>，辅以账面价值高达 <strong>$93.26 亿<\/strong> 的百威英博（ABI）与 Cronos 股权持续反哺现金流 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/Altria-Reports-2026-Third-Quarter-and-Nine-Months-Results-Announces-Expanded-Share-Repurchase-Program-Raises-2026-Full-Year-Earnings-Guidance/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Q3'26 Balance Sheet ↗<\/a>。","lead_en":"In April 2024, Altria assigned US IQOS commercialization rights back to PMI for a <strong>$2.7 billion pre-tax cash windfall<\/strong> <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000007/exhibit991erq42025.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FY25 EX-99.1 p.5 ↗<\/a> and pivoted decisively to <strong>Horizon Innovations LLC (75% Altria / 25% Japan Tobacco Group)<\/strong>—combining JT's next-gen <strong>Ploom<\/strong> heated device with PM USA-manufactured <strong>Marlboro-branded heated tobacco sticks<\/strong>. Horizon submitted a combined <strong>FDA PMTA + MRTPA in August 2025<\/strong> and publicly displayed physical Ploom hardware alongside Marlboro stick imagery at the <strong>October 2026 NACS Show<\/strong> <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.2firsts.com/news/altria-showcases-ploom-marlboro-heated-tobacco-sticks-and-non-nicotine-energy-products-at-nacs-show-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2Firsts NACS 2026 ↗<\/a>. Simultaneously, advancing its 2028 goal of ≥5 broadly distributed non-nicotine products, AGDC scaled minority-backed <strong>Proper Wild<\/strong> energy shots/gummies past <strong>25,000 stores<\/strong> alongside <strong>RIOT Energy<\/strong> (operated via Altria's <strong>6601 Ventures LLC<\/strong>), underpinned by <strong>$9,326M<\/strong> in ABI and Cronos equity investments generating <strong>$487M in 9M 2026 GAAP equity income<\/strong> <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/Altria-Reports-2026-Third-Quarter-and-Nine-Months-Results-Announces-Expanded-Share-Repurchase-Program-Raises-2026-Full-Year-Earnings-Guidance/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Q3'26 Schedule 5 & 11 ↗<\/a>.","thesis_cards":[{"title_zh":"在美国本土，只有奥驰亚的加热烟支能印上“Marlboro”商标！","title_en":"Exclusive US Marlboro Trademark Advantage Over PMI's IQOS","desc_zh":"PMI 在日本靠“Marlboro HeatSticks”打爆了 IQOS，但在美国 Marlboro 商标 100% 归属奥驰亚！PMI 入美只能另起炉灶叫 TEREA/LEVIA，而 Horizon 的 Ploom 独享万宝路金字招牌。","desc_en":"PMI built IQOS in Japan on Marlboro HeatSticks, but Altria owns 100% of US Marlboro—giving Horizon's Ploom exclusive rights to Marlboro heated sticks in America."},{"title_zh":"75% 永久控股权完胜昔日“替 PMI 打工做嫁衣”的代理合同","title_en":"Permanent 75% Ownership vs. Expiring IQOS License","desc_zh":"当年代理 IQOS 不仅受制于严格配额且面临到期收回；如今控股 75% Horizon 并由里士满自产高毛利烟支耗材，长期经济利益完全掌握在自己手中。","desc_en":"Unlike Altria's expiring IQOS distribution license, 75%-owned Horizon JV + PM USA stick manufacturing lock in permanent domestic economics."},{"title_zh":"AGDC 渠道复用跨界植物能量饮 + $93.26 亿啤酒/大麻股权垫","title_en":"Beyond-Nicotine Energy Scaling + $9.33B ABI/Cronos Cushion","desc_zh":"便利店进店客群（提神、抗疲劳、专注）与尼古丁消费者高度重合；Proper Wild (>25K店) 与 RIOT Energy 零冷启动复用便利店冷柜与收银台。","desc_en":"70% daily c-store overlap lets AGDC scale Proper Wild (>25K stores) and 6601 Ventures' RIOT Energy alongside $9.33B in ABI & Cronos stakes."}],"kpis":[{"label_zh":"Horizon 合资股权与进展","label_en":"Horizon JV Stake & Filing","badge_zh":"2025.08 递交双申请","badge_en":"Aug 2025 PMTA+MRTPA","val_zh":"75% MO / 25% JT","val_en":"75% MO / 25% JT","desc_zh":"日本烟草供 Ploom 主机，PM USA 造 Marlboro 加热烟支，一步到位同步申请上市与减害声称 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.altria.com/moving-beyond-smoking/smoke-free-product-platforms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Smoke-Free Platforms ↗<\/a>","desc_en":"75% Altria / 25% JT Group JV filed combined US FDA PMTA + MRTPA in Aug 2025 for Ploom devices & Marlboro heated sticks <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.altria.com/moving-beyond-smoking/smoke-free-product-platforms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Smoke-Free Platforms ↗<\/a>"},{"label_zh":"出让 IQOS 收回现金收益","label_en":"2024 IQOS Exit Cash Gain","badge_zh":"2024.04 全额落袋","badge_en":"Apr 2024 Pre-Tax Cash","val_zh":"$2,700M","val_en":"$2,700M","desc_zh":"向 PMI 移交美国 IQOS 商业化权收获 $27 亿税前收益，充实转型与回购弹药库 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000007/exhibit991erq42025.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FY25 EX-99.1 p.5 ↗<\/a>","desc_en":"Captured a $2,700M pre-tax cash gain in Apr 2024 upon returning US IQOS commercialization rights to PMI <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000007/exhibit991erq42025.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FY25 EX-99.1 p.5 ↗<\/a>"},{"label_zh":"Proper Wild 零售铺货规模","label_en":"Proper Wild Store Reach","badge_zh":"2028 目标 ≥5 款非尼古丁","badge_en":"Goal: ≥5 Products by '28","val_zh":">25,000 店","val_en":">25,000 Stores","desc_zh":"通过 AGDC 销售分销赋能植物基功能能量饮/软糖，叠加 6601 Ventures 旗下 RIOT Energy <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.2firsts.com/news/altria-showcases-ploom-marlboro-heated-tobacco-sticks-and-non-nicotine-energy-products-at-nacs-show-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2Firsts NACS 2026 ↗<\/a>","desc_en":"Scaled plant-based clean energy brand Proper Wild past >25,000 US stores via AGDC alongside 6601 Ventures' RIOT Energy <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.2firsts.com/news/altria-showcases-ploom-marlboro-heated-tobacco-sticks-and-non-nicotine-energy-products-at-nacs-show-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2Firsts NACS 2026 ↗<\/a>"},{"label_zh":"战略股权账面值 & 9M收益","label_en":"ABI + Cronos Carrying Val","badge_zh":"9M'26 权益净收益 $487M","badge_en":"$487M 9M Equity Income","val_zh":"$9,326M","val_en":"$9,326M","desc_zh":"截至 2026-09-30 账面值较年初（$8,617M）增值 $709M；Q3 单季 ABI 贡献 $228M 收益 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/Altria-Reports-2026-Third-Quarter-and-Nine-Months-Results-Announces-Expanded-Share-Repurchase-Program-Raises-2026-Full-Year-Earnings-Guidance/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Q3'26 Schedule 5 & 11 ↗<\/a>","desc_en":"ABI + Cronos carrying value rose $709M YTD to $9,326M at Q3'26 end, generating $487M in 9M'26 GAAP equity earnings <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/Altria-Reports-2026-Third-Quarter-and-Nine-Months-Results-Announces-Expanded-Share-Repurchase-Program-Raises-2026-Full-Year-Earnings-Guidance/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Q3'26 Schedule 5 & 11 ↗<\/a>"}]},"ch1":{"eyebrow":"CHAPTER 01 · HORIZON HEATED TOBACCO & BEYOND-NICOTINE ARCHITECTURE","h2_zh":"一、技术与生态协同架构：Ploom 外壁气流加热 × 万宝路烟支 × 6601 非尼古丁孵化器","h2_en":"1. Platform Architecture: JT Ploom HeatFlow × PM USA Marlboro Sticks × 6601 Ventures","sub_zh":"无刀片外周均匀加热不焦糊 × 里士满本土烟支高毛利耗材 × 提神/专注/减压/放松四大功能消费象限","sub_en":"Blade-free HeatFlow chamber × domestic Richmond Marlboro consumables × Energy/Focus/Stress/Relaxation CPG","badge_zh":"NACS 2026 拉斯维加斯封闭展台真机实拍确认","badge_en":"Verified Live Display at Oct 2026 NACS Show","hub_title_zh":"奥驰亚 2028 远期双翼（美国本土万宝路加热烟草转化 ↔ 便利店渠道非尼古丁功能快消变现）","hub_title_en":"Altria 2028 Dual Horizon (US Heated Marlboro Conversion ↔ Non-Nicotine Functional CPG Distribution)","hub_sub_zh":"总部地址 6601 West Broad Street 化名成立全资新消费运营平台 6601 Ventures LLC","hub_sub_en":"Named after Altria's 6601 West Broad Street Richmond HQ, 6601 Ventures LLC incubates ready-to-drink energy brands","nodes":[{"tag_zh":"JT HARDWARE · 无刀片加热器","tag_en":"JT PLOOM DEVICE","name_zh":"Ploom 环绕热流加热主机","name_en":"JT Group Ploom Heated System","desc_zh":"由日本烟草负责硬件研发制造（已在日本本土验证抢占超 11%+ 加热烟份额），无易断加热片、免繁琐清洁。","desc_en":"Engineered by JT Group (proven >11%+ heated share in Japan) with blade-free HeatFlow chamber requiring minimal cleaning."},{"tag_zh":"MARLBORO STICKS · 耗材印钞机","tag_en":"MARLBORO HEATED STICKS","name_zh":"PM USA 造万宝路加热烟支","name_en":"Marlboro-Branded Tobacco Sticks","desc_zh":"由里士满工厂定制再造烟叶配方，唯一合法使用美国 Marlboro 商标的加热烟支，直接降低 39.5% 存量烟民心理门槛。","desc_en":"Custom reconstituted tobacco sticks made in Richmond—the ONLY heated sticks legally bearing the Marlboro crest in America."},{"tag_zh":"DUAL FDA FILING · 一步到位","tag_en":"AUG 2025 PMTA + MRTPA","name_zh":"上市许可 + 减害声称联合申报","name_en":"Combined PMTA & MRTPA Submission","desc_zh":"2025 年 8 月同步递交两项申请（尚未商业化开售，静待 FDA 批准），力争一上市即具备合法减害对比沟通权。","desc_en":"Dual Aug 2025 FDA filing seeks both marketing authorization and reduced-exposure/risk claims out of the gate."},{"tag_zh":"CLEAN ENERGY SHOTS · 参股分销","tag_en":"PROPER WILD (>25K STORES)","name_zh":"Proper Wild 植物专注能量瓶/软糖","name_en":"Proper Wild Energy Shots & Gummies","desc_zh":"2024 参股投资、2025 由 AGDC 扩铺至 >25,000 家门店，主打有机绿茶咖啡因 + L-茶氨酸 4–6 小时零崩溃专注力。","desc_en":"Minority stake scaled by AGDC into >25,000 US stores; organic green-tea caffeine + L-theanine delivers 4–6 hr zero-crash focus."},{"tag_zh":"6601 VENTURES · 自营饮品","tag_en":"RIOT ENERGY (6601 VENTURES)","name_zh":"RIOT Energy 100% 植物基能量罐饮","name_en":"RIOT Energy RTD Beverages","desc_zh":"官网运营主体确认为奥驰亚旗下 6601 Ventures LLC，在 2026 NACS 外墙与 AGDC 联合高调陈列。","desc_en":"Plant-powered clean RTD energy beverage operated under Altria's 6601 Ventures LLC and showcased prominently at NACS 2026."},{"tag_zh":"STRATEGIC EQUITY · 金融蓄水池","tag_en":"ABI (~8.1%) & CRONOS (~41%)","name_zh":"$93.26 亿啤酒与大麻素权益资产","name_en":"ABI Brewer & Cronos Cannabinoid Stakes","desc_zh":"ABI 每年贡献稳定分红与 ~$5亿级权益利润（随时可部分减持回购自家股票），Cronos 保留北美大麻联邦合法化期权。","desc_en":"ABI contributes ~$500M–$650M/yr in equity earnings & dividends (plus liquid buyback optionality), while Cronos holds US cannabis optionality."}],"platform_bars":[{"title_zh":"为什么加热不燃烧（HTP）在美国至今渗透率不足 1%，却是最大蓝海？","title_en":"Why Heated Tobacco Is America's Largest Untapped Nicotine White Space","sub_zh":"日本已有超 40% 烟民改抽加热烟草（IQOS/Ploom），而美国因早年 PMI 与奥驰亚博弈及 ITC 禁令几乎一片空白，5,420万成年烟草用户亟待真烟口感无烟方案。","sub_en":"Over 40% of Japanese smokers switched to heated tobacco, whereas America's 54.2M adult tobacco users remain a near-zero white space."},{"title_zh":"便利店流量复用：70% 尼古丁买主每天进便利店，顺手拿一瓶功能能量饮","title_en":"7-in-10 Adult Nicotine Shoppers Visit C-Stores Daily—Ideal Energy Drink Overlap","sub_zh":"重度烟民与卡车司机/蓝领/夜班人群是功能能量饮最核心买家，AGDC 巡店代表一趟拜访同时铺货烟草与能量饮。","sub_en":"7 in 10 adult nicotine buyers visit c-stores daily—allowing a single AGDC store visit to merchandise both tobacco and functional energy."}],"principles":[{"title_zh":"1. 夺回美国本土“万宝路加热烟支”正统权是神来之笔","title_en":"1. Owning the 'Marlboro' Name on US Heated Sticks Is a Huge Edge","desc_zh":"美国老烟民对电子烟甜腻蒸汽普遍不习惯，却高度认准 Marlboro 烟草味；Horizon 将日本烟草最新一代 Ploom 与 PM USA 万宝路烟支合体，精准击中 PMI 在美无法使用万宝路商标的软肋 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.2firsts.com/news/altria-showcases-ploom-marlboro-heated-tobacco-sticks-and-non-nicotine-energy-products-at-nacs-show-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2Firsts NACS Ploom ↗<\/a>。","desc_en":"US smokers often reject sweet e-vapor aerosols for lacking real-leaf taste; pairing JT's Ploom hardware with authentic <strong>Marlboro<\/strong> heated sticks exploits PMI's inability to use Marlboro in the US <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.2firsts.com/news/altria-showcases-ploom-marlboro-heated-tobacco-sticks-and-non-nicotine-energy-products-at-nacs-show-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2Firsts NACS Ploom ↗<\/a>."},{"title_zh":"2. 非尼古丁布局恪守“轻资本测试 + 强渠道放大”纪律","title_en":"2. Asset-Light Non-Nicotine Testing via 6601 Ventures & Minority Stakes","desc_zh":"吸取百亿大并购教训，奥驰亚在能量与减压赛道采取小额参股（Proper Wild）或内部轻量孵化（6601 Ventures / RIOT），靠 AGDC 2.5万+ 门店分销验证动销后再决定加码 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000007/exhibit991erq42025.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FY25 2028 Goals ↗<\/a>。","desc_en":"Replacing multi-billion-dollar M&A bets with disciplined minority stakes (Proper Wild) and 6601 Ventures (RIOT Energy) tests velocity across >25K AGDC doors before scaling capital <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000007/exhibit991erq42025.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FY25 2028 Goals ↗<\/a>."},{"title_zh":"3. ABI $93 亿高流动性股权是进退自如的“战略金库”","title_en":"3. $9.33B Equity Portfolio Acts as Self-Funding Strategic Reserve","desc_zh":"2026Q3 单季权益投资收益翻倍至 <strong>$242M<\/strong>（其中 ABI $228M、Cronos $14M；前9月合计 <strong>$487M<\/strong>），既增厚当期 EPS，又是随时可部分变现支持百亿回购的硬通货 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/Altria-Reports-2026-Third-Quarter-and-Nine-Months-Results-Announces-Expanded-Share-Repurchase-Program-Raises-2026-Full-Year-Earnings-Guidance/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Q3'26 Schedule 5 ↗<\/a>。","desc_en":"Q3'26 equity earnings doubled to <strong>$242M<\/strong> ($228M ABI + $14M Cronos; <strong>$487M<\/strong> in 9M'26), bolstering EPS while serving as a $9.33B liquid capital reserve <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/Altria-Reports-2026-Third-Quarter-and-Nine-Months-Results-Announces-Expanded-Share-Repurchase-Program-Raises-2026-Full-Year-Earnings-Guidance/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Q3'26 Schedule 5 ↗<\/a>."}],"alert_zh":"<strong>商业化阶段严谨核验：<\/strong>根据奥驰亚官方披露及 2026 年 10 月 NACS 展实况，<strong>Ploom 主机与 Marlboro 加热烟支目前尚未在美国启动商业化零售（Not Yet Commercialized）<\/strong>——其合并 PMTA + MRTPA 申请于 2025 年 8 月递交，目前正在等待 FDA 科学审评放行；而 <strong>Proper Wild（>25,000店）、RIOT Energy 与 ABI/Cronos 权益收益<\/strong> 均已在当期产生真实商业数据 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.2firsts.com/news/altria-showcases-ploom-marlboro-heated-tobacco-sticks-and-non-nicotine-energy-products-at-nacs-show-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2Firsts NACS Fact Check ↗<\/a>。","alert_en":"<strong>Commercialization Status Check:<\/strong> Per Altria disclosures and NACS October 2026 reporting, <strong>Ploom and Marlboro heated tobacco sticks are not yet commercialized in the U.S.<\/strong> while their August 2025 combined PMTA/MRTPA undergoes FDA review; meanwhile, <strong>Proper Wild (>25,000 stores), RIOT Energy, and ABI/Cronos equity earnings ($487M in 9M'26)<\/strong> are actively operating today <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.2firsts.com/news/altria-showcases-ploom-marlboro-heated-tobacco-sticks-and-non-nicotine-energy-products-at-nacs-show-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2Firsts NACS Fact Check ↗<\/a>.","chart":{"tabA_zh":"视图A: 战略股权账面值与权益收益跃升","tabA_en":"View A: Equity Portfolio Value & Income","tabB_zh":"视图B: 2028 非尼古丁与加热烟里程碑进度","tabB_en":"View B: 2028 Strategic Platform Readiness","viewA":{"mode":"dual_bar_line","title_zh":"奥驰亚战略股权投资（ABI + Cronos）账面价值（$B）vs 阶段税前权益收益（$M）","title_en":"Altria Equity Investments Carrying Value ($B) vs. GAAP Equity Earnings ($M)","sub_zh":"截至 2026Q3 账面价值升至 $93.26 亿，前9月贡献 $487M 税前收益（Q3 单季 $242M 同比翻倍）","sub_en":"Carrying value climbed to $9.33B at Sep 30, 2026 while 9M GAAP equity earnings rose +22.4% YoY to $487M","leg1_zh":"期末股权投资账面价值 (左轴 · $十亿)","leg1_en":"Carrying Value on Balance Sheet (Left · $B)","leg2_zh":"当期/阶段权益法投资净收益 (右轴 · $百万)","leg2_en":"GAAP Equity Investment Income (Right · $M)","labels_zh":["2024年末(全年收益)","2025年末(全年收益)","2025前9月","2026H1末(半年收益)","2026Q3末(前9月收益)"],"labels_en":["YE 2024 (FY Inc)","YE 2025 (FY Inc)","9M 2025","Q2'26 (1H Inc)","Q3'26 (9M Inc)"],"subs_zh":["全年收益 $652M","全年收益 $510M","ABI $396M+Cronos $2M","账面 $8.90B","账面 $9.33B · Q3 $242M"],"subs_en":["FY24 $652M inc","FY25 $510M inc","9M25 $398M inc","$8.90B book","$9.33B book · +22% 9M"],"s1":[8.2,8.62,8.5,8.9,9.33],"s2":[652,510,398,245,487],"max1":11.0,"max2":720,"u1":"B","u2":"M"},"viewB":{"mode":"grouped_bars","title_zh":"Horizon 合资结构与 2028 远期增长目标关键量化锚点对比","title_en":"Horizon JV Structure & 2028 Growth Targets Quantitative Scorecard","sub_zh":"对比奥驰亚 vs 合作伙伴持股比例、目标达成进度与便利店覆盖指数","sub_en":"Comparing Altria control %, distribution progress, and 2028 enterprise milestones","leg1_zh":"奥驰亚当前持股或已达成指标 (%)","leg1_en":"Altria Stake / Current Progress (%)","leg2_zh":"合资方占比或 2028 目标基准参照 (%)","leg2_en":"Partner Share / Benchmark Target (%)","labels_zh":["Horizon 合资控股权 (MO vs JT)","便利店尼古丁客每日到店率 (vs普通客)","烟草忠诚订单含奥驰亚单品率","Proper Wild 相对 5万店中期标杆"],"labels_en":["Horizon JV Ownership","Daily C-Store Visit Rate","Loyalty Trips w/ Altria","Proper Wild vs 50K Ref"],"subs_zh":["75% 奥驰亚 vs 25% 日烟","70% (7/10) vs 50% (5/10)","55% 篮子渗透率 (NACS)",">25,000店已达成 (>50%)"],"subs_en":["75% MO vs. 25% JT","70% daily vs. 50% avg","55% loyalty trips",">25K stores live"],"s1":[75,70,55,52],"s2":[25,50,45,100],"max1":105,"u1":"%","u2":"%"}},"matrix_cards":[{"title_zh":"为什么“日本烟草硬件 + 万宝路烟支”是美国加热烟天作之合？","title_en":"Why JT Hardware + PM USA Marlboro Sticks Is a Dream Pairing","badge_zh":"优势彻底互补","badge_en":"Complementary Strengths","body_zh":"奥驰亚擅长烟叶调香、美国 FDA 临床申报与 30 万便利店排面，但缺乏消费电子主机量产经验；日本烟草已在日欧迭代多代 Ploom 主机，却在美国缺乏高端品牌号召力——<strong>75%/25% Horizon 合资<\/strong>一举补齐双方拼图 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.2firsts.com/news/altria-showcases-ploom-marlboro-heated-tobacco-sticks-and-non-nicotine-energy-products-at-nacs-show-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Horizon Structure ↗<\/a>。","detail_zh":"更重要的是，高毛利的耗材（Marlboro 加热烟支）全部放在 PM USA 里士满工厂本土制造，既规避进口主机式关税摩擦，又牢牢把耗材复购利润留在美国本土。","body_en":"JT brings battle-tested Ploom consumer-electronics engineering from Japan/Europe, while Altria contributes America's #1 cigarette trademark (Marlboro), FDA MRTP expertise, and 300K-door AGDC distribution <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.2firsts.com/news/altria-showcases-ploom-marlboro-heated-tobacco-sticks-and-non-nicotine-energy-products-at-nacs-show-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Horizon Structure ↗<\/a>.","detail_en":"Manufacturing Marlboro heated sticks domestically at PM USA keeps high-margin consumable economics inside Altria."},{"title_zh":"6601 Ventures 与 Proper Wild：探路“后尼古丁时代”便利店货架","title_en":"6601 Ventures & Proper Wild: Monetizing AGDC Beyond Tobacco","badge_zh":"2028 目标 ≥5 款单品","badge_en":"≥5 Non-Nicotine Goal","body_zh":"奥驰亚在 2028 企业目标中立下军令状：在<strong>提神（Energy）、专注（Focus）、减压（Stress Relief）、放松（Relaxation）<\/strong>四大功能赛道实现至少 5 款非尼古丁产品规模化分销；Proper Wild 突破 25,000 店与 RIOT Energy 参展 NACS 标志着前两颗棋子已落地 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.2firsts.com/news/altria-showcases-ploom-marlboro-heated-tobacco-sticks-and-non-nicotine-energy-products-at-nacs-show-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2Firsts Non-Nicotine ↗<\/a>。","detail_zh":"对于连锁便利店而言，能量饮与功能软糖是仅次于烟草的高毛利品类，AGDC 现成销售铁军无需增加固定编制即可赚取分销服务费与股权增值。","body_en":"Targeting adult needs in Energy, Focus, Stress Relief, and Relaxation, Altria has already scaled Proper Wild past 25,000 stores via AGDC and launched RIOT Energy under subsidiary 6601 Ventures LLC <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.2firsts.com/news/altria-showcases-ploom-marlboro-heated-tobacco-sticks-and-non-nicotine-energy-products-at-nacs-show-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2Firsts Non-Nicotine ↗<\/a>.","detail_en":"Leverages AGDC's daily c-store relationships into adjacent high-margin functional CPG categories."}]},"ch2":{"eyebrow":"CHAPTER 02 · FOUR FUTURE-PLATFORM PILLARS & 5-AXIS HTP RADAR","h2_zh":"二、四大战略支柱：评估奥驰亚远期新物种矩阵的胜算与安全垫","h2_en":"2. Four Strategic Pillars: Assessing Altria's Heated & Beyond-Nicotine Endgame","badge_zh":"护城河定性：万宝路商标排他权 + $93亿股权安全垫","badge_en":"Moat Rating: Exclusive US Marlboro IP + $9.33B Equity Backstop","pillars":[{"title_zh":"01 · 美国市场唯一合法印有“Marlboro”的加热烟支耗材","title_en":"01 · Exclusive US Rights to Marlboro-Branded Heated Sticks","badge_zh":"39.5% 存量烟民无缝承接","badge_en":"Direct Marlboro Bridge","desc_zh":"消除老烟民面对陌生电子烟品牌的疏离感，实现母品牌资产无烟化平移。","note_zh":"<strong>当前选中支柱解读（01 万宝路商标霸权）：<\/strong>PMI 的 IQOS 重返美国只能使用美国消费者陌生的 TEREA 商标，而 Horizon 的烟支直接顶着红白万宝路徽标进驻万宝路背柜旁 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.2firsts.com/news/altria-showcases-ploom-marlboro-heated-tobacco-sticks-and-non-nicotine-energy-products-at-nacs-show-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Marlboro Sticks ↗<\/a>。","note_en":"<strong>Selected Pillar (01 · US Marlboro Trademark):<\/strong> While PMI must market IQOS consumables in America under unfamiliar TEREA branding, Horizon pairs Ploom directly with iconic Marlboro sticks <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.2firsts.com/news/altria-showcases-ploom-marlboro-heated-tobacco-sticks-and-non-nicotine-energy-products-at-nacs-show-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Marlboro Sticks ↗<\/a>.","desc_en":"Eliminates brand-switching friction for PM USA's 39.5% cigarette base by extending the Marlboro crest into heated sticks."},{"title_zh":"02 · PMTA + MRTPA 同步申报抢占科学减害制高点","title_en":"02 · Combined Aug 2025 PMTA + MRTPA Regulatory Strategy","badge_zh":"复用哥本哈根MRTP经验","badge_en":"Dual FDA Submission","desc_zh":"不满足于仅能上架，而是直接冲刺类似 IQOS / 哥本哈根的法定减害营销声称权。","note_zh":"<strong>当前选中支柱解读（02 联合申报）：<\/strong>不燃烧仅加热约 300°C 的物理原理天然大幅削减焦油与一氧化碳，为获批减害暴露/风险声称提供了坚实毒理基础 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.altria.com/moving-beyond-smoking/smoke-free-product-platforms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Altria HTP Science ↗<\/a>。","note_en":"<strong>Selected Pillar (02 · Dual PMTA/MRTPA):<\/strong> Heating tobacco without combustion drastically reduces harmful constituents, supporting modified-risk communications upon FDA clearance <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.altria.com/moving-beyond-smoking/smoke-free-product-platforms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Altria HTP Science ↗<\/a>.","desc_en":"Targets statutory reduced-exposure marketing claims from launch rather than competing as an undifferentiated device."},{"title_zh":"03 · AGDC 便利店高频触点赋能 Proper Wild 与 RIOT 功能饮","title_en":"03 · AGDC Retail Muscle Accelerates Non-Nicotine Energy Brands","badge_zh":">25,000 店实战验证","badge_en":">25K Doors Proven","desc_zh":"初创快消品最难跨越 5,000 店死亡谷，AGDC 一年即把 Proper Wild 送进 2.5 万+ 门店。","note_zh":"<strong>当前选中支柱解读（03 跨品类渠道变现）：<\/strong>不烧巨额电视广告，直接用便利店收银台立牌与冷柜陈列撬动日均进店的 5,420 万烟草消费者顺手加购。","note_en":"<strong>Selected Pillar (03 · C-Store Basket Attachment):<\/strong> Instant access to >25,000 convenience counters bypasses traditional CPG slotting bottlenecks.","desc_en":"Startup beverage brands struggle past 5,000 doors; AGDC vaulted Proper Wild past 25,000 c-stores within a year."},{"title_zh":"04 · $93.26 亿 ABI + Cronos 股权提供每年 ~$6亿级收益与回购期权","title_en":"04 · $9.33B ABI & Cronos Stakes Provide Earnings & Buyback Fuel","badge_zh":"Q3'26 权益收益 $242M","badge_en":"$242M Q3 Equity Income","desc_zh":"全球啤酒之王百威英博复苏直接增厚奥驰亚 EPS，更是随时可兑现的百亿级流动储备。","note_zh":"<strong>当前选中支柱解读（04 战略股权压舱石）：<\/strong>2026Q3 ABI 单季贡献 $228M 税前收益（同比大增 85% GAAP / +21.7% 调整后），助推董事会新增 $10 亿股票回购授权 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/Altria-Reports-2026-Third-Quarter-and-Nine-Months-Results-Announces-Expanded-Share-Repurchase-Program-Raises-2026-Full-Year-Earnings-Guidance/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Q3'26 Buyback & ABI ↗<\/a>。","note_en":"<strong>Selected Pillar (04 · Strategic Equity Anchor):<\/strong> Resurgent ABI earnings ($228M Q3 GAAP income) helped support Altria's newly expanded $1B share repurchase authorization <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/Altria-Reports-2026-Third-Quarter-and-Nine-Months-Results-Announces-Expanded-Share-Repurchase-Program-Raises-2026-Full-Year-Earnings-Guidance/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Q3'26 Buyback & ABI ↗<\/a>.","desc_en":"Global brewer AB InBev's margin recovery accretes directly to Altria EPS while providing $9.3B+ balance-sheet backing."}],"radar":{"title_zh":"美国加热不燃烧与跨界新平台五维潜力雷达图（10分制）","title_en":"5-Axis US Heated Tobacco & Adjacent Platform Radar (10-Point Scale)","axes_zh":["美国本土商标号召力","终端渠道铺货爆发力","硬件成熟可靠度","当前FDA获批进度","耗材本土制造毛利"],"axes_en":["US Brand Equity","C-Store Launch Power","Hardware Maturity","Current FDA Status","Domestic Stick Margin"],"s0_zh":"Ploom × Marlboro (Horizon 75%奥驰亚/25%日烟)","s0_en":"Ploom × Marlboro (Horizon · 75% MO / 25% JT)","s1_zh":"IQOS ILUMA / 3 (PMI 独资重返美国市场)","s1_en":"IQOS / ILUMA (PMI Solo US Re-Entry)","s2_zh":"glo Hilo / 竞品加热烟 (BAT 全球加热平台)","s2_en":"glo (BAT Heated Tobacco Platform)","v0":[9.9,9.8,8.9,7.2,9.5],"v1":[7.2,7.6,9.8,9.0,8.8],"v2":[6.5,8.5,8.2,6.5,8.0]}},"ch3":{"eyebrow":"CHAPTER 03 · HEATED TOBACCO & FUNCTIONAL CPG BENCHMARKING","h2_zh":"三、美国加热不燃烧与跨界功能快消横向对比：Ploom × 万宝路 vs PMI IQOS","h2_en":"3. Heated Tobacco & Beyond-Nicotine Matrix: Horizon vs. PMI IQOS & Energy Peers","peers_zh":[{"category":"altria","benchmark":true,"title":"研究标的：Ploom × Marlboro 加热不燃烧系统","creator":"Horizon Innovations LLC (75%奥驰亚 / 25%日本烟草)","format":"Ploom 环绕加热主机 + 里士满造万宝路加热烟支","craft":"无刀片外周热流加热 · 正统美国 Marlboro 烟叶调香","views":"2025.08 已交合并 PMTA+MRTPA · NACS 2026 实机亮相","acclaim":"独享美国万宝路商标 + 30万 AGDC 便利店网络","takeaway":"一旦获 FDA 放行（预计 2027 窗口），将是唯一能与 IQOS ILUMA 在美分庭抗礼的巨头组合。","sourceLabel":"NACS / Altria","sourceUrl":"https://www.2firsts.com/news/altria-showcases-ploom-marlboro-heated-tobacco-sticks-and-non-nicotine-energy-products-at-nacs-show-2026"},{"category":"altria","benchmark":true,"title":"研究标的：Proper Wild & RIOT Energy (非尼古丁双星)","creator":"参股伙伴 + 6601 Ventures LLC / AGDC 分销","format":"2.5oz 专注能量瓶/软糖 + 16oz 植物基罐装能量饮","craft":"有机绿茶咖啡因 + L-茶氨酸 · 零防腐剂洁净配方","views":"Proper Wild 突破 >25,000 家门店 · 剑指 2028 ≥5款目标","acclaim":"验证烟草分销铁军向功能快消跨界降维复用","takeaway":"低资本试错打开万亿级功能饮品货架，对冲超远期尼古丁总量见顶风险。","sourceLabel":"FY25 / NACS","sourceUrl":"https://www.2firsts.com/news/altria-showcases-ploom-marlboro-heated-tobacco-sticks-and-non-nicotine-energy-products-at-nacs-show-2026"},{"category":"altria","benchmark":false,"title":"ABI 百威英博 (~8.1%) & Cronos (~41%) 战略权益","creator":"奥驰亚资产负债表长期股权投资","format":"全球第一大啤酒集团 + 加拿大领先大麻素平台","craft":"权益法核算 (滞后一季并表收益 + 现金股息流入)","views":"2026Q3 账面值 $9,326M · 9M'26 权益收益 $487M (+22%)","acclaim":"兼具每股收益增厚器与百亿级潜在变现回购弹药库","takeaway":"Cronos 旗下 Peace Naturals / Spinach 更为未来北美大麻素合规快消储备现成技术。","sourceLabel":"Q3'26 Schedule 5","sourceUrl":"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/Altria-Reports-2026-Third-Quarter-and-Nine-Months-Results-Announces-Expanded-Share-Repurchase-Program-Raises-2026-Full-Year-Earnings-Guidance/default.aspx"},{"category":"external","benchmark":false,"title":"IQOS 3 & IQOS ILUMA (头号外部加热劲敌)","creator":"Philip Morris International (PMI 独资入美)","format":"电磁感应无刀片加热主机 + TEREA 封闭烟支","craft":"全球加热烟绝对霸主 (海外年销千亿支级)","views":"花 $27亿从奥驰亚赎回美权后在德州奥斯汀等地试水","acclaim":"老款 IQOS 已握有 FDA MRTP · ILUMA 待 FDA 审批放量","takeaway":"硬件领先，但在美国没有万宝路商标且需从零自建便利店地面团队（仅靠瑞典火柴渠道）。","sourceLabel":"FY25 IQOS Note","sourceUrl":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000007/exhibit991erq42025.htm"},{"category":"external","benchmark":false,"title":"5-hour ENERGY (便利店收银台能量瓶标杆)","creator":"Living Essentials LLC (私有行业霸主)","format":"2 oz 便携提神能量小瓶 (~$3.49–$3.99/瓶)","craft":"高浓度咖啡因+B族维生素 · 便利店收银台黄金位垄断","views":"垄断美国能量小瓶 (Energy Shots) 逾 70%+ 传统份额","acclaim":"超高毛利率快消神话 · 配方偏传统化学合成感","takeaway":"Proper Wild 以“纯植物茶氨酸不心慌”定位联合 AGDC 收银台优势，精准切分其年轻升级客群。","sourceLabel":"2Firsts NACS","sourceUrl":"https://www.2firsts.com/news/altria-showcases-ploom-marlboro-heated-tobacco-sticks-and-non-nicotine-energy-products-at-nacs-show-2026"}],"peers_en":[{"category":"altria","benchmark":true,"title":"Subject: Ploom × Marlboro Heated System","creator":"Horizon Innovations LLC (75% MO / 25% JT)","format":"JT Ploom Device + PM USA Marlboro Heated Sticks","craft":"Blade-free HeatFlow chamber · Authentic US Marlboro leaf","views":"Combined PMTA+MRTPA filed Aug 2025 · Shown at NACS 2026","acclaim":"Exclusive US Marlboro trademark + 300K AGDC stores","takeaway":"Positioned as PMI IQOS's formidable US rival once FDA review completes.","sourceLabel":"NACS / Altria","sourceUrl":"https://www.2firsts.com/news/altria-showcases-ploom-marlboro-heated-tobacco-sticks-and-non-nicotine-energy-products-at-nacs-show-2026"},{"category":"altria","benchmark":true,"title":"Subject: Proper Wild & RIOT Energy","creator":"Minority Stake + 6601 Ventures LLC / AGDC","format":"Clean Plant-Based Energy Shots, Gummies & RTD Cans","craft":"Organic green-tea caffeine + L-theanine (4–6 hr focus)","views":"Proper Wild >25,000 US stores · Goal ≥5 products by 2028","acclaim":"Monetizes AGDC c-store reach in high-margin energy","takeaway":"Disciplined, asset-light entry into functional CPG categories.","sourceLabel":"FY25 / NACS","sourceUrl":"https://www.2firsts.com/news/altria-showcases-ploom-marlboro-heated-tobacco-sticks-and-non-nicotine-energy-products-at-nacs-show-2026"},{"category":"altria","benchmark":false,"title":"ABI (~8.1%) & Cronos (~41%) Equity Stakes","creator":"Altria Strategic Equity Portfolio","format":"Global #1 Brewer + Canadian Cannabinoid Leader","craft":"Equity-method earnings + cash dividends + liquidity reserve","views":"$9,326M carrying value (Sep'26) · $487M 9M'26 GAAP income","acclaim":"Q3 ABI equity income jumped to $228M","takeaway":"Provides recurring earnings growth, buyback optionality, and cannabinoid R&D.","sourceLabel":"Q3'26 Schedule 5","sourceUrl":"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/Altria-Reports-2026-Third-Quarter-and-Nine-Months-Results-Announces-Expanded-Share-Repurchase-Program-Raises-2026-Full-Year-Earnings-Guidance/default.aspx"},{"category":"external","benchmark":false,"title":"IQOS & IQOS ILUMA (PMI Solo US Entry)","creator":"Philip Morris International (PMI)","format":"Smartcore Induction Device + TEREA Sticks","craft":"Global HTP leader (>100B international sticks/yr)","views":"Paid Altria $2.7B in Apr 2024 to reclaim US rights","acclaim":"Legacy IQOS holds FDA MRTP; ILUMA awaiting US FDA nod","takeaway":"World-class hardware, but lacks the Marlboro name in the US and PM USA's 1.1B-trip backbar.","sourceLabel":"FY25 IQOS Note","sourceUrl":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000007/exhibit991erq42025.htm"},{"category":"external","benchmark":false,"title":"5-hour ENERGY (Countertop Energy Benchmark)","creator":"Living Essentials LLC","format":"2 oz Countertop Energy Shot (~$3.49–$3.99)","craft":"Synthetic caffeine/B-vitamin blend · Checkout staple","views":"Dominates legacy US energy-shot category","acclaim":"Proof of massive convenience-counter energy margins","takeaway":"Proper Wild attacks legacy shots with clean-label plant ingredients backed by AGDC.","sourceLabel":"2Firsts NACS","sourceUrl":"https://www.2firsts.com/news/altria-showcases-ploom-marlboro-heated-tobacco-sticks-and-non-nicotine-energy-products-at-nacs-show-2026"}],"bars":{"title_zh":"奥驰亚远期战略储备与现金价值盘点：股权资产、IQOS 买断款与渠道势能","title_en":"Altria Strategic Financial & Platform Asset Benchmarks ($ Billions)","sub_zh":"核验自 2026Q3 资产负债表（Schedule 11）与 2025 年报：仅账面股权+现金已超 $120 亿美元","sub_en":"Verified via Q3 2026 Balance Sheet (Schedule 11) and FY2025 Release: >$12B in liquid cash & equity securities","badge_zh":"$12.02B 现金+战略股权厚垫","badge_en":"$12.02B Cash + Equity Cushion","leg1_zh":"蓝色/绿色：截至 2026Q3 资产负债表战略权益与现金资产 ($B)","leg1_en":"Blue / Green: Sep 30, 2026 Balance Sheet Equity & Cash ($B)","leg2_zh":"紫色/琥珀：IQOS 退场收益、回购扩额与节省目标参照 ($B)","leg2_en":"Purple / Amber: IQOS Windfall, Buyback & Cost-Save Benchmarks ($B)","max_x":11.0,"ref_line":2.7,"items_zh":[{"label":"战略股权投资账面总值 (ABI + Cronos · 2026.09.30)","val":9.33,"disp":"$9.33B","sub":"较2025末 ($8.62B) 增值+$0.71B","note":"厚实的表内非烟草金融安全垫"},{"label":"账面现金及现金等价物余额 (截至 2026.09.30)","val":2.7,"disp":"$2.70B","sub":"前9月已派息 $5.3B + 回购 $735M","note":"充沛流动性支撑研发与股东回报"},{"label":"移交美国 IQOS 商业化权收回税前收益 (2024.04)","val":2.7,"disp":"$2.70B","sub":"向 PMI 收取的分手现金","note":"零成本换取转投自控 75% Horizon 的自由"},{"label":"2026.10 董事会最新批准追加股票回购授权额度","val":1.0,"disp":"+$1.00B","sub":"延期至 2027-12-31","note":"体现管理层对现金流与远期管线强信心"},{"label":"Optimize & Accelerate 计划五年累计降本再投资目标","val":0.6,"disp":"≥$0.60B","sub":"2025–2029 累计节省再投新业务","note":"内部AI与流程现代化自筹 Ploom/on! 研发费"}],"items_en":[{"label":"Investments in Equity Securities (Sep 30, 2026)","val":9.33,"disp":"$9.33B","sub":"Up +$709M vs. YE 2025 ($8.62B)","note":"ABI (~8.1%) + Cronos (~41%) book value"},{"label":"Cash & Cash Equivalents (Sep 30, 2026)","val":2.7,"disp":"$2.70B","sub":"After $5.3B 9M divs & $735M buybacks","note":"Fortress liquidity position"},{"label":"Pre-Tax Cash Gain from IQOS Rights Sale (Apr 2024)","val":2.7,"disp":"$2.70B","sub":"Paid by PMI upon exit","note":"Freed Altria to build 75%-owned Horizon"},{"label":"Oct 2026 Expanded Share Repurchase Authorization","val":1.0,"disp":"+$1.00B","sub":"Extended through Dec 31, 2027","note":"Backed by strong 9M cash generation"},{"label":"Optimize & Accelerate Cumulative Savings Target","val":0.6,"disp":"≥$0.60B","sub":"Through 2029 reinvested in Vision","note":"Self-funds Ploom & Beyond-Nicotine R&D"}]}},"ch4":{"eyebrow":"CHAPTER 04 · HEATED STICK CONVERSION & ECOSYSTEM SIMULATOR","h2_zh":"四、远期商业化弹性模拟：哪怕仅转化 5%–8% 万宝路烟民，Ploom 能再造多大现金池？","h2_en":"4. Horizon & Beyond Simulator: Modeling Marlboro Smoker Conversion + Energy + ABI","sub_zh":"全美存量万宝路年销约 25 亿包；每转化 1% 存量进入自产 Marlboro 加热烟支即对应 ~2,500 万包高毛利耗材！","sub_en":"With ~2.5B annual US Marlboro packs, converting even 4%–8% of loyalists into Marlboro heated sticks creates a massive high-margin annuity","badge_zh":"耗材享有低消费税潜在优势","badge_en":"High-Margin Domestic Stick Annuity","econ_cards":[{"label_zh":"US ADULT CONSUMERS","label_en":"US ADULT CONSUMERS","val_zh":"54.2M 成年用户","val_en":"54.2M Adults","desc_zh":"2026 NACS 披露全美共有 5,420 万成年烟草消费者，加热烟草目前渗透率近乎 0%。","desc_en":"NACS 2026 pegs the US adult tobacco base at 54.2M consumers, with heated tobacco penetration still near 0% awaiting FDA review."},{"label_zh":"HORIZON OWNERSHIP","label_en":"HORIZON OWNERSHIP","val_zh":"75% 并表控股","val_en":"75% Majority","desc_zh":"奥驰亚掌握 75% 商业化收益权并全资赚取 PM USA 烟支制造端利润。","desc_en":"Altria holds 75% equity in Horizon JV plus 100% of PM USA's high-margin Marlboro heated-stick manufacturing economics."},{"label_zh":"NON-NICOTINE DOORS","label_en":"NON-NICOTINE DOORS","val_zh":">25K → 100K+","val_en":">25K → 100K+","desc_zh":"Proper Wild 已破 2.5 万店，叠加 RIOT Energy 与后续 3 款新品迈向 2028 目标。","desc_en":"Proper Wild (>25K stores) + RIOT Energy + 3 additional functional products target >100K US c-store doors by 2028."},{"label_zh":"ABI + CRONOS INCOME","label_en":"ABI + CRONOS INCOME","val_zh":"~$650M 年化收益","val_en":"~$650M Run-Rate","desc_zh":"9M'26 权益法净收益达 $487M（年化 ~$650M），提供持续底线托底。","desc_en":"9M'26 GAAP equity income reached $487M (~$650M annualized run-rate), reinforcing Altria's 57-year dividend growth streak."}],"combo":{"title_zh":"美国加热不燃烧市场敏感度推演：万宝路存量转化率（%）vs Horizon 年化烟支包数（百万包）","title_en":"Horizon Sensitivity Model: % of Marlboro Smokers Converted vs. Annual Heated Packs (M)","sub_zh":"以 ~25 亿包美国万宝路存量为锚：仅转化 2%→10% 即可支撑 5,000万→2.5亿包加热烟支耗材","sub_en":"Anchored to ~2.5B annual US Marlboro packs: 2% to 10% internal switching yields 50M to 250M heated stick packs/yr","badge_zh":"防止烟民外流至 PMI IQOS","badge_en":"Retains Smokers Inside Marlboro","left_zh":"■ 左轴：对应年化加热烟支销量 (百万包)","left_en":"■ Left Axis: Implied Heated Stick Packs (M/yr)","right_zh":"● 右轴：假设万宝路烟民转化率 (%)","right_en":"● Right Axis: Assumed Marlboro Switch Rate (%)","leg1_zh":"年化加热烟支包数 (左轴 · M包)","leg1_en":"Annual Heated Packs (Left · M)","leg2_zh":"万宝路存量转化率 (右轴 · %)","leg2_en":"Marlboro Conversion % (Right · %)","line_badge_zh":"--- 6.0% 欧美先发市场初期基准线","line_badge_en":"--- 6.0% Mid-Term Switch Target","titles_zh":["获批首年试销(1%)","铺货次年(2.5%)","中期基准情景(5%)","MRTP获批催化(8%)","成熟期对标欧洲(12%)"],"titles_en":["Yr-1 Launch (1%)","Yr-2 Scale (2.5%)","Mid-Term Base (5%)","MRTP Catalyst (8%)","Mature Bull (12%)"],"subs_zh":["10亿支耗材","25亿支耗材","50亿支耗材","80亿支耗材","120亿支耗材"],"subs_en":["0.5B sticks","1.25B sticks","2.5B sticks","4.0B sticks","6.0B sticks"],"bars":[25,62.5,125,200,300],"line":[1.0,2.5,5.0,8.0,12.0],"max_bar":340,"min_line":0,"max_line":14,"ref_line":6.0,"u_bar":"M","u_line":"%","highlight_idx":2},"sim":{"title_zh":"Ploom × Marlboro + 非尼古丁能量饮 + 战略股权综合价值模拟器","title_en":"Horizon Ploom + Beyond-Nicotine + ABI/Cronos Ecosystem Simulator","toggle_title_zh":"开启 FDA 同步批准 MRTPA 减害声称 + ≥5款非尼古丁全网铺货 (+30% 转化加速)","toggle_title_en":"Enable FDA MRTPA Claim Clearance + 5-Product Energy Rollout (+30% Lift)","toggle_sub_zh":"模拟获批减害声称后万宝路老烟民快速转化，并叠加 ABI 权益收益与能量饮分销分成","toggle_sub_en":"Simulates faster smoker conversion under MRTP messaging plus recurring ABI/energy cash flows","s1_label_zh":"商业化后年均加热烟支包数 (百万包)","s1_label_en":"Post-Approval Annual Heated Packs (Million Packs)","s1_unit_zh":"M 包","s1_unit_en":"M Pks","s1_min":25,"s1_max":260,"s1_step":15,"s2_label_zh":"75%控股下每包加热烟支净利实现 (USD / 包)","s2_label_en":"Altria Net OCI Realization per Heated Pack (USD)","s2_unit_zh":"/包","s2_unit_en":"/pk","s2_min":2.2,"s2_max":4.4,"s2_step":0.2,"s3_label_zh":"ABI/Cronos 现金股息 + 非尼古丁能量饮年贡献 ($M / 年)","s3_label_en":"Annual ABI Dividends + Non-Nicotine CPG Cashflow ($M/yr)","s3_min":200,"s3_max":650,"s3_step":25,"roi_label_zh":"相对 ~$350M Horizon 研发/产线改造净投入回报倍数","roi_label_en":"Value Multiple vs. ~$350M Horizon R&D & Tooling Outlay","cost_base_m":350,"mult":1.3,"vol_drift":1.16,"presets":{"p1":{"label_zh":"① 保守慢热情景 (FDA审批延迟，主要靠 ABI 股息贡献)","label_en":"① Conservative Slow-FDA Case (ABI Dividend Core)","tag_zh":"40M包 · 5年","tag_en":"40M · 5 Yrs","views":40,"v_per_view":2.6,"ancillary_m":250,"years":5,"transmedia":false},"p2":{"label_zh":"② 核心基准情景 (115M包加热烟支 + Proper Wild/RIOT 扩店)","label_en":"② Base Horizon Launch + Energy Scaling","tag_zh":"115M包 · 5年","tag_en":"115M · 5 Yrs","views":115,"v_per_view":3.4,"ancillary_m":350,"years":5,"transmedia":true},"p3":{"label_zh":"③ 美版加热烟爆发情景 (200M包 · 成功压制 PMI IQOS)","label_en":"③ Bull US HTP Breakout (200M Packs + MRTP)","tag_zh":"200M包 · 7年","tag_en":"200M · 7 Yrs","views":200,"v_per_view":3.8,"ancillary_m":500,"years":7,"transmedia":true}}},"moat_pos_zh":"<strong>1. 独握美国万宝路加热烟支王牌：<\/strong>正面迎战老兄弟 PMI 入美最强防御反击武器。<br/><strong>2. $93.26 亿表内股权厚垫：<\/strong>ABI 与 Cronos 投资让奥驰亚拥有全行业最从容的财务缓冲空间。","moat_pos_en":"<strong>1. Exclusive US Marlboro Heated Stick Moat:<\/strong> Strongest possible brand shield as PMI brings IQOS ILUMA to America.<br/><strong>2. $9.33B Equity Fortress:<\/strong> ABI and Cronos provide recurring earnings and balance-sheet flexibility.","moat_risk_zh":"<strong>1. FDA PMTA + MRTPA 审批周期不确定性：<\/strong>2025 年 8 月递交后，正式获批上市时间窗取决于 FDA 审评排期（尚未产生当期销售收入）。<br/><strong>2. 美国烟民对加热不燃烧品类接受度待验证：<\/strong>不同于日韩，美国消费者此前更习惯电子烟或口含袋，需与 PMI 共同完成市场教育。","moat_risk_en":"<strong>1. FDA Review Timeline Uncertainty:<\/strong> Submitted August 2025, Ploom awaits formal FDA MGO before US commercialization.<br/><strong>2. US Consumer Category Adoption:<\/strong> US smokers have historically adopted pouches/vapes faster than heated sticks."},"ch5":{"eyebrow":"CHAPTER 05 · STRATEGIC REALIGNMENT & 2028 VISION TIMELINE","h2_zh":"五、战略大腾挪时间轴：从收回 $27 亿 IQOS 现金到 NACS 2026 全矩阵亮剑","h2_en":"5. Strategic Pivot Timeline: From $2.7B IQOS Exit to Oct 2026 NACS Unveiling","sub_zh":"看懂奥驰亚如何用四年时间完成“退代理、建合资、交申报、拓非烟”四步大棋","sub_en":"Tracing Altria's four-step pivot into majority-owned heated tobacco and functional energy","badge_zh":"2022.10 Horizon成立 → 2024.04 收$2.7B → 2025.08 交FDA → 2026.10 NACS首秀","badge_en":"Oct'22 JV → Apr'24 $2.7B → Aug'25 FDA → Oct'26 NACS","acts":[{"title_zh":"第一阶段 · 2022.10 联手日本烟草成立 Horizon & 2024.04 $27亿体面告别 IQOS","title_en":"Act I · Oct 2022 Horizon JV Formation & Apr 2024 $2.7B IQOS Exit","badge_zh":"75% 永久控股确立","badge_en":"75% Majority Control","desc_zh":"2022 年 10 月与日本烟草按 75%/25% 成立 Horizon Innovations；2024 年 4 月 30 日向 PMI 交还 IQOS 美权净拿 $27 亿税前现金，并参股 Proper Wild <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.altria.com/about-altria/our-heritage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Altria Heritage ↗<\/a>。","desc_en":"Formed Horizon JV (75% MO / 25% JT) in Oct 2022, collected $2.7B pre-tax from PMI upon exiting IQOS in Apr 2024, and invested in Proper Wild <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.altria.com/about-altria/our-heritage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Altria Heritage ↗<\/a>."},{"title_zh":"第二阶段 · 2025.08 递交 Ploom × Marlboro 联合申请 & Proper Wild 破 2.5万店","title_en":"Act II · Aug 2025 Combined PMTA+MRTPA Filing & 25K-Store Proper Wild","badge_zh":"PMTA + MRTPA 齐发","badge_en":"Dual FDA Application","desc_zh":"2025 年 8 月正式向 FDA 递交 Ploom 系统与万宝路加热烟支的 PMTA+MRTPA；同年 AGDC 助推 Proper Wild 突破 25,000 家零售门店 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.altria.com/moving-beyond-smoking/smoke-free-product-platforms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Smoke-Free Platforms ↗<\/a>。","desc_en":"Submitted combined FDA PMTA and MRTPA in August 2025 while scaling Proper Wild past 25,000 stores via AGDC <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.altria.com/moving-beyond-smoking/smoke-free-product-platforms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Smoke-Free Platforms ↗<\/a>."},{"title_zh":"第三阶段 · 2026.10 NACS 拉斯维加斯真机首秀与 ABI 强劲助攻","title_en":"Act III · Oct 2026 NACS Live Booth Showcase & $9.33B Equity Surge","badge_zh":"Ploom + RIOT 同台登场","badge_en":"Ploom & RIOT Unveiled","desc_zh":"在 2026 年 10 月 NACS 展向全美便利店巨头首次同台展出 Ploom 实体机、Marlboro 加热烟支视觉、Proper Wild 与 6601 Ventures 旗下 RIOT Energy <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.2firsts.com/news/altria-showcases-ploom-marlboro-heated-tobacco-sticks-and-non-nicotine-energy-products-at-nacs-show-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2Firsts NACS ↗<\/a>。","desc_en":"Showcased physical Ploom hardware, Marlboro heated stick branding, Proper Wild, and RIOT Energy to convenience retailers at NACS Oct 2026 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.2firsts.com/news/altria-showcases-ploom-marlboro-heated-tobacco-sticks-and-non-nicotine-energy-products-at-nacs-show-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2Firsts NACS ↗<\/a>."}],"battles":[{"tag_zh":"神操作 01 · 2024.04","tag_en":"Case 01 · Apr 2024","sub_zh":"最高明的体面分手","sub_en":"$2.7B Cash Windfall","title_zh":"把到期受限的代理权卖回 $27 亿，转身自控 75% 合资平台","title_en":"Trading an Expiring IQOS License for $2.7B Cash + 75% Horizon","desc_zh":"不仅白拿 $27 亿现金回购股票与对冲并购，还保住了美国万宝路商标在加热烟草领域的独家使用权 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000007/exhibit991erq42025.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FY25 EX-99.1 ↗<\/a>。","desc_en":"Monetized IQOS exit for $2.7B while keeping 100% control of the US Marlboro trademark for Horizon <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000007/exhibit991erq42025.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FY25 EX-99.1 ↗<\/a>."},{"tag_zh":"神操作 02 · 2025.08","tag_en":"Case 02 · Aug 2025","sub_zh":"科学监管高举高打","sub_en":"Combined PMTA+MRTPA","title_zh":"一步到位同步申报 PMTA 与 MRTPA 减害资格","title_en":"Filing Combined PMTA & MRTPA for Ploom × Marlboro","desc_zh":"瞄准与 PMI IQOS 对等的法定减害营销地位，备战 2027+ 正面决战 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.altria.com/moving-beyond-smoking/smoke-free-product-platforms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Altria Platforms ↗<\/a>。","desc_en":"Targets statutory modified-risk parity against PMI's IQOS upon launch <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.altria.com/moving-beyond-smoking/smoke-free-product-platforms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Altria Platforms ↗<\/a>."},{"tag_zh":"神操作 03 · 2025–2026","tag_en":"Case 03 · Beyond Nicotine","sub_zh":"AGDC 渠道跨界","sub_en":"Proper Wild & RIOT","title_zh":"Proper Wild 破 2.5 万店 + 6601 Ventures 孵化 RIOT","title_en":"Scaling Clean Energy Across >25,000 Stores via AGDC","desc_zh":"用极低资本开支验证了烟草地面部队推销高毛利植物能量饮的可行性 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.2firsts.com/news/altria-showcases-ploom-marlboro-heated-tobacco-sticks-and-non-nicotine-energy-products-at-nacs-show-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2Firsts NACS ↗<\/a>。","desc_en":"Proved AGDC reps can rapidly scale functional CPG brands across convenience chains <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://www.2firsts.com/news/altria-showcases-ploom-marlboro-heated-tobacco-sticks-and-non-nicotine-energy-products-at-nacs-show-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2Firsts NACS ↗<\/a>."},{"tag_zh":"神操作 04 · 2026Q3","tag_en":"Case 04 · Q3 2026","sub_zh":"啤酒巨头利润共振","sub_en":"ABI Earnings Surge","title_zh":"ABI 单季贡献 $228M 收益，股权账面跃升至 $93.26亿","title_en":"ABI Stake Delivers $228M Q3 Income & $9.33B Book Value","desc_zh":"成为上调 2026 全年 EPS 指引（$5.66–$5.74）与追加 $10亿回购的重要推手 <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/Altria-Reports-2026-Third-Quarter-and-Nine-Months-Results-Announces-Expanded-Share-Repurchase-Program-Raises-2026-Full-Year-Earnings-Guidance/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Q3'26 Release ↗<\/a>。","desc_en":"Directly supported Altria's raised FY2026 EPS guidance ($5.66–$5.74) and $1B buyback expansion <a class=\"cite-link\" href=\"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/Altria-Reports-2026-Third-Quarter-and-Nine-Months-Results-Announces-Expanded-Share-Repurchase-Program-Raises-2026-Full-Year-Earnings-Guidance/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Q3'26 Release ↗<\/a>."}],"laws":[{"zh":"永远不要在别人的地基上盖楼：放弃受制于人的 IQOS 代理、转向 75% 控股的 Horizon 才是长期主义正解。","en":"Never build on rented land: swapping an expiring IQOS license for $2.7B cash + 75%-owned Horizon secured permanent equity upside."},{"zh":"奥驰亚最被低估的隐形资产不是某一款烟，而是每天触达数千万成年买家的 AGDC 30 万便利店毛细血管。","en":"Altria's deepest hidden asset is AGDC's 300K-door retail network, capable of scaling heated sticks, pouches, and energy drinks alike."},{"zh":"传统现金牛（万宝路/哥本哈根/雪茄）输血分红，成长翼（on!/on! PLUS）贡献增量，远期翼（Ploom/非尼古丁/ABI）提供期权——三梯队闭环成型。","en":"Legacy cash cows fund the 6.5%+ dividend, Helix drives near-term smoke-free growth, and Horizon + Beyond Nicotine provide 2027–2030 optionality."}]},"ch6":{"h2_zh":"六、“2028 加热与超越尼古丁终局”核查清单","h2_en":"6. 'Horizon Ploom & 2028 Beyond-Nicotine' Checklist","items_zh":[{"tag":"FDA PMTA 获批","title":"1. Ploom × Marlboro 上市获批测试：2025.08 递交的 PMTA 能否在 2026末–2027 顺利拿到 MGO？","desc":"决定奥驰亚能否与 PMI IQOS ILUMA 同步开启美国加热烟商业化对决。"},{"tag":"MRTPA 减害背书","title":"2. 减害声称对称测试：MRTPA 能否同步或紧随获批，抵消老款 IQOS 已有的 MRTP 先发宣传优势？","desc":"合法向 39.5% 万宝路烟民宣传减害对比是加速转化的关键催化剂。"},{"tag":"万宝路口感还原","title":"3. 本土烟民盲测复购测试：里士满造 Marlboro 加热烟支对美式混合烤烟劲道的还原度是否过硬？","desc":"决定美国烟民首试主机后的留存率（Stick Retention）。"},{"tag":"≥5款 非尼古丁目标","title":"4. 2028 五款跨界单品测试：继 Proper Wild 与 RIOT Energy 后，剩余 ≥3 款减压/专注新品何时亮相？","desc":"持续跟踪 6601 Ventures 与 AGDC 新增第三方分销签约。"},{"tag":"ABI 资本配置","title":"5. $93.26 亿股权动态管理测试：管理层是否在估值高位择机变现部分 ABI 锁死低位股票回购？","desc":"类似过往精准部分减持 ABI 同步注销自家流通股的增值操作。"},{"tag":"$600M 降本再投","title":"6. Optimize & Accelerate 自筹研发测试：截至 2029 累计 ≥$6亿降本目标是否足额覆盖新平台孵化费？","desc":"确保远期新业务投入不挤压股东股息每年中个位数增长目标。"}],"items_en":[{"tag":"Ploom PMTA MGO","title":"1. FDA Commercial Clearance Test: Does Horizon's Aug 2025 PMTA clear FDA review on schedule?","desc":"Unlocks commercial US launch of Ploom devices and Marlboro heated sticks."},{"tag":"MRTPA Parity","title":"2. Modified-Risk Claim Test: Will Horizon secure MRTPA authorization to match IQOS claims?","desc":"Enables direct reduced-exposure/risk messaging to US Marlboro smokers."},{"tag":"Stick Retention","title":"3. American-Blend Taste Test: Do PM USA's Marlboro heated sticks convert US smokers beyond trial?","desc":"Critical to building high-margin consumable repeat purchases."},{"tag":"≥5 Products by '28","title":"4. 2028 Non-Nicotine Goal Test: Are ≥3 more Energy/Focus/Relaxation brands joining Proper Wild & RIOT?","desc":"Track 6601 Ventures launches and AGDC store expansion beyond 25,000 doors."},{"tag":"$9.33B Equity Alloc","title":"5. Strategic Equity Monetization Test: Does Altria opportunistically harvest ABI gains into buybacks?","desc":"Monitor ABI dividend inflows and accretive share-repurchase execution."},{"tag":"≥$600M Self-Funding","title":"6. Optimize & Accelerate Test: Are ≥$600M cumulative efficiency savings self-funding R&D?","desc":"Protects mid-single-digit annual EPS and dividend growth through 2028."}]},"sources":[{"label":"2Firsts NACS Show 2026 Frontline Report (Oct 10, 2026): Ploom × Marlboro Heated Sticks, Proper Wild & RIOT Energy (6601 Ventures)","url":"https://www.2firsts.com/news/altria-showcases-ploom-marlboro-heated-tobacco-sticks-and-non-nicotine-energy-products-at-nacs-show-2026"},{"label":"Altria Official Smoke-Free Product Platforms: Horizon Innovations (75% Altria / 25% JT) & Aug 2025 PMTA/MRTPA","url":"https://www.altria.com/moving-beyond-smoking/smoke-free-product-platforms"},{"label":"SEC Form 8-K Exhibit 99.1 — Altria FY2025 Results ($2.7B Apr 2024 IQOS Gain, Proper Wild >25,000 Stores, 2028 Goals)","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000007/exhibit991erq42025.htm"},{"label":"Altria Q3 & 9M 2026 Official Release (Schedule 5 & 11: $9,326M Equity Investments, $487M 9M Equity Income, +$1B Buyback)","url":"https://investor.altria.com/press-releases/news-details/2026/Altria-Reports-2026-Third-Quarter-and-Nine-Months-Results-Announces-Expanded-Share-Repurchase-Program-Raises-2026-Full-Year-Earnings-Guidance/default.aspx"},{"label":"Altria Corporate Heritage & Strategic Milestones (IQOS Rights Assignment & Horizon Timeline)","url":"https://www.altria.com/about-altria/our-heritage"}],"quickJumpZh":[{"sec":"sec-00","title":"00 战略定评：2027–2030 终局产品矩阵","sub":"75%控股Horizon · Proper Wild >2.5万店 · $9.3B股权"},{"sec":"sec-01","title":"01 Ploom 硬件 × 万宝路烟支与功能饮架构","sub":"日烟无刀片主机+美产万宝路烟支 · 6601 Ventures"},{"sec":"sec-02","title":"02 四大远期增长支柱与加热烟草雷达","sub":"美国独占万宝路商标权压制 PMI TEREA"},{"sec":"sec-03","title":"03 美国加热不燃烧与跨界功能快消对比","sub":"对比 PMI IQOS ILUMA、5-hour ENERGY 与 ABI"},{"sec":"sec-04","title":"04 加热烟支转化率与跨界分销模拟器","sub":"万宝路存量1%–12%转化弹性与现金流推演"},{"sec":"sec-05","title":"05 从 $27 亿告别 IQOS 到 NACS 2026 实机首秀","sub":"四年四步战略大腾挪全复盘"},{"sec":"sec-06","title":"06 加热不燃烧与 2028 新物种核查清单","sub":"6项FDA审批、5款非烟目标与降本核验"},{"sec":"sec-07","title":"07 官方管线、NACS 实拍与 SEC 信源索引","sub":"NACS 前线实拍、官网与季报资产表直达"}],"quickJumpEn":[{"sec":"sec-00","title":"00 Verdict: 2027–2030 Strategic Horizon","sub":"75% Horizon JV · >25K Proper Wild doors · $9.33B equity"},{"sec":"sec-01","title":"01 Ploom × Marlboro & Functional Energy Tech","sub":"JT HeatFlow device + PM USA Marlboro sticks + RIOT"},{"sec":"sec-02","title":"02 4 Future-Growth Pillars & HTP Radar","sub":"Exclusive US Marlboro IP vs. PMI's TEREA"},{"sec":"sec-03","title":"03 US Heated Tobacco & Functional CPG Matrix","sub":"Benchmarking IQOS ILUMA, 5-hour ENERGY & ABI"},{"sec":"sec-04","title":"04 Heated Stick Conversion & Beyond Simulator","sub":"Marlboro conversion sensitivity & ABI cashflow model"},{"sec":"sec-05","title":"05 From $2.7B IQOS Exit to NACS 2026 Showcase","sub":"4-year strategic pivot into majority-owned platforms"},{"sec":"sec-06","title":"06 HTP & 2028 Beyond-Nicotine Checklist","sub":"6-point FDA MGO/MRTPA & 5-product goal checklist"},{"sec":"sec-07","title":"07 Official Pipeline, NACS & SEC Sources","sub":"Direct links to NACS 2026 report & SEC balance sheet"}]}];
    var IP_MAP = {};
    for (var _i = 0; _i < ALL_IPS.length; _i++) {
      IP_MAP[ALL_IPS[_i].id] = ALL_IPS[_i];
    }

    var state = {
      ipId: ALL_IPS[0].id,
      lang: 'zh',
      theme: 'light',
      density: 'comfortable',
      ch1View: 'viewA',
      ch1Series: { s1: true, s2: true },
      activePillar: 0,
      radarSeries: { s0: true, s1: true, s2: true },
      peerFilter: 'all',
      peerQuery: '',
      epsSeries: { rev: true, oci: true },
      sim: {
        views: ALL_IPS[0].ch4.sim.presets.p2.views,
        v_per_view: ALL_IPS[0].ch4.sim.presets.p2.v_per_view,
        ancillary_m: ALL_IPS[0].ch4.sim.presets.p2.ancillary_m,
        years: ALL_IPS[0].ch4.sim.presets.p2.years,
        transmedia: ALL_IPS[0].ch4.sim.presets.p2.transmedia,
        preset: 'p2'
      },
      checks: [true, true, true, true, false, false]
    };

    function curIp() { return IP_MAP[state.ipId] || ALL_IPS[0]; }
    function isEn() { return state.lang === 'en'; }
    function isExportedSingle() { return !document.getElementById('ipHubSwitcher'); }

    function safeGetStorage(key) {
      try { return window.localStorage.getItem(key); } catch (e) { return null; }
    }
    function safeSetStorage(key, val) {
      try { window.localStorage.setItem(key, val); } catch (e) {}
    }

    function loadChecksForIp(ip) {
      var raw = safeGetStorage(ip.checkKey);
      if (raw) {
        try {
          var parsed = JSON.parse(raw);
          if (Array.isArray(parsed) && parsed.length === ip.ch6.items_zh.length) {
            return parsed.map(Boolean);
          }
        } catch (e) {}
      }
      return [true, true, true, true, false, false];
    }

    var toastTimer = null;
    function showToast(msg) {
      var el = document.getElementById('muiSnackbar');
      if (!el) return;
      el.textContent = msg;
      el.classList.add('show');
      if (toastTimer) clearTimeout(toastTimer);
      toastTimer = setTimeout(function () { el.classList.remove('show'); }, 2600);
    }

    function escapeHtml(str) {
      return String(str)
        .replace(/&/g, '&amp;')
        .replace(/</g, '&lt;')
        .replace(/>/g, '&gt;')
        .replace(/"/g, '&quot;');
    }

    function getRichMap(ip) {
      if (ip._richMap) return ip._richMap;
      var rm = {
        hero_h1: { zh: ip.hero.h1_zh, en: ip.hero.h1_en },
        lead_prose: { zh: ip.hero.lead_zh, en: ip.hero.lead_en },
        ch1_alert: { zh: ip.ch1.alert_zh, en: ip.ch1.alert_en },
        moat_pos: { zh: ip.ch4.moat_pos_zh, en: ip.ch4.moat_pos_en },
        moat_risk: { zh: ip.ch4.moat_risk_zh, en: ip.ch4.moat_risk_en }
      };
      for (var i = 0; i < ip.hero.kpis.length; i++) rm['kpi_desc_' + i] = { zh: ip.hero.kpis[i].desc_zh, en: ip.hero.kpis[i].desc_en };
      for (var j = 0; j < ip.ch1.principles.length; j++) rm['pr_desc_' + j] = { zh: ip.ch1.principles[j].desc_zh, en: ip.ch1.principles[j].desc_en };
      for (var k = 0; k < ip.ch1.matrix_cards.length; k++) rm['mc_body_' + k] = { zh: ip.ch1.matrix_cards[k].body_zh, en: ip.ch1.matrix_cards[k].body_en };
      for (var a = 0; a < ip.ch5.acts.length; a++) rm['act_desc_' + a] = { zh: ip.ch5.acts[a].desc_zh, en: ip.ch5.acts[a].desc_en };
      for (var b = 0; b < ip.ch5.battles.length; b++) rm['bat_desc_' + b] = { zh: ip.ch5.battles[b].desc_zh, en: ip.ch5.battles[b].desc_en };
      ip._richMap = rm;
      return rm;
    }

    function biSpan(zh, en, cls, tag) {
      var t = tag || 'span';
      var cAttr = cls ? (' class="' + cls + '"') : '';
      return '<' + t + cAttr + ' data-i18n-zh="' + escapeHtml(zh) + '" data-i18n-en="' + escapeHtml(en) + '">' + escapeHtml(zh) + '</' + t + '>';
    }

    function buildSectionsHtmlForIp(ip) {
      var chipCls = ['mui-chip-primary', 'mui-chip-success', 'mui-chip-warning', 'mui-chip-violet'];
      var iconSvgs = [
        '<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z"/><path d="M2 17l10 5 10-5"/><path d="M2 12l10 5 10-5"/></svg>',
        '<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/></svg>',
        '<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>'
      ];
      var iconStyles = [
        '',
        'style="color: var(--mui-success-text); background: var(--mui-success-bg); border-color: var(--mui-success-border);"',
        'style="color: var(--mui-warning-text); background: var(--mui-warning-bg); border-color: var(--mui-warning-border);"'
      ];

      var thesisHtml = ip.hero.thesis_cards.map(function (tc, i) {
        return '<div class="feature-card"><div class="mui-avatar-icon" ' + iconStyles[i % 3] + '>' + iconSvgs[i % 3] + '</div>' +
          biSpan(tc.title_zh, tc.title_en, '', 'h3') + biSpan(tc.desc_zh, tc.desc_en, '', 'p') + '</div>';
      }).join('');

      var kpiHtml = ip.hero.kpis.map(function (kp, i) {
        return '<div class="mui-paper mui-card-interactive kpi-card"><div class="kpi-top">' +
          biSpan(kp.label_zh, kp.label_en, 'kpi-label') +
          biSpan(kp.badge_zh, kp.badge_en, 'mui-chip ' + chipCls[i % 4] + ' mono') +
          '</div>' + biSpan(kp.val_zh, kp.val_en, 'kpi-value mono', 'div') +
          '<p class="kpi-desc" data-i18n-rich="kpi_desc_' + i + '">' + kp.desc_zh + '</p></div>';
      }).join('');

      var nodesHtml = ip.ch1.nodes.map(function (nd) {
        return '<div class="arch-node">' +
          biSpan(nd.tag_zh, nd.tag_en, 'arch-node-tag mono', 'div') +
          biSpan(nd.name_zh, nd.name_en, 'arch-node-name', 'div') +
          biSpan(nd.desc_zh, nd.desc_en, 'arch-node-desc', 'div') + '</div>';
      }).join('');

      var pBarsHtml = ip.ch1.platform_bars.map(function (pb) {
        return '<div class="arch-platform">' + biSpan(pb.title_zh, pb.title_en, '', 'strong') + biSpan(pb.sub_zh, pb.sub_en, '') + '</div>';
      }).join('');

      var prinHtml = ip.ch1.principles.map(function (pr, i) {
        return '<div class="feature-card">' + biSpan(pr.title_zh, pr.title_en, '', 'h3') + '<p data-i18n-rich="pr_desc_' + i + '">' + pr.desc_zh + '</p></div>';
      }).join('');

      var matHtml = ip.ch1.matrix_cards.map(function (mc, i) {
        return '<div class="matrix-card"><div class="matrix-card-head">' +
          biSpan(mc.title_zh, mc.title_en, 'matrix-card-title', 'div') +
          biSpan(mc.badge_zh, mc.badge_en, 'mui-chip ' + chipCls[i % 4] + ' mono') +
          '</div><p class="matrix-card-body" data-i18n-rich="mc_body_' + i + '">' + mc.body_zh + '</p>' +
          '<button type="button" class="collapse-toggle" data-collapse-target="matrixDetail' + (i + 1) + '"><span>展开微观机制拆解</span> <span>⌄</span></button>' +
          '<div id="matrixDetail' + (i + 1) + '" class="collapse-panel" data-i18n-zh="' + escapeHtml(mc.detail_zh) + '" data-i18n-en="' + escapeHtml(mc.detail_en) + '">' + escapeHtml(mc.detail_zh) + '</div></div>';
      }).join('');

      var pilHtml = ip.ch2.pillars.map(function (pl, i) {
        return '<button type="button" class="pillar-card' + (i === 0 ? ' active' : '') + '" data-pillar="' + i + '"><div class="pillar-head">' +
          biSpan(pl.title_zh, pl.title_en, 'pillar-title') +
          biSpan(pl.badge_zh, pl.badge_en, 'mui-chip ' + chipCls[i % 4] + ' mono') +
          '</div>' + biSpan(pl.desc_zh, pl.desc_en, 'pillar-desc', 'p') + '</button>';
      }).join('');

      var econColors = ['var(--mui-primary-lighter)', 'var(--mui-success-text)', 'var(--mui-warning-text)', 'var(--mui-violet-text)'];
      var econHtml = ip.ch4.econ_cards.map(function (ec, i) {
        return '<div class="mui-paper kpi-card">' +
          biSpan(ec.label_zh, ec.label_en, 'kpi-label mono') +
          '<div class="kpi-value mono" style="color:' + econColors[i % 4] + ';" data-i18n-zh="' + escapeHtml(ec.val_zh) + '" data-i18n-en="' + escapeHtml(ec.val_en) + '">' + escapeHtml(ec.val_zh) + '</div>' +
          biSpan(ec.desc_zh, ec.desc_en, 'kpi-desc', 'p') + '</div>';
      }).join('');

      var dotStyles = ['', 'style="background:#0284C7;"', 'style="background:#16A34A;"'];
      var actChips = ['mono', 'mui-chip-primary mono', 'mui-chip-success mono'];
      var actsHtml = ip.ch5.acts.map(function (act, i) {
        return '<div class="timeline-step"><span class="timeline-dot" ' + dotStyles[i % 3] + '></span>' +
          '<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;margin-bottom:6px;">' +
          '<strong style="font-size:0.95rem;" data-i18n-zh="' + escapeHtml(act.title_zh) + '" data-i18n-en="' + escapeHtml(act.title_en) + '">' + escapeHtml(act.title_zh) + '</strong>' +
          biSpan(act.badge_zh, act.badge_en, 'mui-chip ' + actChips[i % 3]) +
          '</div><p style="font-size:0.84rem;color:var(--text-secondary);" data-i18n-rich="act_desc_' + i + '">' + act.desc_zh + '</p></div>';
      }).join('');

      var batChips = ['mui-chip-error', 'mui-chip-success', 'mui-chip-warning', 'mui-chip-primary'];
      var batsHtml = ip.ch5.battles.map(function (bat, i) {
        return '<div class="feature-card"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;">' +
          biSpan(bat.tag_zh, bat.tag_en, 'mui-chip ' + batChips[i % 4] + ' mono') +
          '<span class="mono" style="font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--text-muted);" data-i18n-zh="' + escapeHtml(bat.sub_zh) + '" data-i18n-en="' + escapeHtml(bat.sub_en) + '">' + escapeHtml(bat.sub_zh) + '</span>' +
          '</div>' + biSpan(bat.title_zh, bat.title_en, '', 'h3') + '<p data-i18n-rich="bat_desc_' + i + '">' + bat.desc_zh + '</p></div>';
      }).join('');

      var lawP = [['产品铁律一：', 'Product Law 01: '], ['产品铁律二：', 'Product Law 02: '], ['产品铁律三：', 'Product Law 03: ']];
      var lawsHtml = ip.ch5.laws.map(function (lw, i) {
        return '<div class="mui-alert"><div>' + biSpan(lawP[i % 3][0], lawP[i % 3][1], '', 'strong') + biSpan(lw.zh, lw.en, '') + '</div></div>';
      }).join('');

      var srcHtml = ip.sources.map(function (sr, idx) {
        var nStr = (idx + 1) < 10 ? ('0' + (idx + 1)) : String(idx + 1);
        return '<li><span class="mono">[' + nStr + ']</span><a href="' + escapeHtml(sr.url) + '" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">' + escapeHtml(sr.label) + ' ↗</a></li>';
      }).join('');

      var sc = ip.ch4.sim;
      var p1 = sc.presets.p1, p2 = sc.presets.p2, p3 = sc.presets.p3;

      return '<section id="sec-00" class="mui-paper hero-card section-block">' +
        '<div class="status-strip">' +
          biSpan(ip.hero.strip1_zh, ip.hero.strip1_en, 'mui-chip mui-chip-primary') +
          biSpan(ip.hero.strip2_zh, ip.hero.strip2_en, 'mui-chip') +
          biSpan(ip.hero.strip3_zh, ip.hero.strip3_en, 'mui-chip mui-chip-success mono') +
        '</div>' +
        '<div class="hero-overline mono">' + biSpan(ip.hero.overline_zh, ip.hero.overline_en, '') + '</div>' +
        '<h1 class="hero-h1" data-i18n-rich="hero_h1">' + ip.hero.h1_zh + '</h1>' +
        '<p class="lead-prose" data-i18n-rich="lead_prose">' + ip.hero.lead_zh + '</p>' +
        '<div class="grid-3" style="margin-bottom: 18px;">' + thesisHtml + '</div>' +
        '<div class="grid-4">' + kpiHtml + '</div></section>' +

        '<section id="sec-01" class="mui-paper section-block"><div class="sec-header"><div>' +
          '<div class="sec-eyebrow mono">' + escapeHtml(ip.ch1.eyebrow) + '</div>' +
          biSpan(ip.ch1.h2_zh, ip.ch1.h2_en, 'sec-h2', 'h2') +
          biSpan(ip.ch1.sub_zh, ip.ch1.sub_en, 'sec-sub', 'p') +
        '</div>' + biSpan(ip.ch1.badge_zh, ip.ch1.badge_en, 'mui-chip mui-chip-primary mono') + '</div>' +
